$longDescription=@longDescription[$clAttrModifiers];


UPDATE Product; code[unique = true]; $longDescription; $catalogVersion
;	000000000300089862	;	"	<p>In optimal health, the body's natural production of PEA is in homeostasis. This balance can be compromised due to negative stimuli. As a result, the response to this threat of imbalance can cause a deficiency in PEA production. Supplementation of PEA works with the body to support this delicate balance, calm discomfort, and promote levels for wellbeing.*</p> <p>Enzyme Science’s (PEA)+ is a unique blend of PEA, from safflower seed, paired with the wellresearched and bioavailable curcumin, Meriva Phytosome. In combination with Meriva Curcumin, <strong>this formula provides natural support for the entire body, focusing on the nervous, immune, and muscular systems.*</strong></p>"
;	000000000300086536	;	"	<p>Dentalcidin<sup>®</sup> professional-strength toothpaste is powered by Biocidin® 18. This broadspectrum blend of botanicals balances the oral microbiome and supports the removal of harmful microorganisms. Dentalcidin® Toothpaste tackles plaque, whitens teeth, and freshens breath.</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li> <p class=""p1"">Natural, plant-based, and fluoride-free</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Suitable for sensitive teeth</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Refreshing natural mint flavor</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300088766	;	"	<p>200 mg of Zen contains gamma-aminobutyric acid (GABA) and theanine (glutamic acid gammaethylamide), an amino acid derivative found naturally in green tea (<em>Camellia sinensis</em>). Together they help support healthy moods and a feeling of relaxation without sedation, whether during the day or the night.* Each serving contains 550 mg of GABA and 200 mg L-Theanine.</p>"
;	000000000300092014	;	"	<p>Gaia Herbs’ <em>Astragalus</em> Supreme is specially designed to provide deep-level immune support while assisting the body in adapting to daily stress.* The herbs in this formula work together to encourage overall immune system health, stamina, and endurance to physical and emotional stress.* <em>Astragalus</em> Supreme also provides antioxidant protection to cells and tissues.*</p>"
;	000000000300085541	;	"	<p>40,000 VOLTS! Electrolyte Concentrate can turn any beverage into an electrolyte sports replacement drink. 40,000 VOLTS! is created by blending concentrated Ionic Trace Minerals complex and Utah Sea Minerals™ in a base of liquid potassium chloride.</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">More potent formula than before! Helps boost stamina, energy, and</p> <p class=""p1"">endurance lost through electrolyte depletion.‡</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Sodium</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Potassium</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Magnesium</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Chloride</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Reduces muscle cramps‡</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Also helps relieve night muscle cramps‡</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300000087	;	"	<p><strong>5-HTP CR</strong> has a delivery system that releases 5-HTP slowly and steadily over a period of time. 5-HTP is a drug-free amino acid derived from a plant that naturally increases the body’s level of serotonin, the chemical messenger that affects emotions, behavior, appetite, and sleep. Today’s stress-filled lifestyles and dietary practices may negatively affect how the body handles serotonin. Regular use of XYMOGEN<sup>®</sup>’s 5-HTP CR helps promote a more positive outlook and greater appetite control.*</p>"
;	000000000300092928	;	"	<p>Compounds in Boswellia extract have been shown to bind directly to 5-LOX, an enzyme that transforms fatty acids into inflammatory factors like leukotriene B4. A compound in boswellia called AKBA is the key to this beneficial action. Each 100 mg vegetarian capsule of 5-LOX Inhibitor with ApresFlex<sup>® </sup>is standardized to provide 20% of active AKBA from boswellia.</p>"
;	000000000300000088	;	"	<p><strong>5-MTHF</strong>, provided as Quatrefolic, is the most biologically active form of the water-soluble B vitamin, folic acid. It is the preferred form of folate supplementation due to an array of conditions that can limit conversion or absorption of folic acid. Data indicate that supplementing with 5-MTHF increases plasma folate more effectively than folic acid.*</p>"
;	000000000300000089	;	"	<p><strong>5-MTHF ES</strong> provides 17,000 mcg of 5-MTHF (5-methyltetrahydrofolate) per serving. 5-MTHF is the most biologically active form of the water-soluble B vitamin, folate;  and it may be the preferred form for those with variations in digestion, absorption, or folate metabolism. Data suggest that in comparison to synthetic folic acid, 5-MTHF increases plasma folate more effectively. In this formula, 5-MTHF is provided as Quatrefolic<sup>®</sup>—the glucosamine salt of 5-MTHF. Quatrefolic has demonstrated greater stability, solubility, and bioavailability when compared to calcium salt forms of 5-MTHF.*</p>"
;	000000000300000086	;	"	<p><strong>5-MTHF Plus B12</strong> features Quatrefolic<sup>®</sup> and methylcobalamin in great-tasting, quick-dissolve tablet form. Quatrefolic is the glucosamine salt of 5-MTHF—the most biologically active form of folate that increases plasma folate more effectively than folic acid.*</p>"
;	000000000300000000	;	"	<p><strong>5-MTHF Plus B12</strong> features Quatrefolic<sup>®</sup> and methylcobalamin in great-tasting, quick-dissolve tablet form. Quatrefolic is the glucosamine salt of 5-MTHF—the most biologically active form of folate that increases plasma folate more effectively than folic acid.*</p>"
;	000000000500070042	;	"	<p><span class=""s1""><strong>6 Day Detox Micro Kit</strong></span> is designed to renew and enhance the body’s cleansing and detoxification capabilities. It combines four specially selected XYMOGEN formulations: ColonX<sup>™</sup>, Drainage<sup>™</sup>, ProbioMax<sup>™</sup> Daily DF, and OptiCleanse<sup>®</sup> GHI. When taken together, as recommended within the 6-Day Detox Guide, these complementary formulas work in concert to encourage the various detox-linked systems and organs of the body to process and eliminate waste and toxins.* </p> <p> <strong>6 Day Detox Micro Kit</strong> includes 10 single serving packets of OptiCleanse GHI Vanilla Delight Sugar-&amp; Stevia-Free‡, 1 bottle of ColonX 60c, 1 carton of ProbioMax Daily DF 30c, and 1 bottle of Drainage 1 fl oz.</p> <p>To optimize your experience, the <strong>6 Day Detox Micro Kit</strong> will also include a booklet detailing:</p> <ul> <li>• Each formula and its purpose</li> <li>• The components for a successful cleanse</li> <li>• The benefits of safe detoxification</li> <li>• How and when to take each formula</li> <li>• Optimal food choices and menu suggestions</li> <li>• Delicious, healthy shake recipes for a variety of tasty flavors (though delicious right out of the packet!)</li> <li>• How to implement the cleanse for individuals considered to be “reactive” or “sensitive”</li> </ul> <p> ‡This formula is not a low-calorie dietary supplement. Please see the Supplement Facts panel for more details.</p>"
;	000000000300094456	;	"	<p>7-Keto<sup>®</sup> DHEA is the brand name for a natural metabolite of DHEA, your body’s most abundant circulating hormone. 7-Keto<sup>®</sup> DHEA has been shown to promote healthy thermogenesis, the process of producing cellular energy in the form of heat.* This supplement should be taken in conjunction with a healthy diet and regular exercise program. Individual results are not guaranteed, and results may vary.</p>"
;	000000000300099386	;	"	<p>Biogena 7-Salt Magnesium - the clever way of magnesium. Seven magnesium compounds, perfectly balanced and combined - with a broad solubility spectrum. The solubility of each magnesium compound in this product changes in response to the naturally fluctuating pH conditions of the gastrointestinal tract. This provides a good magnesium supply. * Magnesium is involved in almost all metabolic processes in the cell. This mineral is particularly important for muscle function, nerves and the nervous system, for building normal teeth and bones as well as for the electrolyte balance within the body.*</p>"
;	000000000300085580	;	"	<p class=""p1"">ADE® Cream provides 20,000 IU of vitamin E, 10,000 IU (250 mcg) of vitamin D3, and avocado oil in a fragrance-free formula to soothe sensitive skin.</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">20,000 IU of vitamin E; 10,000 IU of vitamin D3; and avocado oil</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Natural, soothing skin cream</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Free of parabens, PABA, and phthalates</p> </li> <li> <p>No artificial dyes or colors</p> </li> </ul> <p>ADE<sup>®</sup> Cream is specially formulated with the most powerful vitamins and nutrients that provide a natural aid for the skin. ADE<sup>®</sup> Cream contains 20,000 IU of vitamin D3; 10,000 IU of vitamin E; and avocado oil, high in essential fatty acids. Use it as often as desired on your face, neck, hands, and body to hydrate and soften sensitive skin. ADE<sup>®</sup> Cream helps revive our skin's vitality and glow.</p>"
;	000000000300096944	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Nourishing levels of vitamins A, D, K2 (as MK-7) support bone, cardiovascular and immune health as well as calcium absorption.*</p> <p class=""p1"">DaVinci® Laboratories ADK 10 supports three of the most important areas to focus on during healthy aging—bone, heart, and immune health—so you can be at your best.*</p> <p class=""p1""> </p> <p class=""p1""> </p>"
;	000000000300096943	;	"	<p>Powerful combination of vitamins A, D, and K2 (as MK-7) supports bone, cardiovascular and immune health as well as calcium absorption.</p> <p>DaVinci® Laboratories ADK provides a trio of vitamins that build healthier, stronger, more resilient bones.* Bones are constantly under construction—being built, broken down, and rebuilt. Called bone remodeling, this process keeps bones strong despite everyday wear and tear. Vitamins A, D, and K2 are essential nutrients for healthy, strong, durable bones.* These nutrients also support heart health and keep the immune system strong and healthy.*</p>"
;	000000000300084698	;	"	<p>AbsorbAid helps you digest your food faster and more effectively and increases absorption of nutrients by up to 71%.</p>"
;	000000000300084699	;	"	<p>AbsorbAid helps you digest your food faster and more effectively and increases absorption of nutrients by up to 71%.</p>"
;	000000000300084701	;	"	<p>AbsorbAid helps you digest your food faster and more effectively and increases absorption of nutrients by up to 71%.</p>"
;	000000000300084700	;	"	<p>AbsorbAid helps digest proteins, fats, carbohydrates &amp; fibers.  It also helps alleviate digestive disturbances such as gas, bloating and occasional acid indigestion.  AbsorbAid Platinum provides all of the attributes of our original blend plus 12 enzymes &amp; 2 heat stable probiotics.</p>"
;	000000000300085578	;	"	<ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">Helps protect cells from free radical damage*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Provides the natural antioxidants selenium and vitamins A, C, and E</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Includes zinc to support immune system health and antioxidant activity*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Potency and quality guaranteed</p> </li> </ul> <p>ACES + Zn<sup>®</sup> provides selenium; vitamins A, C, and E; and zinc. Selenium and vitamins A, C, and E are powerful antioxidants that help protect our body from free radical damage.* Zinc supports immune system health and is an important component of the powerful antioxidant enzyme, superoxide dismutase (SOD).* SOD repairs cells and reduces the damage done to them by superoxide, the most common free radical in the body.*</p>"
;	000000000300090416	;	"	<p>Acetyl-L-Carnitine is an antioxidant amino acid found in most cells in the body, including brain, nerve, heart, liver and sperm cells.* Acetyl-L-Carnitine supports energy production via the metabolism of fatty acids to yield the universal energy molecule ATP.*</p> <p> </p> <p> </p>"
;	000000000300085579	;	"	<ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">Promotes cognitive health and brain function*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Supports antioxidant activity and energy production*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Potency and quality guaranteed</p> </li> </ul> <p>Acetyl L-Carnitine is a modified amino acid that supports cognitive health, brain function, and energy production.* It also has an antioxidant effect, which encourages healthy aging.* Each capsule provides 500 mg of Acetyl L-Carnitine.</p>"
;	000000000300084959	;	"	<p>Increases ATP in the body for energy*</p> <p>Supports memory, alertness &amp; mental focus*</p> <p>Improves energy &amp; endurance in physical performance*</p> <p>Supplements age-related losses</p> <p>60 vegetarian capsules</p>"
;	000000000300104764	;	"	<p class=""p2""><span class=""s1"">● </span>Support energy production by helping to transport fatty acids*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p2""><span class=""s1"">● </span>Maintain healthy metabolism*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p2""><span class=""s1"">● </span>Sustain healthy brain and nervous system function*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p3""><span class=""s1"">● </span>Support healthy neurotransmitter synthesis*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300085429	;	"	<p>Acid Block contains Slippery Elm Bark and Licorice.</p> <p>Acid Block is a combination of nutrients designed to provide temporary relief* of occasional indigestion.* Alginic acid and sodium alginate react with saliva and gastric acid to form a foamy froth or alginic raft that floats on top of the gastric contents and acts as a barrier to acid and food reflux. Slippery elm and deglycyrrhized licorice act as demulcents which are soothing to the alimentary canal.*</p>"
;	000000000300099799	;	"	<p>Acid Calm™ supports those who experience occasional heartburn by helping to better digest problem foods, while also providing long-term support for the function of the GI system.* Zinc carnosine is included to optimize the mucosal lining of the stomach, acting as a buffer to gastric acid.*</p>"
;	000000000300000096	;	"	<p class=""p1""><strong>ActivEssentials<sup><span class=""s2"" style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">™ </span></sup></strong>is a combination of three targeted nutritional formulas conveniently dose-packaged and providing comprehensive nutritional support. The formulas include Albion<sup><span class=""s2"" style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">® </span></sup>chelated minerals; activated B vitamins; Quatrefolic<sup><span class=""s2"" style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">®</span></sup>; botanicals; and fresh, pure, third-party assayed fish oils. Calcium is provided as DimaCal<sup><span class=""s2"" style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">® </span></sup>dicalcium malate and calcium ascorbate or as microcrystalline hydroxyapatite concentrate (MCHC), DimaCal<sup><span class=""s2"" style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">® </span></sup>dicalcium malate, and calcium ascorbate.</p> <p class=""p1""><em>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup><sup><span class=""s2"" style=""line-height: 1.6em;""> </span></sup></em><em>without Iron<span style=""line-height: 1.6em;""><span class=""s2"">:</span></span></em><strong style=""line-height: 1.6em;""> </strong><span style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">A high-quality, hypoallergenic, proprietary multivitamin/mineral blend featuring activatedvitamins, including folate as 5-MTHF (5-methyltetrahydrofolate), and patented Albion® chelatedmineral complexes in easy-to-swallow vegetarian capsules. <br /></span></p> <p class=""p1""><em>OmegaPure 600 EC<sup><span class=""s2"" style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">™</span></sup></em><span style=""line-height: 1.6em;""><em><span style=""line-height: 1.6em;""><span class=""s2"">:</span></span></em> Is International Fish Oil Standards (IFOS) five-star certified, which assures the highest level of purity,stability, and potency in fish oils. Each fish-gelatin–based softgel provides 600 mg of EPA and DHA. The softgels are coveredwith a GRAS-certified enteric coating so that they are easy to swallow and the EPA/DHA content is optimally absorbed. EPAand DHA from fish oil promote wellness by supporting cardiovascular health, cytokine balance, joint health, and brain andnervous system function.*</span></p> <p class=""p1""><em><span style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">Oraxinol<span class=""s2""><sup>™</sup>: </span></span></em><span style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">An innovative blend of ORAC botanicals. ORAC (oxygen radical absorbance capacity) is a rating developed by the National Institute on Aging to measure antioxidant capacity. An ORAC rating of 6000 μmol TE (trolox equivalents), as found in two capsules of Oraxinol, has been shown to have the antioxidant equivalent of five to nine servings of fruits and vegetables.*</span></p> <p class=""p1""><strong style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">Each packet contains: 2 ActivNutrients without Iron capsules, 1 Oraxinol capsule, 1 OmegaPure 600 EC softgel.</strong></p>"
;	000000000300000099	;	"	<p><strong>ActivEssentials<sup>™</sup> for Women</strong> is a combination of four targeted nutritional formulas packaged together to provide convenient and comprehensive nutritional support.</p> <p><em>ActivNutrients<strong><sup><span style=""font-size: 7.63889px;"">®</span></sup></strong>:</em> A high-quality, hypoallergenic, proprietary multivitamin/mineral blend featuring activated vitamins, including folate as 5-MTHF (5-methyltetrahydrofolate), and patented Albion® chelated mineral complexes in easy-to-swallow vegetarian capsules.</p> <p><em>OmegaPure 600 EC<sup>™</sup>:</em> Is International Fish Oil Standards (IFOS) five-star certified, which assures the highest level of purity, stability, and potency in fish oils. Each fish-gelatin–based softgel provides 600 mg of EPA and DHA. The softgels are covered with a GRAS-certified enteric coating so that they are easy to swallow and the EPA/DHA content is optimally absorbed. EPA and DHA from fish oil promote wellness by supporting cardiovascular health, cytokine balance, joint health, and brain and nervous system function.*</p> <p><em>Oraxinol<sup>™</sup>:</em> An innovative blend of ORAC botanicals. ORAC (oxygen radical absorbance capacity) is a rating developed by the National Institute on Aging to measure antioxidant capacity. An ORAC rating of 6000 µmol TE (trolox equivalents), as found in two capsules of Oraxinol, has been shown to have the antioxidant equivalent of five to nine servings of fruits and vegetables.*</p> <p><em>Ossopan 1100<sup>™</sup>:</em> Features MCHC  (microcrystalline hydroxyapatite concentrate), a complex crystalline compound composed primarily of calcium, phosphorus, organic factors, protein matrix, growth factors, and a full spectrum of trace minerals that naturally comprise healthy bones.*</p> <p><strong style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">Each packet contains: 2 ActivNutrients capsules, 1 Oraxinol capsule, 1 OmegaPure 600 EC softgel, and 1 Ossopan 1100 capsule.</strong></p>"
;	000000000300000098	;	"	<p><strong>ActivEssentials<sup>™</sup> with OncoPLEX<sup>™</sup> &amp; D3</strong> is a conveniently dose-packaged combination of three formulas that provide comprehensive nutritional support for health and well-being especially when higher vitamin D intake and long-lasting antioxidant support against free radical damage is desirable.*</p> <p><em>ActivNutrients<sup><em>®</em></sup> without Iron</em>: A high-quality, hypoallergenic, proprietary multivitamin/mineral blend featuring activated vitamins, including folate as 5-MTHF (5-methyltetrahydrofolate), and patented Albion<sup>®</sup> chelated mineral complexes ineasy-to-swallow vegetarian capsules.</p> <p><em>OncoPLEX<sup>™</sup> &amp; D3</em>: Each capsule provides 2000 IU of vitamin D3 and 15 mg of glucoraphanin from highly concentrated broccoli seed extract, an ingredient found in XYMOGEN’s formulas OncoPLEX<sup>™</sup> and OncoPLEX ES<sup>™</sup>. Glucoraphanin is the precursor to sulforaphane, and it possesses antioxidant activity that lasts up to 72 hours—significantly longer than the activity of vitamins C, E, or beta-carotene. Glucoraphanin also activates the transcription factor Nrf2, which induces increased synthesis of phase 2 detoxification and antioxidant enzymes. D3 is provided as cholecalciferol, identical to the form in which it is derived in the body from cholesterol and synthesized by sunlight on the skin. D3 has been shown to raise and maintain serum vitamin D and increase storage concentrations of vitamin D better than D2.*</p> <p><em>Omega MonoPure<sup>®</sup> 650 EC:</em> <span style=""line-height: 1.6em;"">Features natural enzymatically enhanced MaxSimil<sup>®</sup> monoglyceride fish oil that has a three times greater EPA/DHA absorption rate than an equivalent dose of ethyl ester fish oil. This translates to less fish oil in a smaller softgel for easy swallowing. This IFOS five-star certified fish oil outperforms other fish oils through MaxSimil patented lipid absorption enhancement technology (PLATform).*</span></p> <p><strong>Each packet contains two ActivNutrients™ without Iron capsules, one OncoPLEX™ &amp; D3 capsule, and one Omega MonoPure<sup>®</sup> 650 EC softgel.</strong></p>"
;	000000000300000091	;	"	<p><strong>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup></strong> features a premium, multivitamin/mineral blend of high-quality vitamin and mineral forms selected for optimum utilization. The comprehensive nutrient profile is delivered in a vegetarian capsule and supports foundational wellness; provides antioxidant activity with vitamins C and E, selenium, and beta-carotene; and supports detoxification.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300000001	;	"	<p><strong>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup></strong> features a premium, multivitamin/mineral blend of high-quality vitamin and mineral forms selected for optimum utilization. The comprehensive nutrient profile is delivered in a vegetarian capsule and supports foundational wellness; provides antioxidant activity with vitamins C and E, selenium, and beta-carotene; and supports detoxification.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300000104	;	"	<p><strong>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup> Chewable</strong> is formulated to address children’s unique nutritional needs for growth, development, and vitality and to help close the nutritional gaps that commonly result from suboptimal diets. Each great-tasting tablet provides 22 important vitamins and minerals in active, highly bioavailable forms and is free of artificial colors and flavors, preservatives, and high-fructose corn syrup.*</p>"
;	000000000300000105	;	"	<p><strong>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup> Chewable</strong> is formulated to address children’s unique nutritional needs for growth, development, and vitality and to help close the nutritional gaps that commonly result from suboptimal diets. Each great-tasting tablet provides 23 important vitamins and minerals in active, highly bioavailable forms and is free of artificial colors and flavors, preservatives, and high-fructose corn syrup.*</p>"
;	000000000300090579	;	"	<p><strong>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup> Performance</strong> is a premium multivitamin/mineral formula with metabolically active B vitamins and a bioavailable mineral complex for optimal nutrient utilization. In addition to foundational nutrition, this comprehensive formulation features targeted ingredients to support cellular energy production and promote mental and physical vitality.*</p>"
;	000000000300097923	;	"	<p><strong>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup> Phyto</strong> is a premium multivitamin/mineral formula with metabolically active B vitamins and a bioavailable mineral complex for optimal nutrient utilization. In addition to foundational nutrition, this comprehensive formulation features powerful phytochemical sources, such as astaxanthin and extracts of green coffee bean, green tea, and rosemary, to support the body’s antioxidant and cell-protective mechanisms and to counter oxidative stress.*</p>"
;	000000000300000111	;	"	<p><strong>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup> without Copper &amp; Iron</strong> features a premium, multivitamin/mineral blend of high-quality vitamin and mineral forms selected for optimum utilization. The comprehensive nutrient profile is delivered in a vegetarian capsule and supports foundational wellness; provides antioxidant activity with vitamins C and E, selenium, and beta-carotene; and supports detoxification.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300000108	;	"	<p><strong>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup> without Copper &amp; Iron Multivitamin Powder</strong> features a premium, multivitamin/mineral blend of high-quality vitamin and mineral forms selected for optimum utilization. The comprehensive nutrient profile is delivered in an easy-to-use powder for children and adults to support foundational wellness; provide antioxidant activity with vitamins C and E, selenium, and beta-carotene; and support detoxification.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300000109	;	"	<p><strong>ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup> without Iron</strong> features a premium, multivitamin/mineral blend of high-quality vitamin and mineral forms selected for optimum utilization. The comprehensive nutrient profile is delivered in a vegetarian capsule and supports foundational wellness; provides antioxidant activity with vitamins C and E, selenium, and beta-carotene; and supports detoxification.<sup>*</sup></p>"
