;	000000000300099986	;	"	<p>Apple Cider Vinegar contains “the Mother”, a collection of polyphenolic compounds, along with vitamins and minerals, to help detoxify and nourish the body.* This formula also includes additional beneficial compounds associated with “the Mother” thanks to a uniquely longer fermentation period. Enzyme Science Apple Cider Vinegar comes in an easy-to-take capsule form to eliminate the bad taste and any possible damage to tooth enamel that the liquid form entails. The supplementation of Apple Cider Vinegar also supports a healthy balance of intestinal organisms, likely due to its high acetic acid content.*</p>"
;	000000000300086306	;	"	<p>Apple cider vinegar has been used for centuries because of its many health benefits, including healthy bacteria for gut health, weight management, healthy blood sugar levels, and heart health.† Apple Cider Vinegar Gummies are a delicious way to provide your whole family with this healthy nutrient.†</p>"
;	000000000300092395	;	"	<p>A Norwegian classic—the original fish oil for cardiovascular, cognitive, immune, and neurological health*</p> <p>Arctic Cod Liver Oil is made exclusively from 100% wild Arctic cod. By controlling the supply chain and managing every step of processing, we ensure the exceptional quality, safety, and sustainability of this product, from boat to bottle. This natural form omega-3 oil comes in two different preparations. For patients who prefer soft gels, each lemon-flavored serving contains 600 mg of EPA+DHA. Those who favor liquids can opt for Arctic Cod Liver Oil in a delicious, orange-flavored liquid that provides 850 mg of EPA+DHA in every serving—perfect for individuals who need additional omega-3 support.</p>"
;	000000000300092407	;	"	<p>A Norwegian classic - the fish oil that started it all</p> <p>The fish oil that started it all, Nordic Naturals classic Arctic Cod Liver Oil is made from 100% wild Arctic cod from the Norwegian Sea. No fish body oils or synthetic vitamins or additives are ever used. This non-concentrated formula surpasses strict international standards for freshness and purity set by the European Pharmacopoeia, and is considered the gold standard for cod liver oil. Available in both liquid and soft gels, and in flavored and unflavored formulas.</p>"
;	000000000300091099	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Maintenance-support fish oil for cardiovascular, cognitive, neurological, and immune health*</p> <p class=""p1"">Arctic Omega is a pure, non-concentrated fish oil, in its natural triglyceride form, and is the perfect complement to any healthy lifestyle. Arctic Omega comes in two different preparations. The soft gels provide 550 mg of EPA+DHA per serving, while the tasty lemon-flavored liquid version delivers 1300 mg of EPA+DHA—perfect for individuals who need additional omega-3 support.</p>"
;	000000000300089307	;	"	<p>Helps maintain healthy omega-3 levels for heart, brain, and immune support*</p> <p>Arctic Omega is a great way to meet the recommended daily minimum of omega-3 fatty acids EPA and DHA. Providing over 500 mg of these fats for cardiovascular, neurological, and immune function support in two soft gels, Arctic Omega makes it easy to acquire the omega-3s needed for optimal cellular health.* This pure, non-concentrated fish oil, in its natural triglyceride form, is the perfect complement to any healthy lifestyle.</p>"
;	000000000300084626	;	"	<p>L-Arginine is an amino acid that plays an important role in several important pathways, including the synthesis of proteins, the production of creatine phosphate (needed to produce ATP) and the synthesis of nitric oxide, a secondary messenger involved in blood flow.* A Precursor to Protein and Nitric Oxide Synthesis That Plays a Number of Diverse Functions in the Body, Including Supporting Tissue Repair*</p>"
;	000000000300089964	;	"	<p><strong>ARJUNA HEART<sup>™</sup></strong> is a formulation that has <em>Terminalia arjuna</em>, which in Ayurveda is used primarily as a support for healthy heart function.* Extensive phytochemical analysis shows that this plant has <em>Flavone arjnonlone</em>, tannins, Arjunic acid, and glycosides, the effects of which may be correlated to the observed benefits of Arjuna. Vitamin B-6 and folic acid have long been known to support cardiac health*. Magnesium supports in the production of adenosine triphosphate (ATP), the main energy storage and transfer molecule in the cell*. Magnesium also helps to support heart health and pulmonary function*.</p>"
;	000000000300086095	;	"	<p>We prepare our Arnica Oil from the whole flower of certified organically grown <em>Arnica montana</em> plants. The flowers are milled at the last moment before extraction in cold-pressed olive oil.</p>"
;	000000000300090285	;	"	<p>Genexa Arnica Pain is a real remedy, made clean – addressing muscle pain and soreness, joint pain and stiffness, and bruises and swelling*. Each chewable tablet has the same healing ingredients you need (organic homeopathic blend), but without the artificial ones you don’t (artificial dyes, common allergens, parabens). Founded by two dads on a mission to clean up the medicine aisle, Genexa only uses clean ingredients to make certified organic, gluten-free, non- GMO homeopathic medicines. It’s what people deserve.</p> <p>Genexa is the first clean medicine company that makes medicine with the same active ingredients people need, but without the artificial ones they don’t. It’s real medicine, made clean.</p>"
;	000000000300085874	;	"	<p>ArteMax<sup>®</sup> is ideal for adults who want an advanced artemisinin formula with targeted benefits for optimal cellular behavior as well as support for immune function and whole body health.*</p> <p>ArteMax<sup>®</sup> is a unique blend of three forms of sweet wormwood (Artemisia annua) – a highly purified extract standardized to 98% artemisinin, a concentrated extract (10:1) and a whole herb powder. As the only natural source of artemisinin, sweet wormwood has a long history of use in traditional Chinese medicine to support immunity, digestive health and more. Bioperine® black pepper extract completes the formula as a natural bioavailability enhancer.*</p>"
;	000000000300088765	;	"	<p>A concentrated extract of the leaves of sweet wormwood (Artemisia annua). This herb has been used for centuries in China.</p>"
;	000000000300088763	;	"	<p>Provides artemisinin, or Qinghaosu, which is the active constituent of the herb Sweet Wormwood (<em>Artemisia annua</em>). Good quality <em>Artemisia annua</em> contains 0.3-0.5% artemisinin, so this pure extract provides hundreds of times more of the active constituent artemisinin than the whole herb itself. Allergy Research Group<sup>®</sup> introduced artemisinin to the U.S. market more than three decades ago. Independent cell tests have verified its effectiveness, and independent potency tests are conducted on every batch using HPLC. Allergy Research Group<sup>®</sup> artemisinin is minimum 98.5% pure and does not contain thujone.</p>"
;	000000000300088764	;	"	<p>Provides artemisinin, or Qinghaosu, which is the active constituent of the herb Sweet Wormwood (Artemisia annua). Good quality Artemisia annua contains 0.3-0.5% artemisinin, so this pure extract provides hundreds of times more of the active constituent artemisinin than the whole herb itself. Allergy Research Group® introduced artemisinin to the U.S. market more than three decades ago. Independent cell tests have verified its effectiveness, and independent potency tests are conducted on every batch using HPLC. Allergy Research Group<sup>®</sup> artemisinin is minimum 98.5% pure and does not contain thujone.</p>"
;	000000000300083877	;	"	<p>Artemisinin is a well-known botanical also referred to as Artemisia annua or qinghao. Artemisinin contains bitter molecules called sesquiterpene lactones which play an important role in protecting the herb under harsh conditions. These bitter molecules can protect the plant by disrupting the phospholipid membrane of the cells of pests and invaders, and interfering with their transport proteins and mitochondrial function.</p> <p>Artemisinin also contains an unusual peroxide bridge that is unique among natural products. This is believed to be responsible for its mechanism of action, which when cleaved can generate abundant free radicals that support healthy microflora balance.*</p>"
;	000000000300097160	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Our Best in Class ArthroMax® joint support supplement combines extracts of white mulberry (M. alba), cutch tree (A. catechu), and Chinese skullcap (S. baicalensis) to powerfully support joint health.</p>"
;	000000000300086097	;	"	<p>Calming Ayurvedic herb traditionally used to promote a balanced response to stress.*</p> <p>Traditional support for energy and vitality.* We prepare Ashwagandha extract from the root of Certified Organic <em>Withania somnifera</em> plants. The root is harvested at the peak of readiness, and carefully shade-dried to retain its full color and aroma. Then it is thoroughly extracted. This herb is revered in Ayurvedic traditions.</p>"
