;	000000000300086096	;	"	<p>Calming Ayurvedic herb traditionally used to promote a balanced response to stress.<sup>*</sup></p> <p>Traditional support for energy and vitality.<sup>*</sup></p> <p>We prepare Ashwagandha extract from the root of Certified Organic <em>Withania somnifera</em> plants. The root is harvested at the peak of readiness, and carefully shade-dried to retain its full color and aroma. Then it is thoroughly extracted. The herb is revered in Ayurvedic traditions.</p>"
