;	000000000300096220	;	"	<p>Atrantil is the only natural, clinically proven product to treat digestive issues where they start- in the small bowel.</p> <p>Developed by a Gastroenterologist, Atrantil gets to the root of the cause. It gets rid of the gas-producing bacteria which cause bloating and abdominal discomfort, with/without constipation or diarrhea.</p> <p>This patented blend of polyphenols also works as a prebiotic and postbiotic to feed good bacteria and support overall digestive health.*</p>"
