;	000000000300092596	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Tesseract Medical Research AuRx, Autism Medical Food Powder, 2 Ounces</p> <p class=""p1"">Tesseract Medical Research is proud to partner with Autism Hope Alliance (AHA). AHA has helped to spread HOPE to over 63,000 families by connecting them to leading research, education, and resources. AHA is also the first non-profit foundation to verify and bridge socially responsible and trusted natural products and services to the Autism Community.</p> <p class=""p1"">ASD patients are at high risk for microbiome imbalances where fiber metabolism produces abnormally high amounts of the short chain fatty acid, Propionic Acid and insufficient levels of beneficial Butyric Acid.* High levels of Propionate cross the gut-blood-brain barrier creating a toxic environment impacting brain development and function.* GI symptoms from this imbalance can overlap with ASD symptoms such as alterations in behavior, cognition, language impairment and sleep disturbance. 1*</p> <p class=""p1"">AuRx<sup>®</sup> effectively replenishes the inadequate Butyric Acid supplies, thereby reducing Propionic Acid production and toxicity supporting gut-brain balance.* *These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>"
;	000000000300082097	;	"	<p>Studies have shown that AVEMAR™ Fermented Wheat Germ Extract containing AVEMAR Pulvis™ (FWGE - AP) helps to provide remarkable health benefits for a wide range of serious health challenges, while empowering the immune system and promoting cellular metabolic regulation.</p> <p>Authentic and Original AVEMAR is the only FWGE in the market that contains AVEMAR Pulvis™. It concentrates FWGE to the “bioactive fraction,"" termed Fermented Wheat Germ Extract – AVEMAR Pulvis™ (FWGE-AP). AVEMAR™ (FWGE-AP) contains the active molecules in wheat germ that provide biological activity for health benefits.</p> <p>AVEMAR has been shown through countless studies to support healthy immune system modulation and the regulation of cellular metabolism, supporting the processes of cell differentiation and repair.</p> <p>AVEMAR™ rejuvenates aging immune systems, and normalizes imbalances in cellular metabolism arising from age, injury, and stress.*</p>"
