;	000000000300083864	;	"	<p>Liver is nature's most concentrated source of Vitamin A and is a vital nutrient for skin health.* Vital Proteins' Beef Liver is sourced from grass-fed cows from New Zealand to ensure a natural, high quality, and sustainable source of this ancient nutritional powerhouse.</p>"
;	000000000300097511	;	"	<p>When you hear the word “superfood,” do you normally think of organ meats? If you don’t, you should. Organ meats were the superfoods of our primal ancestors who hunted and gathered their food and ate without waste. They ate everything the animal had to offer, (“nose-to-tail” eating), which provided them essential nutrients, including vitamins A, B, D, E, &amp; K, and minerals like heme iron (highly bioavailable, only found in red meat), magnesium, selenium, and zinc. Organ meats were the modern-day multivitamin. Plus, they possess properties termed as “like-supports like,” which means the nutrients in the organs benefit those same organs in your body. TMANCESTRAL Beef Liver helps put back into your diet what Mother Nature intended, much of which our modern diet has slowly taken out.*</p>"
;	000000000300097513	;	"	<p>Organ meats were the superfoods of our primal ancestors who hunted and gathered their food and ate without waste. They ate everything the animal had to over, (“nose-to-tail” eating), which provided them essential nutrients, including vitamins A, B, D, E, &amp; K, and minerals like heme iron (highly bioavailable, only found in red meat), magnesium, selenium, and zinc. Organ meats were the modern-day multivitamin. Plus, they possess properties termed as “like-supports- like,” which means the nutrients in the organs benefit those same organs in your body. TMANCESTRAL Beef Organs helps put back into your diet what Mother Nature intended, much of which our modern diet has slowly taken out. *</p>"
;	000000000300082907	;	"	<p class=""p1"">benaGene™ with thermally stabilized oxaloacetate, is a key intermediate in the Kreb’s Cycle which is involved in cellular energy production.*</p> <p class=""p1"">benaGene™ is a supplement that contains oxaloacetate, a substance that helps generate energy without substantially increasing the daily calorie intake. This formula promotes genes that favor youthful cells, and is believed to help balance blood sugar.*</p> <p class=""p1"">Through a process similar to intermittent fasting, benaGene™ mimics a low-calorie diet, resulting in changes in the genetic expression of over 350 genes. By doing so, AOR’s benaGene™ helps to slow down the creation and storage of fat and promotes vitality and healthy aging.*</p>"
