ensures optimal</p> <p class=""p1"">bioavailability and targeted nano-delivery to the tissues where it can exert its</p> <p class=""p1"">powerful positive effects.*</p> </li> </ul> <p class=""p1"">*These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This</p> <p class=""p1"">product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.</p>"
;	000000000300085998	;	"	<p><strong>Berberine</strong> is a naturally occurring plant alkaloid broadly used in traditional ayurvedic and Chinese herbal practices with demonstrated benefits for blood glucose and lipid metabolism. In addition, it is used to support gastrointestinal and immune health.*</p>"
;	000000000300095624	;	"	<p><strong>Berberine ES-5</strong> features dihydroberberine (DHB), a highly bioavailable metabolite of berberine with demonstrated benefits for blood glucose metabolism. Berberine naturally occurs in several plant species used extensively in traditional Ayurvedic and Chinese herbal practices; DHB is the natural bioactive form of berberine.*</p>"
;	000000000300085310	;	"	<p><strong>Berberine with InSea2<sup>® </sup></strong>features berberine, a naturally occurring plant alkaloid used for supporting healthy blood glucose levels, and InSea2<sup>®</sup>, a clinically studied blend of polyphenols derived from sustainably harvested, wildcrafted brown seaweed shown to support a healthy glycemic response to food.*</p>"
;	000000000300085689	;	"	<p><strong>Berberine and MicroPQQ Advanced</strong> provides a two-punch approach to optimizing your mitochondrial and your metabolic health*</p> <p>My <strong>Berberine and MicroPQQ Advanced</strong> differs from other Berberine or PQQ supplements in five important ways:</p> <ul> <li>This formula combines two mitochondrial health nutrients essential for their critical roles in up regulating and down regulating important biochemical pathways.*</li> <li>Patented MicroPQQ is more than twice as effective (2.2 times to be exact) as regular PQQ, so 10 mg provides the same benefits as 20 mg of regular PQQ.</li> <li>MicroPQQ stays in your bloodstream longer, nine hours compared to only two or three hours for regular PQQ. Longer blood exposure may mean greater potential benefits. *</li> <li>It is specially formulated to enhance absorption through sustained release of PQQ for higher availability.*</li> <li>It is very stable and can complete thousands of redox/antioxidant cycles instead of selfoxidizing and turning inactive</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300083087	;	"	<p><strong>BergaCor<sup>®</sup> Plus</strong> combines the antioxidant activity of bergamot (<em>Citrus bergamia</em>) with the tonifying superfruit of amla (<em>Phyllanthus emblica</em>). Bergamot is used traditionally in Italy to support cardiovascular wellness. Amla is revered in Ayurveda for its role in cardiovascular health, and this use has been validated in modern human clinical trials. Research suggests that the lipid- and glucose-balancing flavonoids of bergamot and amla help maintain healthy cholesterol levels already within normal range and support healthy blood glucose metabolism.*</p>"
;	000000000300099800	;	"	<p>For optimizing the conditions and pH of the stomach and maximizing digestion in those with lower levels of stomach acid.*</p> <p>Betaine HCl is formulated with a gentle potency of hydrochloric acid, protein-digestive enzymes, and soothing herbs to assist with low stomach acid and soothe occasional heartburn/indigestion while protecting the lining of the stomach.*Betaine HCl also features Mucosave® FG to support and maintain a healthy mucosal system in the stomach.* Mucosave® FG is a patented and clinically studied blend of prickly pear and olive leaf extracts that have been shown to have protective effects by creating a barrier in the lining of the stomach.*</p>"
;	000000000300086098	;	"	<p>Supports healthy function of the digestive system.*</p> <p>Better Bitters: Classic harnesses the inherent power of bitter herbs and delivers them in a convenient spray or drop form. It is a very crisp and balanced formula for the bitters purist. It features Gentian root, popular in traditional European bitters preparations. The herbs in the formula are extracted and preserved with Certified Organic cane alcohol and vegetable glycerin.</p>"
;	000000000300088416	;	"	<p>AMG Naturally's Better Body Butter feeds your skin with an advanced concentration of bioactive nutraceuticals in a proprietary, transdermal delivery system.</p> <p><strong>Benefits:</strong></p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">High in antioxidants to protect the skin from damage</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Provides healthy oils for deep moisturizing</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Promotes smoother, silkier skin</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Promotes skin firmness and elasticity</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Stimulates collagen production</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Prevents age spots</p> </li> </ul> <p class=""p1""><strong>Key Ingredients:</strong></p> <ul> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Plant Retinol</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Grape Seed Extract</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">MSM (Plant Sulfur)</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Hyaluronic Acid (HA)</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Moringa Oil</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Sacha Inchi Oil</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300085615	;	"	<p>If you’re like millions of Americans, you experience episodic digestive upsets such as constipation, diarrhea, abdominal discomfort, gas, and bloating. Many digestive troubles can be traced to diet. However, there’s another culprit: a lack of good bacteria. Some beneficial bacteria are critical to proper digestion and elimination — yet most Americans are sorely lacking in these “ good bugs.” Luckily, there’s a simple and totally natural way to restore balance to your digestive tract: probiotics. Bifilon<sup>®</sup> is a probiotic supplement that features one of the most researched and effective strains in the world: Morinaga BB536<sup>®</sup>, a proprietary strain of Bifidobacterium longum.</p>"
;	000000000300005149	;	"	<p><strong>Bio C 1:1™</strong> combines high-potency vitamin C with a standardized, full-spectrum, citrus bioflavonoid complex. Both vitamin C and bioflavonoids have been extensively researched for their roles in supporting antioxidant and immune function. In addition, research indicates that vitamin C is required for the synthesis of collagen, neurotransmitters, and carnitine. Bioflavonoids appear to support healthy metabolism and cognition by functioning as cell-signaling agents.*</p>"
;	000000000300091241	;	"	<p>Overview <br />BIOACTIVE COLLAGEN COMPLEX Bone and Joint Support** offers a clinically-backed, comprehensive approach to bone and joint health** Developed with a team of leading nutrition experts, this daily supplement is made with clinically-demonstrated amounts of functional ingredients, including FORTIBONE<sup>®</sup>, FORTIGEL<sup>®</sup> , PureWay-C<sup>™</sup>, and Mobilee<sup>®</sup> , designed to increase bone mineral density**1 and help maintain optimal joint moblity**2.</p> <p>Key Features (per serving) <br />10g bioactive collagen peptides (from FORTIBONE® &amp; FORTIGEL<sup>®</sup>) <br />100%DV PureWay-C<sup>™</sup> Liposomal Vitamin C <br />105%DV Vitamin D3 (as cholecalciferol) <br />100%DV Vitamin K2 (as menaquinone-7) 80mg Chicken Comb Extract Mobilee<sup>®</sup> (standardized to contain 40mg hyaluronic acid)</p> <p>Certifications &amp; Dietary Callouts <br />made without gluten, made without dairy, made with non-GMO ingredients</p> <p>Benefits <br />- Increases bone mineral density and collagen formation**1 <br />- Helps maintain optimal joint mobility**2 <br />- Promotes collagen synthesis** <br />- Supports endogenous synthesis of hyaluronic acid**</p> <p>** These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.</p> <p>1 After 12 month supplementation with FORTIBONE<sup>®</sup><br />2 After 12 week supplementation with FORTIGEL<sup>®</sup></p>"
;	000000000300091238	;	"	<p>Overview <br />BIOACTIVE COLLAGEN COMPLEX Daily Foundational Support** is a daily supplement featuring a combination of clinically-backed ingredients proven to promote skin, bone and joint health.** Developed with a team of leading nutrition experts, this formulation combines clinically-tested VERISOL<sup>®</sup>, FORTIBONE<sup>®</sup>, FORTIGEL<sup>®</sup> and PureWay-C<sup>™</sup> to promote collagen synthesis**. By stimulating fibroblasts, osteoblasts and chondrocytes, BIOACTIVE COLLAGEN COMPLEX Daily Foundational Support** can help reduce appearance of fine lines and wrinkles**1, increase bone mineral density**4 and maintain optimal joint mobility**5.</p> <p>Key Features (per serving) <br />12.5g bioactive collagen peptides (from VERISOL<sup>®</sup>, FORTIBONE<sup>®</sup> and FORTIGEL<sup>®</sup>) <br />100%DV of PureWay-C<sup>™</sup> Liposomal Vitamin C</p> <p>Certifications &amp; Dietary Callouts <br />made without gluten, made without dairy, made with non-GMO ingredients</p> <p>Benefits <br />- Reduces appearance of fine lines and wrinkles**1 <br />- Boosts skin elasticity**1 <br />- Improves nail growth**2 <br />- Increases hair thickness**3 <br />- Increases bone mineral density and collagen formation**4 <br />- Helps maintain optimal joint mobility**5 <br />- Promotes collagen synthesis**</p> <p>** These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.</p> <p>1 After 8 week supplementation with VERISOL<sup>®</sup> <br />2 After 6 month supplementation with VERISOL<sup>®</sup> <br />3 After 16 week supplementation with VERISOL<sup>®</sup> <br />4 After 12 month supplementation with FORTIBONE<sup>®</sup> <br />5 After 12 week supplementation with FORTIGEL<sup>®</sup></p>"
;	000000000300091242	;	"	<p>Overview <br />BIOACTIVE COLLAGEN COMPLEX Skin Hydration and Antioxidant Support** offers a clinically-backed, comprehensive approach to skin health**. Developed with a team of leading nutrition experts, this daily supplement is made with clinically-demonstrated amounts of functional ingredients, including VERISOL<sup>®</sup>, PureWay-C<sup>™</sup>, Holimel<sup>®</sup> and LycoBeads<sup>®</sup>, designed to support skin structure and hydration, and increase its resilience to environmental stressors**</p> <p>Key Features (per serving) <br />5g bioactive collagen peptides (from VERISOL<sup>®</sup>) <br />100%DV of PureWay-C<sup>™</sup> Liposomal Vitamin C <br />120mg Hyaluronic Acid (from sodium hyaluronate) <br />1B CFUs Lactobacillus johnsonii La1 <br />20mg Holimel<sup>®</sup> Melon fruit juice concentrate <br />10mg Lycopene from LycoBeads<sup>®</sup> Natural Tomato Lycopene</p> <p>Certifications &amp; Dietary Callouts <br />made without gluten, made without dairy, made with non-GMO ingredients</p> <p>Benefits <br />- Reduces appearance of fine lines and wrinkles**1 <br />- Boosts skin elasticity**1 <br />- Improves nail growth**2 <br />- Increases hair thickness**3 <br />- Promotes collagen synthesis** <br />- Boosts antioxidant expression** <br />- Enhances skin resilience to environmental stressors** <br />- Supports skin hydration**</p> <p>** These statements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration. This product is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease.</p> <p>1 After 8 week supplementation with VERISOL<sup>®</sup> <br />2 After 6 month supplementation with VERISOL<sup>®</sup> <br />3 After 16 week supplementation with VERISOL<sup>®</sup></p>"
;	000000000300092892	;	"	<p>Sovereign Copper Bio-Active Copper Hydrosol includes two forms of copper. By using Sovereign Copper's proprietary blend to include both Copper I and Copper I, it is more bio-available to the body, eliminating the extra work that must be done to convert it from one state to another.</p> <p>Sovereign Copper also presents multi-functional benefits that are important for daily supplementation. Behind it's 4-IN-1 formulation, Sovereign Copper aids in supporting strength of muscle, bone and connective tissue and the promotion of healthy hair, skin, &amp; nails. Additionally, Sovereign Copper helps to support cardiovascular health, while helping to boost energy &amp; metabolism. *</p>"
