;	000000000300086542	;	"	<p>Biocidin<sup>®</sup> is a synergistic combination of botanicals that targets the entire GI tract and supports microbiome balance for healthy digestion and elimination.* Independent laboratory testing has concluded that Biocidin<sup>®</sup> has broad reaching effects, including cleansing biofilms. The formula is available in liquid, liquid filled capsules, liposomal delivery, as a throat spray, and in Dentalcidin™ toothpaste and the Liposomal Oral Care Solution–Dentalcidin™ LS. <sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300086543	;	"	<p>Biocidin<sup>®</sup> is a synergistic combination of botanicals that targets the entire GI tract and supports microbiome balance for healthy digestion and elimination.* Biocidin<sup>®</sup> capsules are Biocidin<sup>®</sup> liquid captured in a convenient capsule. Independent laboratory testing has concluded that Biocidin<sup>®</sup> has broad reaching effects, including cleansing biofilms. *</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">Same base formula as Biocidin<sup><span class=""s1"">® </span></sup>liquid reduced down to capsules.</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Each capsule contains approximately 5 drops of Biocidin<sup><span class=""s1"">® </span></sup>liquid.</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Preferred for travel.</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Supports seasonal wellness.<span class=""s1"">*</span></p> </li> </ul> <p class=""p1"">Often recommend concurrent use of G.I. Detox<sup>™</sup>+ with Biocidin<sup><span class=""s1"">®</span></sup>.</p>"
