;	000000000300086847	;	"	<p>Brilliant Vision is a carefully designed nutraceutical formula clinically formulated for vision and eye health.*</p> <p>Brilliant Vision contains Seanol-P, a sea based polyphenolphorotannin extract.  Seanol-P also has the added advantage of being able to pass through the blood brain barrier, thereby helping to support ocular function.</p>"
