;	000000000300096916	;	"	<p>Great-tasting fruit-punch flavored spray features L-theanine to support relaxation, stress management and restorative sleep in children.*</p> <p>Calm is for parents who need help keeping their kids relaxed and at peace even during the most stressful of times.* It contains L-Theanine, a component of green tea that helps settle the brain.* This amino acid balances brain chemicals important for calm behavior.* L-Theanine also triggers the production of alpha brain waves, which promote deep relaxation and mental alertness without causing drowsiness.* Plus, L-Theanine boosts levels of other calming amino acids such as dopamine, GABA, and tryptophan.* What’s more, L-Theanine promotes a healthy response to stress.*</p>"
;	000000000300000534	;	"	<p><strong>Candicidal<sup>™</sup></strong> offers a complementary blend of herbs, essential oils, and sodium caprylate, a naturally occurring fatty acid. Candicidal is formulated to support the body’s immune system as well as a healthy gastrointestinal (GI) flora. This comprehensive formula contains herbs to support digestion and a healthy GI system.*</p>"
;	000000000300091495	;	"	<p><strong>Candidase Pro<sup>™</sup></strong> supports vaginal and urinary health, naturally helping the body reduce occasional gas, bloating, indigestion and fatigue.*</p> <p><strong>The targeted formula in Candidase Pro<sup>™</sup></strong> uses natural ingredients in a scientifically blended ratio to maintain a healthy balance of intestinal flora.* Cellulase breaks down the yeast cell wall, while protease digests the interior proteins.* This combination provides a gentle, cleansing effect without harsh discomfort common to cleansing.</p>"
;	000000000300083068	;	"	<p>CandidaStat supports the body’s natural system in maintaining friendly flora and a healthy yeast balance. This formula provides powerful herbs and key nutrients to promote healthy and balanced internal harmony.*</p> <p>Featured Ingredients:</p> <p>• Yeast balance support from Caprylic acid, Garlic extract, Oregon grape root, and Grapefruit seed extract*</p> <p>• Unique to the formula is a 4:1 Oregon grape root extract, not commonly found in candida products, but especially useful for yeast balance*</p> <p>• Detoxification support from Milk thistle seed extract naturally promotes reduced die-off reaction*</p> <p>• Immune system and antioxidant support with Vitamin E*</p>"
;	000000000300091496	;	"	<p>CandidaStat supports the body’s natural system in maintaining friendly flora and a healthy yeast balance. This formula provides powerful herbs and key nutrients to promote healthy and balanced internal harmony. <sup>*</sup></p> <p class=""p1"">Featured Ingredients:</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li class=""p1"">Yeast balance support from Caprylic acid, Garlic extract, Oregon grape root, and Grapefruit seed extract.*</li> <li class=""p1"">Unique to the formula is a 4:1 Oregon grape root extract, not commonly found in candida products, but especially useful for yeast balance.*</li> <li class=""p1"">Detoxification support from Milk thistle seed extract naturally promotes reduced die-off reaction.*</li> <li class=""p1"">Immune system and antioxidant support with Vitamin E.*</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300096915	;	"	<p>A unique formula combining herbal extracts, essential minerals and digestive enzymes to support detoxification and microflora balance in the digestive tract. *</p> <p>Candid-Away™ is specifically formulated to support detoxification of the digestive tract to maintain a healthy balance of intestinal microflora.* It combines a unique mixture of Olive Leaf Extract to support immune system function, Calcium Caprylate and Grapefruit Seed Extract to maintain a healthy balance of intestinal microflora, and Betaine HCl for acid balance in the stomach and fiber digesting enzymes (cellulase and hemicellulase) to balance microflora.*</p>"
;	000000000300087711	;	"	<p>Candid-X Is a powerful yet gentle formula designed to restore balance to yeast populations in the gut and urinary tract. It provides a blend of nutrients, potent botanicals, and essential oils to promote healthy microbial balance and immune support. Formulated with the goal of building a healthy gastrointestinal flora, Candid-X includes biotin, a nutrient that inhibits yeast from converting into the more aggressive fungal form. In addition, sodium caprylate is included to disrupt potentially harmful metabolism and create a hostile environment for colonization. It also includes potent botanicals, such as berberine, Pau d’Arco, oregano, rosemary, cinnamon, and ginger, to sooth the GI tract, and promote microbial balance.</p>"
;	000000000300083884	;	"	<p>Transformation’s Professional Protocol<sup>™</sup> Carbo-G is a digestive enzyme supplement designed to help reduce the symptoms of occasional bloating, diarrhea, gas, and abdominal cramps associated with diets high in complex carbohydrates.* The unique Carbo-G formulation was created to complement those seeking a gluten-free lifestyle by encouraging more complete digestion and absorption of grains.* In addition to our traditional protease blend, this formula includes DPP-IV protease activity which helps break down some of the stubborn peptides found in grain that are often implicated in gluten intolerance.* Also includes probiotics and herbs known for their ability to promote gastrointestinal health.*</p>"
