;	000000000300104883	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Cardio Elite is a blend of modern nutraceuticals and time-honored botanicals designed to help support healthy blood pressure, nitric oxide (NO) production, vascular integrity, and micro and macrocirculation.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1""><span class=""Apple-converted-space""><strong>SUPPLEMENTAL NITRATE AND NITRITE FOR HEALTHY BLOOD PRESSURE AND VASCULATURE</strong><br />Dietary and supplemental nitrate and nitrite provide proven benefits to the cardiovascular system. Multiple studies show that supplementation with dietary and inorganic nitrate helps provide sustained blood pressure support. In addition, nitrate supplementation helps reduce the “oxygen cost” of exercise, the amount of oxygen required to perform a given amount of work<br />and may improve exercise capacity by supporting vascular function. Finally, research indicates that lifelong supplementation with potassium nitrate may offer longevity benefits. *<br /></span></p> <p class=""p1""><span class=""Apple-converted-space""><strong>L-CITRULLINE</strong><br />L-citrulline bypasses the absorption constraints posed by the gut and liver and may raise plasma and tissue levels of NO. Through its effects on NO synthesis, L-citrulline helps support healthy blood pressure and vascular function. *</span></p> <p><strong>RHAMNAN SULFATE</strong><br />Rhamnan sulfate helps maintain a healthy vascular system and provides support to blood pressure already within a normal range*</p> <p><strong>TIME-HONORED HERBS SUPPORT MICRO AND MACROCIRCULATION</strong><br />Traditional Chinese herbalism has long employed herbs with beneficial effects on micro and macrocirculation. Microcirculation consists of blood flow through tiny vessels such as arterioles, capillaries, and venules. Macrocirculation comprises blood flow through the heart and large blood vessels – the arteries and veins. Both levels of circulation must function properly for optimal health.</p> <p class=""p1""><span class=""Apple-converted-space"">Several notable herbs that support blood circulation include He Shou Wu, Dan Shen, Hawthorn berry, Ginkgo Leaf, Notoginseng, myrrh resin, Boswellia resin, and cinnamon bark oil. *</span></p>"
;	000000000300091498	;	"	<ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li> <p class=""p1"">Essential nutrients promoting an overall healthy cardiovascular system include Vitamin <strong>E, Vitamin C, Magnesium, Vitamin B2, B6, B12, and Methylated Folic acid (L‐5‐MTHF) *</strong></p> </li> <li><strong>Vitamin E and Vitamin C </strong>work together as excellent antioxidants; they also support healthy structure in blood cells and vessels, and support maintenance of healthy cholesterol levels *</li> <li><strong>CoQ10</strong> promotes antioxidant activity &amp; is well known to support the heart *</li> <li>Botanicals supporting maintenance of healthy cholesterol levels: <strong>Garlic, Ginger, Guggulipid, Hawthorn, and Grape seed extract *</strong></li> </ul>"
;	000000000300086557	;	"	<p><strong>CARDITONE</strong><sup>®</sup> is a combination of extracts including Rauwolfia, which has been used traditionally maintain healthy blood pressure levels that are already within the healthy range and support heart function. <sup>*</sup> Carditone<sup>®</sup> is also noted for having calming properties, due to the inclusion of Convolvulus pluricaulis and rose powder. <sup>*</sup> Terminalia arjuna is traditionally used to support heart health and has high levels of heart-healthy antioxidants; Tribulus terrestris and Boerhaavia diffusa are considered to support the kidney. <sup>*</sup> Magnesium and the minerals contained in the coral support cardiovascular health by helping to maintain healthy levels of cellular and plasma electrolytes, including calcium and potassium. <sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300000538	;	"	<p><strong>CarniteX<sup>™</sup></strong>, a highly stabilized form of the amino acid L-carnitine, supports cardiovascular health, pulmonary function, and muscle recovery from exercise. L-carnitine supports fat utilization and energy production in the mitochondria and is found in abundance in heart and skeletal muscle. CarniteX contains 60% pure L-carnitine and 32% natural L-tartaric acid.*</p>"
;	000000000300088761	;	"	<p>Cat's Claw or Una de Gato (<em>Uncaria tomentosa</em>) is an herb that grows wild in the highlands of the Peruvian Amazon. The native Ashanica Indians have used the inner bark of cat's claw for possibly thousands of years.* Recent research in Europe and China has identified the alkaloid compounds in cat's claw that possess antioxidant properties. Allergy Research Group's cat's claw is derived from only the inner bark.</p>"
;	000000000300108946	;	"	<p>Cat’s Claw V-Max is a targeted blend of botanicals and nutrients designed to support the body’s natural defenses against microbial stressors and facilitate a resilient immune response. Vitamin D3, liquid Cat’s Claw extract, lemon balm, olive leaf, propolis, monolaurin, and lemongrass oil help support a productive immune response, making the body less hospitable to these common stressors.</p>"
;	000000000300096674	;	"	<p>CCDG™ Blend offers systemic and cellular immune support, rich in specific antioxidants supporting healthy cellular pathways in the body. Mushrooms, Green tea, DIM and Turmeric have all been shown to support a normal and healthy immune response, maintaining a healthy, normal cellular state.*</p>"
;	000000000300087854	;	"	<p>Cerebra-GPC is 100% Purified PhosChol with the fatty acids removed. It is a simple formulation of purified pharmaceutical grade GPC and water, which comes together as a clear, concentrated, sweet tasting solution that is easy to administer to adults and children. GPC is a safe, stable, and rapidly absorbed source of free choline, which easily enters the brain and has many functions in the body. It is important for the structural integrity of cell membranes, cholinergic neurotransmission, transmembrane signaling, methyl metabolism, and lipid-cholesterol transport and metabolism. Choline is a precursor for acetylcholine, phosphatidylcholine, sphingomyelin, platelet-activating factor, betaine, and other phospholipids.</p>"
;	000000000300084739	;	"	<p>A superfood known to support healthy blood sugar levels and digestion. Sourced from organic cinnamon estates in Southern India. Research has identified Ceylon Cinnamon’s antioxidant attributes. Studies suggest that Ceylon Cinnamon may reduce insulin resistance in the body and help the liver metabolize glucose. Ceylon Cinnamon has a sweeter, more delicate taste than the more common Cassia Cinnamon. Gluten Free, Vegan, USDA Certified Organic, Non GMO Project Verified, Fair Trade Certified</p>"
;	000000000300091108	;	"	<p>Chapter One Kosher Magnesium Gummies for kids contain Magnesium which supports many functions in the body, most notably the muscles and nerves. Magnesium is also popular for its calming benefits, as well as keeping the bones strong and aiding with occasional constipation. This formula provides Magnesium, a necessary nutrient, in a delicious-tasting apple flavored gummy.*</p>"
;	000000000300091106	;	"	<p>Chapter One Kosher Magnesium Gummies for kids contain Magnesium which supports many functions in the body, most notably the muscles and nerves. Magnesium is also popular for its calming benefits, as well as keeping the bones strong and aiding with occasional constipation. This formula provides Magnesium, a necessary nutrient, in a delicious-tasting peach flavored gummy.*</p>"
;	000000000300091104	;	"	<p>Chapter One Kosher Magnesium Gummies for kids contain Magnesium which supports many functions in the body, most notably the muscles and nerves. Magnesium is also popular for its calming benefits, as well as keeping the bones strong and aiding with occasional constipation. This formula provides Magnesium, a necessary nutrient, in a delicious-tasting raspberry flavored gummy.*</p>"
;	000000000300083064	;	"	<p>Chaste tree berry, also known as Vitex, is one of the most reliable herbs for young women in their reproductive years, to support a healthy regulated menstrual cycle. For the best of both worlds, our Chaste Tree Berry contains the standardized extract and the pure dried powder of the whole fruit of the Chaste tree plant, a popular and traditional woman’s herb.*</p> <p>Featured Ingredients:</p> <p>• Provides an unusually high dose of the concentrated Chaste tree berry extract</p> <p>• Combines the scientifically studied extract in addition to the traditionally used whole berry offering the synergy of a full spectrum herb</p> <p>• Chaste tree berry works by modulating progesterone levels, thereby promoting regular ovulation and more balanced hormone levels*</p> <p>• Clinical research supports the traditional use of this herb for young women, who are still in their reproductive years, in support of healthy menstrual regularity and easier cycles*</p>"
;	000000000300000544	;	"	<p><strong>CheleX<sup>™ </sup></strong>is designed to help the body rid itself of damaging oxidative elements. It features specialized ingredients, such as EDTA, Himalayan shilajit extract, chlorella, and antioxidant-stimulating nutrients. These ingredients perform in concert to support your health when your body is challenged by environmental toxins, such as heavy metals.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300085435	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Chewable Cal/Mag provides soluble calcium and magnesium along with a whole food complex in delicious, vanilla chewable tablets. Two chewable tablets deliver 250 mg of organically chelated calcium and 50 mg of magnesium as well as healthful whole foods such as broccoli, carrot, spirulina, apple and black currant. This formula is particularly useful for those patients who have difficulty swallowing tablets or capsules, or for lactose intolerant children who do not receive sufficient calcium and magnesium in their daily diet.</p>"
;	000000000300085582	;	"	<ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">Helps maintain healthy bones and teeth*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">250 mg of calcium</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Highly absorbable</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Chewable tablets with natural vanilla flavor</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Potency and quality guaranteed</p> </li> </ul> <p>Calcium is required for strong bones and teeth at every stage of life. Healthy calcium intake during childhood develops a solid foundation for healthy bones in the future. Throughout adolescence, our bones grow rapidly, so we can benefit from increased calcium intake. Calcium is also very important during pregnancy and lactation, as well as when healing from injuries. In later years, our bones can begin to lose some of their sturdiness and strength, so a calcium-rich diet and supplementation become even more important.</p>"
;	000000000300096914	;	"	<p>Delicious tropical punch-flavored chewable tablet contains probiotics and digestive enzymes to support childrens digestive health, regularity and microflora balance in the GI tract.*</p> <p>Chewable Kidbiotic is a great choice to maintain a healthy balance of good bacteria in a child’s gut.* Plus, it provides important digestive enzymes that help the body break down milk sugar, fats, proteins, and carbohydrates.* These enzymes help kids’ bodies absorb certain vitamins and nutrients critical for your child’s health and well-being.* Chewable kidbiotic comes in a delicious tropical punch flavor, and since it’s chewable, it’s great for younger kids who hate to swallow pills.</p>"
;	000000000300085436	;	"	<p>Rx Vitamins’ Chewable Licorice is a standardized extract of deglycyrrhizinated licorice (DGL). Licorice has a long history of health-related benefits. Each tablet provides 500 mg. of pure DGL that has been flavored without the addition of any refined sugars. Licorice is listed as an approved herb in the German Commission E Monographs.</p>"
;	000000000300096913	;	"	<p>Tasty cherry-flavored tablets combine Vitamin C and bioflavanoids to support childrens immune health, iron absorption and healthy skin, bones and teeth.*</p> <p>Unlike most animals on planet Earth, humans don’t make their own vitamin C. We have to get our vitamin C from foods like cantaloupe, oranges, or broccoli. If your little ones are picky eaters and don’t eat very many fruits or vegetables, they might not be getting enough vitamin C. In fact, when they eat cookies, ice cream, cake, or pie their bodies might not be absorbing enough of this important nutrient. That’s because sugar blocks the absorption of vitamin C. For an energetic and active child, or one that prefers sweets over fruits and vegetables, supplementing with vitamin C ensures that your child will get enough of this vitamin and all of its health benefits.*</p>"
;	000000000300087092	;	"	<p>ChildCalm is formulated with a targeted blend of nutrients including Vitamin B6, Lemon Balm Extract, Saffron Stigma Extract and more. These helpful ingredients promote a calm state of mind and support relaxation. ChildCalm tablets are delicious-tasting fruit punch-flavored chewable tablets that are easy to take on a daily basis.</p> <p>What does ChildCalm target? Many children are anxious, whether from social pressure, phobias or just daily life. Giving children the ingredients and tools to deal with their emotions is the greatest gift possible, giving them peace of mind.</p>"
;	000000000300088055	;	"	<p>These days, kids are using digital devices more than ever before. This dramatic increase in screen time means exposure to blue light that can be harmful to youngsters' eyes, especially since many children don't get enough of the key nutrients needed to support optimal eye health and development.* That's why Children's Eye Health Gummies combines omega-3 DHA with research-backed carotenoids lutein and zeaxanthin to deliver daily nutritional support for optimal visual health and to help protect kids' eyes from damaging blue light.* These tasty, zero-sugar gummies are individually sealed in shelf-stable packs for added convenience.</p>"
;	000000000300085437	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Rx Vitamins’ Children’s Multi-Vitamins provides a bounty of essential vitamins and minerals to meet the specific nutritional needs of children. Each delicious natural grape flavored chewable tablet supplies 12 vitamins and 9 minerals along with extracts of nature’s most healthful whole foods including spirulina, carrot, pineapple, garlic and broccoli. This vegetarian and hypoallergenic formula is the perfect choice for parents who want superior nutrition for their children.</p>"
;	000000000300099387	;	"	<p>Biogena Chlorella Plus C plus is a quality preparation made from high-quality Chlorella algae combined with concentrated vitamin C. For targeted short-term use to support the body’s natural detoxification.*</p> <p>Chlorella vulgaris is a very special freshwater alga. The green alga naturally contains high amounts of certain nutrients, such as vegan protein, iron and folic acid. Particularly outstanding is its proportion of chlorophyll, which - in contrast to other plants - is distributed throughout the cell. Biogena Chlorella Plus C plus contains a Chlorella vulgaris powder of highest quality and purity, which is cultivated in a patented cultivation system in Austria.</p>"
;	000000000300000551	;	"	<p><strong>CholeRex™</strong> features policosanol, a substance isolated from sugarcane wax that is used to support blood lipid metabolism. It is combined with <strong>OptiMag<sup>®</sup> 125</strong>, XYMOGEN’s proprietary blend of two Albion<sup>® </sup>magnesium chelates. These forms of magnesium are known to be well tolerated and have excellent bioavailability. Combining policosanol and <strong>OptiMag 125</strong> is thought to complement each component's cardioprotective benefits.*</p>"
;	000000000300086588	;	"	<p>CholestBlend features some of the most prominent research promoting healthy cholesterol, naturally. *</p> <p><strong>Policosanol</strong> exhibits many years of positive clinical research in support of maintaining healthy cholesterol levels. *</p> <p><strong>Garlic</strong> has a long history of traditional use supporting a healthy cardiovascular system in general. *</p> <p><strong>Guggulipid extract</strong> and <strong>Artichoke leaf</strong> appear to support healthy lipid levels, contributing to the maintenance of healthy cholesterol. * There are prevalent clinical studies showing supportive action of <strong>Vitamin C</strong> and healthy cholesterol levels. *</p> <p><strong>Pantethine</strong>, the most active form of Vitamin B5, promotes the transports of fats to and from cells; it maintains cholesterol synthesis and promotes thus utilization of fats as energy. *</p>"
;	000000000300085635	;	"	<p>Supports the healthy biosynthesis of lipids to maintain good cardiovascular health. It promotes healthy circulation and liver function.*</p>"
