;	000000000300084623	;	"	<p>Citicoline [stabilized CDP Choline (cytidine 5™- diphosphocholine)] is a naturally-occurring intermediate involved in the synthesis of phosphatidylcholine, a major constituent of the grey matter of brain tissue (30%).* Citicoline consumption promotes brain metabolism by enhancing the synthesis of acetylcholine and restoring phospholipid content in the brain, both of which positively affect memory and other brain activity.* </p>"
;	000000000300087225	;	"	<p>20g of deliciously clean protein in every serving. These clean protein shakes are known for their smooth texture and outstanding flavor!</p> <p>These delicious and clean dairy-based protein shakes are made with milk protein, sourced entirely from New Zealand, where cows graze on pasture year-round and where agricultural practices limit the use of pesticides and artificial hormones.</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1""><span class=""s1"">20g </span>Dairy-Based <span class=""s1"">Protein</span></p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">3g Sugar</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">2g Fiber</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without Gluten &amp; Soy Ingredients</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without Corn Syrup</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1""><span class=""s1"">Made Without </span>Artificial Colors, Flavors, Sweeteners, &amp; Preservatives</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300086558	;	"	<p><span style=""font-size: 10pt;""><strong>COCURCUMIN</strong><sup>™</sup> is a natural coconut flavored drink mix that uses traditional methods to enhance the bioavailability of curcuminoids. Curcumin is difficult for the body to absorb. Absorption of curcumin has been shown to improve when it is consumed with fats, which enhance absorption since curcumin is highly lipophilic. Adding medium-chain triglycerides (MCTs), significantly improves the bioavailability of curcumin. MCTs are a unique form of dietary fat that impart a wide range of positive health benefits including supporting fat metabolism and energy production. Trikatu is a traditional Ayurvedic combination for digestive health containing piperine from black pepper.</span></p>"
;	000000000300090381	;	"	<p>Cod Liver Oil Gems, Super 1,000 contains 1,000 mg of Norwegian cod liver oil, which provides 250 mg of Omega-3s plus vitamins A and D3. The beneficial omega-3s EPA and DHA support heart, brain, vision, joint health, and immune function.* Cod Liver Oil Gems are sourced from the highest quality, wild-caught Arctic cod off the coast of Norway using traditional, sustainable methods. The same day they're caught, our fish are transported to a highly regulated Norwegian facility for processing and purification. Like all Carlson omega-3s, freshness, potency, and purity are guaranteed.</p>"
