;	000000000300096907	;	"	<p>Combines 14 key nutrients including BSE-free bovine tracheal cartilage, vitamins, minerals and amino acids to support spinal health and function.*</p> <p>A unique formulation of bovine tracheal cartilage and manganese with other supporting nutrients for spinal support.* Bovine tracheal cartilage is rich in two types of glycosaminoglycans, Chondroitin -4-and -6- Sulfates. They provide the building blocks for nourishment and support of spinal discs and the surrounding connective tissues of the spine.* Our bovine tracheal cartilage orginates in the U.S. Our raw material supplier documents the origin and health of the animals used in manufacturing and certifies our bovine cartilage to be BSE free. Certification also states that there is no co-mingling or mixing of other materials of beef origin during the processing of the cartilage.</p>"
;	000000000300085586	;	"	<p class=""p1"">DLPA supports endorphins and other mood elevating chemicals in the brain to promote a natural sense of well-being.*</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">Promotes healthy nervous and endocrine systems*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Supports a healthy mood*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Aids in the formation of neurotransmitters*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Potency and quality guaranteed</p> </li> </ul> <p>DLPA (DL-Phenylalanine) contains two forms of the amino acid phenylalanine. Our body uses this nutritional building block to aid in the formation of neurotransmitters. By supporting endorphins and other mood elevating chemicals in the brain, Carlson DLPA promotes a natural sense of well-being.* Each capsule contains 500 mg of DLPA.</p>"
;	000000000300091102	;	"	<p>Zahler’s DMG (N-Dimethylglycine) is a dietary supplement that supports the immune system, as well as circulatory, cardiovascular, and neurological functions. It also promotes muscle recovery and endurance.</p> <p>More about DMG (N-Dimethylglycine): DMG provides oxygen to your cells, which can help minimize feelings of dizziness and increase concentration and energy. DMG is found in the cells of plants and animals; humans produce the nutrient only in limited amounts. Supplementing your diet with Zahler’s DMG improves the nutritional environment of your body’s cells. DMG is also effective in supporting immune system functions and better utilization of oxygen at the cellular level.*</p>"
;	000000000300089552	;	"	<p>Dr. John’s Toothpaste Gel is a fluoride-free gel that uses Hyaluronic Acid (HA) as its main ingredient. As we age, the essential HA present in our gums lessens. Brushing daily with Hyalogic’s formula enriched with HA:</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li>Supports healthy teeth &amp; gums</li> <li>Promotes good dental health</li> <li>Supports healthy enamel surfaces</li> </ul> <p>With no artificial flavors or colors, Dr. John’s Toothpaste Gel is a great addition to any cleaning routine.</p>"
;	000000000300000574	;	"	<p><strong>Drainage</strong> combines homeopathic liver “drainers” with homeopathic remedies that are known to support excretory function. Drainage focuses on the liver, kidney, and colon functions while addressing symptoms associated with toxicity.</p>"
;	000000000300084778	;	"	<p>D Ribose is a natural 5 carbon sugar found in all living cells. The body naturally produces d ribose, which begins the metabolic process for cellular energy production via adenosine triphosphate (ATP). The production of ATP, either through the synthesis of new energy or via the salvage pathway of energy preservation, is rate-limited by the availability of d ribose. d-Ribose supplementation can support increased metabolic demands, reduce exercise recovery time, improve cardiac function, improve muscle recovery, reduced muscle stiffness, soreness, and fatigue post exercise. *</p>"
