;	000000000300084440	;	"	<p class=""p1"">A liquid electrolyte concentrate formulated to mimic the electrolyte levels in your body. We’ve all been there in the middle of the night - you wake up with that cramp that sends a shock through your entire body... Electrolyte loss can be a result of stress, exercise, poor diet, pregnancy, illness, or medications. E-Lyte is formulated with the three ingredients you need to bring it back to the perfect pH balance - Sodium, Potassium and Magnesium. No sugars, no artificial sweeteners, just pure, salty electrolytes in a 16:1 ratio - the highest concentration available.</p> <p class=""p1"">Electrolytes:</p> <p class=""p1"">Fights cramps*</p> <p class=""p1"">Improves stamina and reduces fatigue*</p> <p class=""p1"">Boosts energy*</p> <p class=""p1"">Maintain body temperature*</p> <p class=""p1"">Aids neurological function and enhances nerve signaling*</p> <p class=""p1"">E-lyte works because of it’s balance of Sodium and Potassium. The sodium in the concentrate allows muscles to contract and the potassium relaxes them, which prevents cramping. Our formula mimics electrolyte levels in the body for optimal hydration.</p> <p class=""p1"">E-Lyte can replace electrolytes lost as a result of:</p> <p class=""p1"">Stress</p> <p class=""p2"">Poor diet</p> <p class=""p1"">Exercise</p> <p class=""p1"">Pregnancy</p> <p class=""p1"">Illness</p> <p class=""p1"">Medications</p>"
;	000000000300086910	;	"	<p>EndocalyxPro<sup>™</sup> is a proprietary, patented dietary supplement that has been clinically shown to maintain a healthy glycocalyx.<sup>* </sup></p> <p>EndocalyxPro provides the building blocks needed for a strong and vital glycocalyx, strengthening this micro-thin shield that protects the heart, arteries, microcirculation and veins.<sup>*</sup> It helps keep blood vessels slick, smooth and protected inside, from the largest arteries and veins to the tiniest capillaries.<sup>* </sup></p> <p>This keeps blood flowing freely while optimizing circulation throughout the entire body.<sup>*</sup> It strengthens the glycocalyx and helps optimize the structure of the capillaries, which allows them to exchange oxygen and carbon dioxide, nutrients, and waste more efficiently.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300084656	;	"	<p>ENDUR-ACIN backed by clinical research provides nicotinic acid - the only form of B3 niacin with targeted benefits for heart health and lipid metabolism - in a proprietary vegetable based wax matrix. The unique wax matrix delivery system not only ensures a gradual measured release of nicotinic acid over a 6-8 hour period but also helps eliminate digestive upset and skin flushing that can occur with immediate release forms. ideal for men and women interested in advanced nutritional support for the heart health and cholesterol balance.*  </p>"
;	000000000300090669	;	"	<p><strong>ENDUR-ACIN<sup>®</sup> 250mg Extended Release Niacin</strong> is ideal for men and women interested in advanced nutritional support for heart health and cholesterol balance.*</p> <p><strong>ENDUR-ACIN<sup>®</sup></strong> provides nicotinic acid – the only form of niacin with targeted benefits for heart health and lipid metabolism – in a proprietary vegetable-based wax matrix. The unique wax-matrix delivery system not only ensures a gradual, measured release of nicotinic acid over a 6 to 8 hour period, but also helps eliminate digestive upset and skin flushing that can occur with immediate-release forms.*</p> <p><strong>ENDUR-ACIN<sup>®</sup></strong> is backed by clinical research and may help maintain healthy cholesterol levels within the normal range.* “Flush-free” forms of niacin may reduce flushing, but these forms have not been clinically shown to benefit heart health.</p> <p class=""p1""><strong>ENDUR-ACIN<sup>®</sup></strong> is available in three strengths –- 250 mg, 500 mg and 750 mg -– for easycompliance with doctor recommendations.</p>"
;	000000000300090668	;	"	<p><strong>ENDUR-ACIN<sup>®</sup> 500mg Extended Release Niacin</strong> is ideal for men and women interested in advanced nutritional support for heart health and cholesterol balance.*</p> <p><strong>ENDUR-ACIN<sup>®</sup></strong> provides nicotinic acid – the only form of niacin with targeted benefits for heart health and lipid metabolism – in a proprietary vegetable-based wax matrix. The unique wax-matrix delivery system not only ensures a gradual, measured release of nicotinic acid over a 6 to 8 hour period, but also helps eliminate digestive upset and skin flushing that can occur with immediate-release forms.*</p> <p><strong>ENDUR-ACIN<sup>®</sup></strong> is backed by clinical research and may help maintain healthy cholesterol levels within the normal range.* “Flush-free” forms of niacin may reduce flushing, but these forms have not been clinically shown to benefit heart health.</p> <p><strong>ENDUR-ACIN<sup>®</sup></strong> is available in three strengths –- 250 mg, 500 mg and 750 mg -– for easy compliance with doctor recommendations.</p>"
;	000000000300084657	;	"	<p>ENDUR-AMIDE features niacinamide ( also known nicotinamide ) in a proprietary vegatable-based wax matric. the wax-matrix delivery system ensures a gradual measured release of niacinamide over a 5-7 hour period. Niacinamide is the preferred form for skin health, healthy cell division, and other healthy aging benefits. In this form niacinamide not only plays a role in cellular metabolism and DNA repair but also helps combat oxidative stress and promoted a healthy inflammatory response. Neurons are particularly sensitive to NAD balance. By influencing levels of NAD within neurons nicotinamide may play a key role in promoting healthy neuron funtion.* </p>"
;	000000000300084659	;	"	<p>ENDUR-C 1000mg with Rose Hips, sustained release. Combines high-potency vitamin C, ascorbic acid, with vegetable wax matrix technology delivery system. resulting in a slow and steady release of ascorbic acid over 5 to 7 hours. by releasing small amounts of vitamin C at a time as the tablets travels through the intestine ENDUR-C allows your body to slowly absorb vitamin C. in this way it not only helps maintain optimal blood and tissue levels but avoids excell loss in the urine that is typical of regular forms of high dos vitamin C.   </p>"
;	000000000300084658	;	"	<p>ENDUR-C 500mg with Rose Hips sustained release. Combines high-potency vitamin C, ascorbic acid, with our vegetable wax matrix technology delivery system. Resulting in a slow and steady release of ascorbic acid over 5 to 7 hours. By releasing small amounts of vitamin C at a time as the tablets travels through the intestine, ENDUR-C allows your body to slowly absorb vitamin C. In this way it not only helps maintain optimal blood and tissue levels but avoids excell loss in the urine that is typical of regular forms of high-dose vitamin C.     </p>"
;	000000000300091358	;	"	<p>Enfla-Mend Px is the optimal combination of whole organic turmeric, organic supercritical extracted turmerones, and curcuminoid standardized extract with an enhanced liposomal delivery system. Black pepper and organic sunflower lecithin increase bioavailability of active compounds. This synergy of various turmeric compounds optimizes prostaglandin activity by balancing NF-kB (Nuclear Factor- Kappa B).*</p> <p>Enfla-Mend Px contains a generous 142 mg curcuminoids per capsule, plus 80 mg turmerones. That means even better support for balanced cytokine response and healthy joint and muscle function.*</p>"
;	000000000300089857	;	"	<p><strong>Enzyme Defense<sup>™</sup></strong> Pro is Enzyme Science<sup>®</sup>’s highest potency proteolytic formula. In combination with Vitamin D3 &amp; lysine, this unique powerful enzyme formulation is designed to support immune health thru the proteolytic, fibrinolytic and mucolytic actions of these catalysts.<sup>*</sup></p> <p><strong>Proteases</strong> are capable of breaking down proteins that are dead, damaged or don’t belong in the blood to encourage optimal health and wellness.<sup>*</sup> The mucolytic properties of Mucolase<sup>™</sup> eliminates excess mucus to ease congestion and promote easy breathing.* Scientific evidence demonstrates that the proteolytic enzymes Nattokinase and Serrapeptase can support healthy circulation and speed the body’s natural recovery process from compromised tissue.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300097170	;	"	<p class=""p1"">St. John's wort, GABA, 5-HTP, and methylated B vitamins to help support mental health including positive outlook and sense of calm*</p> <p class=""p1""> </p>"
;	000000000300087710	;	"	<p>Est-Adapt is an estriol-only formula made with food-grade ingredients. Superior to creams in its absorption, Est-Adapt promotes a feeling of youthfulness, increased energy, and better cognitive function. Est-Adapt assists with the transitions of women as they age. As women age, estrogen levels naturally begin to decline as she progresses through the stages of perimenopause to menopause and post menopause. Symptoms often become severe enough to affect quality of life and may include difficulty sleeping, night sweats, weight gain, and impaired cognitive function. *</p>"
;	000000000300091357	;	"	<p>Estro-Px provides comprehensive herbal support during times of rapid hormonal changes, such as the menopausal transition. This unique combination of herbal extracts contains high levels of phytoestrogens, naturally occurring plant substances that bind to estrogen receptor sites and promote estrogen-like activity. In addition, this formula has uterotonic properties and can help to maintain healthy prolactin and progesterone secretion. The formula combines rosmarinic acids, polyphenols, phytoestrogens and angusides, which act synergistically to reduce hot flash frequency and intensity. Sage (Salvia officinalis) provides the added benefit of protecting memory, by inhibiting acetylcholinesterase (AChE) enzymes.*</p>"
;	000000000300092923	;	"	<p>Evening Primrose Oil is revered as a source of Gamma-Linolenic Acid (GLA), which is created in the body from essential healthy fats like those found in flaxseed. For people who don’t adequately produce GLA, Barlean’s Evening Primrose Oil offers a direct source. Studies have found that taking daily doses of Evening Primrose Oil may decrease the severity of cyclical breast pain*, reduce hot flashes* and relieve PMS symptoms and helps maintain healthy skin.* Barlean’s Evening Primrose Oil is non-GMO, pure and unrefined.</p>"
;	000000000300093956	;	"	<p>Your body needs magnesium for more than 300 essential biochemical reactions, but most of us don't get enough magnesium from dietary sources alone. Extend-Release Magnesium is formulated with magnesium oxide for extended release and magnesium citrate for immediate absorption to provide more consistent results from this supplement.</p>"
;	000000000300085694	;	"	<p>That’s why <strong>Eye Support</strong> is formulated with some of the most powerful ingredients out there for supporting your eye health – lutein, zeaxanthin, astaxanthin and black currant.*</p> <p><strong>Eye Support</strong> includes 50 mg of anthocyanins produced from high-quality black currant – the same statistically significant dosage used in a key study on black currant and visual fatigue – to help ensure you get the benefits you deserve.*</p>"
;	000000000300096586	;	"	<p>Haylie Pomroy’s 10-Day Fast Metabolism Cleanse helps to flush out the toxins and get you on your way to a faster metabolism. Nourishes the body, never depriving it. Mix Metabolism Shakes in your included Blender Bottle for two, three, four, or five meal and snack replacements daily. These shakes allow you to load up on nutrients, vitamins, and essential minerals while not feeling deprived.</p> <p>The cleanse starts with a proprietary pea/rice protein, vegan and gluten-free. Contains targeted micronutrients and whole foods, such as organic kale, spinach, and spirulina. Enhanced with antioxidants and anti-inflammatory ingredients like quercetin, rutin, turmeric, and pomegranate.</p>"
;	000000000300096588	;	"	<p>Haylie Pomroy’s 5-Day Fast Metabolism Cleanse helps to flush out the toxins and get you on your way to a faster metabolism. Nourishes the body, never depriving it. Mix Metabolism Shakes in your included Blender Bottle for two, three, four, or five meal and snack replacements daily. These shakes allow you to load up on nutrients, vitamins, and essential minerals while not feeling deprived. The cleanse starts with a proprietary pea/rice protein, vegan and gluten-free. Contains targeted micronutrients and whole foods, such as organic kale, spinach, and spirulina. Enhanced with antioxidants and anti-inflammatory ingredients like quercetin, rutin, turmeric, and pomegranate.</p>"
;	000000000300096585	;	"	<p>A Simple and Effective Kit to Accelerate Your Weight Loss on the Fast Metabolism Diet</p> <p>The kit includes a copy of the NYT #1 Best Seller book, The Fast Metabolism Diet: Eat More Food &amp; Lose More Weight by Haylie Pomroy.</p> <p>Lose up to 20 pounds in 28 days with Haylie Pomroy’s nutrition program and accompanying Quick Start Kit for the Fast Metabolism Diet. On this plan, you eat three full meals and at least two snacks or phase-appropriate, vegan shakes—and you’re still going to lose weight. You’re going to rotate what you eat throughout each week according to a simple and proven plan carefully designed to induce precise physiological changes that will set your metabolism on fire.</p> <p class=""p1"">Includes the following:</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Fast Metabolism Diet Phase 1 Shake</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Fast Metabolism Diet Phase 2 Shake</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Fast Metabolism Diet Phase 3 Shake</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Metabolism Multi: multivitamin</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Fast Metabolism Diet Blender bottle</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">The Fast Metabolism Diet Book</p> </li> </ul> <p>In four weeks, you’ll see quick weight loss, and don’t be surprised to find that your cholesterol drops, blood sugar stabilizes, energy increases, sleep improves, and stress melts away, as well.*</p>"
;	000000000300093969	;	"	<p>Our Fast-Acting Liquid Melatonin provides 3 milligrams of melatonin to support healthy, restful sleep patterns and encourage cellular health. And this liquid formula is quickly absorbed, so it supports healthy sleep faster.*</p>"
;	000000000300104686	;	"	<p>Intermittent Fasting Bar is the only nutrition bar you can eat during your fasting window without taking you out of a fasting state. Based on the nutrition technology of Fasting Mimicking Nutrition, and with over 20 years of research, scientists studied how unique blends of macronutrients and micronutrients could be consumed without kicking your body out of a fasting state.</p>"
;	000000000300090144	;	"	<p>FemEcology is a blend of probiotic species that specifically support the maintenance of healthy vaginal immunity, pH and ecology of microflora, equally beneficial for overall intestinal health maintenance as well.</p> <p class=""p1""><strong>Featured Ingredients:</strong></p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li class=""p1""><strong>Lactobacillus acidophilus</strong> and <strong>L. rhamnosus</strong> promote and maintain the balance of healthy microorganisms in the vaginal and intestinal tract. *</li> <li class=""p1""><strong>Lactobacillus plantarum and L. salivarius</strong> are two prominent probiotic species found to support healthy vaginal ecosystems. *</li> <li class=""p1"">Contains <strong>L. reuteri</strong> - one of the most influential probiotics in maintaining vaginal microflora health. *</li> <li class=""p1"">10 billion live organisms per capsule</li> <li class=""p1"">Formula contains patented stabilized strains that remain in a suspended animation state until ingested orally.</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300083070	;	"	<p>Fem Rebalance is a unique blend of herbs traditionally used to restore and rebalance a womans internal hormonal state. Hormonal balance may need restoring after discontinuing oral contraceptives or hormone replacement therapy, during stress, weight loss, during perimenopause to ease the transitional time and numerous other situations that upset the balance of the endocrine system.* Hormones can also be disrupted by many environmental toxins such as pesticides, solvents and heavy metals. After going through a cleansing protocol to mobilize and excrete toxins from the body, it may be necessary to assist the body in restoring proper hormonal functioning.*</p> <p>Featured Ingredients:</p> <p>• Borage Oil is rich in gamma linolenic acid (GLA), which research shows to be beneficial in supporting hormonal balance for women*</p> <p>• Botanicals promoting regular ovulation and overall hormone balance support: Chaste tree berry, Licorice, Black cohosh*</p> <p>• Maca root is included for overall tonic support for the endocrine system* • Traditional herbal support comes from Vervain and Sarsaparilla, both of which have a history of tonic support for women’s menstrual cycles*</p> <p>• Rhodiola is included for adaptogenic and antioxidant support, especially helpful after cleansing or when hormones are out of balance*</p>"
;	000000000300083065	;	"	<p>A botanical combination to bring forth the historical/traditional uses of three of the most important plants supporting libido in women, but also now documented in the research for promoting sexual function in women.*</p> <p> </p> <p>Featured Ingredients:</p> <ul> <li>Tribulus now shows documented research in significantly promoting several areas of sexual function in women including the domains of desire, arousal/lubrication and pleasure*</li> <li>Fenugreek also shows in research to promote free testosterone and estradiol and shows support of libido ‐ desire and arousal*</li> <li>Maca peruvianum is a traditionally used herb from South America, which also shows supportive research in promoting women’s sexual function*</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300084625	;	"	<p>Fem-Dophilus® contains two patented and clinically documented probiotic strains, Lactobacillus rhamnosus, GR-1® and Lactobacillus reuteri, RC-14®, discovered and developed by Dr. Gregor Reid and Dr. Andrew Bruce at Urex Biotech. Over 25 years of research supports the oral use of GR-1® and RC-14® to colonize and promote healthy vaginal and urinary tract health.* A special manufacturing process protects the probiotic strains in Fem-Dophilus® from stomach acid and enhances probiotic bacterial survival to the lower intestine.*</p> <p>GR-1®/RC-14® and VAGINAL FLORA (also called microbiota) In one of the randomized clinical trials, 75% of women in the GR-1®/RC-14® probiotic group experienced significant improvement in vaginal flora composition, while only 34% of women in the placebo (non-probiotic) group experienced similar improvement.</p>"
;	000000000300084624	;	"	<p>Fem-Dophilus® contains two patented and clinically documented probiotic strains, Lactobacillus rhamnosus, GR-1® and Lactobacillus reuteri, RC-14®, discovered and developed by Dr. Gregor Reid and Dr. Andrew Bruce at Urex Biotech. Over 25 years of research supports the oral use of GR-1® and RC-14® to colonize and promote healthy vaginal and urinary tract health.* A special manufacturing process protects the probiotic strains in Fem-Dophilus® from stomach acid and enhances probiotic bacterial survival to the lower intestine.*</p> <p>Fem-Dophilus® does not require refrigeration and can be stored at room temperature. Refrigeration will, however, extend the shelf life. Avoid temperatures above 77°F (25°C).</p> <p>GR-1®/RC-14® and VAGINAL FLORA (also called microbiota)</p> <p>In one of the randomized clinical trials, 75% of women in the GR-1®/RC-14® probiotic group experienced significant improvement in vaginal flora composition, while only 34% of women in the placebo (non-probiotic) group experienced similar improvement.</p>"
;	000000000300086260	;	"	<p>Through a proprietary manufacturing process, FemmenessencePRO HARMONY concentrates key active constituents in maca up to ten times higher than what is found in regular raw maca, and increases the bioavailability increasing water solubility from 68% to 99%.</p> <p>FemmenessencePRO HARMONY contains MacaHarmony<sup>®</sup>, which includes Maca-GO<sup>®</sup> – the only herbal ingredient to demonstrate statistically significant effects on multiple hormones in periand post-menopausal women in published human clinical trials – and a proprietary combination of other maca phenotypes for menstrual and reproductive health. Instead of introducing hormones into the body, FemmenessencePRO HARMONY nourishes the hypothalamic-pituitaryadrenal axis, supporting the body’s own hormone production.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300086262	;	"	<p>FemmenessencePRO PERI is a highly concentrated, certified organic, gelatinized maca (Lepidium peruvianum) with a proprietary combination of phenotypes specifically for hormone balance and peri-menopausal symptoms.</p> <p>MacaLife<sup><span style=""text-decoration: line-through;"">®</span></sup> includes Maca-GO<sup>®</sup> – the only herbal ingredient to demonstrate statistically significant effects on hormones in peri- and post-menopausal women – and one specific maca phenotype for perimenopausal symptoms. Instead of introducing hormones into the body, FemmenessencePRO PERI nourishes the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis, supporting the body’s own hormone production. With market-leading results, 72-84% of women experienced a highly statistically significant reduction in peri-menopausal symptoms in clinical trials. More importantly, because of the impact on hormones, FemmenessencePRO PERI positively impacted heart and mental health.</p>"
;	000000000300086259	;	"	<p>FemmenessencePRO POST is concentrated through a proprietary manufacturing process which results in key active constituents in maca concentrated up to ten times higher than what is found in normal raw maca, increases bioavailability,  and increases water solubility from 68% in raw maca to 99% in FemmenessencePRO</p> <p>FemmenessencePRO POST contains Maca-GO<sup>®</sup> the only herbal ingredient to demonstrate statistically significant effects on multiple hormones in postmenopausal women in published human clinical trials. Instead of introducing hormones into the body, FemmenessencePRO nourishes the hypothalamic-pituitary-adrenal axis supporting the body’s own hormone production.  With industry-leading results, 84% of women experienced a highly statistically significant reduction in menopausal symptoms in clinical trials. More importantly, because of the impact on hormones, FemmenessencePRO positively impacted heart, bone, and mental health.</p>"
;	000000000300000826	;	"	<p><strong>Femquil<sup>®</sup></strong> delivers biologically active folate and other key methylation vitamins in combination with a targeted blend of ingredients to encourage hormone balance, help modify xenoestrogen activity, and restore tranquility. Vitex and black cohosh provide traditional hormone-balancing support; DIM and calcium D-glucarate promote estrogen detoxification; and rosemary, resveratrol, grape seed extract, and green tea extract provide antioxidant activity.* </p>"
;	000000000300085698	;	"	<p>Our <strong>Fermented Beta Glucans</strong> can help balance and support your immune system.* Plus, it can help build your immune defenses to enjoy improved year-round immune, respiratory and sinus health with its two extraordinary ingredients:*</p> <ul> <li><strong>1,3 beta-D-glucan from Euglena algae</strong> is easily recognized by your immune system and directly interacts with key immune cells.*</li> <li><strong>EpiCor<sup>®</sup> yeast fermentate</strong> contains additional beta glucans and mannans from the yeast cell wall and is clinically shown to support your immune function on four different levels.*</li> </ul> <p> </p>"
