;	000000000300085688	;	"	<p>Enjoy the cooling and soothing benefits of our proprietary FLOW BLEND in our newest addition 2 in 1 bottle that combines our easy to apply spray bottle combined with a roller on the other end.</p> <p>You also receive our 1ml travel roller bottle FREE for your on the go needs.</p> <p>Ingredients are all selected from specific regions of the world at specific elevations and climates to produce the FLOW BLENDS unique results: Blue Tansy, Helichrysum, Peppermint, Clove, Lavender, in our proprietary blend</p> <p>Aroma: Minty, Crisp, Refreshing</p>"
;	000000000300090282	;	"	<p>Genexa Flu Fix is a real remedy, made clean - addressing symptoms associated with the flu such as body aches and headache, fever, chills and fatigue, and congestion and sore throat*. Each chewable tablet has the same healing ingredients you need (organic homeopathic blend), but without the artificial ones you don’t (artificial dyes, common allergens, parabens). Founded by two dads on a mission to clean up the medicine aisle, Genexa only uses clean ingredients to make certified organic, gluten-free, non-GMO homeopathic medicines. It’s what people deserve.</p> <p>Genexa is the first clean medicine company that makes medicine with the same active ingredients people need, but without the artificial ones they don’t. It’s real medicine, made clean.</p>"
;	000000000300086559	;	"	<p><span style=""font-size: 10pt;""><strong>FLUCOMUNE</strong><sup>™</sup> is a proprietary blend of seven herbs combined for their immune-supporting properties. <sup>*</sup> Emblica officinalis, also known as indian gooseberry or amla fruit, is a natural source of bioflavonoids and ascorbinogen and is revered for its antioxidant and immunesupportive properties, as well as for being an adaptogen. <sup>*</sup> Vasaka is included for its respiratory health support, Holy basil and Tinospora cordifolia for its immune-supportive properties and help with a healthy immune response, Licorice for its support of healthy bronchial function, and trikatu for its digestive support, thereby enhancing the bioavailability of nutrients in the digestive tract. <sup>*</sup></span></p>"
;	000000000300108948	;	"	<p>These power-packed brain tonic shots were designed to balance brain energy and support mental acuity, focus and performance while buffering against fatigue and stress. The adaptogenic herb ginseng supports microcirculation to the brain while the natural stimulants guarana seed extract and theacrine provide energy and alertness. They are combined with well-researched adaptogenic and nootropic herbs like epimedium, breviscapine and ginseng to target concentration and feel-good neurotransmitters for an elevated mood while supporting blood flow.</p>"
;	000000000300096903	;	"	<p>Delicious orange-flavored chewable tablet features highly absorbable nutrients, including B vitamins and Betaine to support calm and focused behavior in children.*</p> <p>Lack of focus make it harder for your child to play, perform, learn, interact, and feel confident.* That’s why DaVinci® Laboratories has created focus chewable. This orange-flavored chewable delivers some of the most advanced and highly bioavailable nutrients that your child needs to stay calm and alert.* Plus, it’s non- GMO and sweetened with stevia. Your child will love this yummy chewable and you will love that it’s sugar-free.</p>"
;	000000000300093948	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Unique blend of omega-3s plus key nutrients to promote mental focus*</p> <p class=""p1"">Focus Support is a unique blend of nutrients that work together to support overall brain health, combining concentrated, DHA-dominant omega-3s with citicoline and <em>Bacopa monnieri</em> extract.* Citicoline, an important source of the essential brain nutrient choline, helps promote mental focus, while the herb <em>Bacopa monnieri</em> supports memory and may help reduce oxidative stress in the brain.*</p>"
;	000000000300102456	;	"	<p class=""p1""><strong>Folinic Acid Lozenges by Seeking Health provide 1,360 mcg DFE (800 mcg) of pure, bioavailable folate as folinic acid calcium salt per lozenge. </strong>This form of folate (vitamin B9) quickly converts to L-methylfolate, the predominant form of folate in circulation in the body. Folate is essential for cell division, growth, and the formation of new red blood cells. Folinic acid can easily convert to any of the other active forms of folate as needed in the body.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300000827	;	"	<p><strong>Foundation Essentials</strong> provides 30 days of supplementation in convenient, once-a-day packets. Each packet provides a daily dose of five XYMOGEN foundational health formulas: ProbioMax<sup>®</sup> Daily DF, ActivNutrients<sup>®</sup> without Iron, Omega MonoPure<sup>®</sup> 650 EC, OptiMag<sup>®</sup> 125, and D3 2000. These formulas provide high-potency probiotics, an iron-free multiple, IFOS five-star certified omega-3 fatty acids, and extra magnesium and D3. Foundation Essentials can be used for any number of purposes, such as to serve as a kick start to your MedPax<sup>®</sup> program, basic supplementation while you wait for lab results, or a convenient way to supplement while traveling.*</p>"
;	000000000300084985	;	"	<p>Our Fresh Catch<sup>®</sup> Fish Oil softgels are ideal for people who are seeking the absolute highest-quality fish oil in convenient capsules. Ultra-purified, pharmaceutical grade and retained in its natural triglyceride form, our pure and pristine signature Fresh Catch<sup>®</sup> Fish Oil softgels provide a daily recommended dose of Omega-3</p>"
;	000000000300084983	;	"	<p>With its wholesome, nutty flavor, Barlean’s Fresh Organic Flax Oil provides a whopping 7,640mg of plant-based ALA Omega-3 fatty acid per tablespoon. Omega-3s are vital fatty acids that cannot be produced by the body, so we need to get them from foods or supplements. Barlean’s Organic Flax Oil is an award-winning unrefined organic flax oil, freshly pressed in the Pacific Northwest. There’s a reason Barlean’s is the #1 selling organic flax oil in the world.</p>"
