;	000000000300085692	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Our <strong>Full Spectrum Enzymes</strong> is our one-of-a-kind flagship digestive enzyme blend. It is <strong>scientifically formulated based on USDA data</strong> to contain a broad range of enzymes to help digest different types of food quickly.* The formula:</p> <p class=""p1"">Is designed for <strong>what real people actually eat</strong>, and includes an appropriate allowance for enzyme deficiencies and loss of enzymes due to age to ensure effective digestion without waste*</p>"
