;	000000000300093225	;	"	<p>Gotu Kola acts as a restorative tonic for brain and nervous system. It promotes mental clarity &amp; stress relief and promotes deep &amp; restful sleep<sup>*</sup></p> <p>A nootropic herb traditionally used to support mood, memory, and cognitive function. Called the ""scholar's herb"" for centuries in India and China because of its memory-supporting characteristics. Gotu Kola has been used for centuries as a tonic for overall brain and nervous system support. It is used in Ayurvedic Medicine to balance all three doshas— Kapha, Pitta, and Vata. The Gotu Kola herb has long been prized by students and yogis for its calming support of the nervous system.</p>"
