;	000000000300092594	;	"	<p><span style=""font-size: 8pt;"">Tesseract Medical Research, HepatiSafe, LiverSupport Detox Supplement, 60 Capsules</span></p> <p><span style=""font-size: 8pt;"">Infections, toxin exposures, and oxidative stress can lead to compromised liver function and impaired detoxification, which can often result in non-alcoholic fatty liver disease (NAFLD), a condition that affects 80-100 million U.S. adults. When it is left untreated, NAFLD can cause scarring and fibrosis, and, in extreme cases, untreated NAFLD can lead to cirrhosis and liver failure.</span></p> <p><span style=""font-size: 8pt;"">Tesseract’s new HepatiSafe<sup>®</sup> provides optimal nutritional support for liver function.* HepatiSafe  is formulated with four unique ingredients that have been shown to support optimal liver function, especially the liver’s detoxification processes.*</span></p> <p>The Tesseract Effect<sup>®</sup><br /> Tesseract’s proprietary transport system enables HepatiSafe’s nutrients to bypass the stomach where acid would otherwise degrade much of their integrity. Tesseract’s DexKey™ technology releases each molecule of nutrient at the desired release point within the intestinal tract, thus achieving unprecedented absorbability.*</p> <p>This high level of absorption means a lower amount of each active ingredient is required to achieve the preferred efficacious result. This achievement is an integral component of The Tesseract Effect because the ability to micro-dose allows for multiple nutrients to be contained in a single capsule.</p>"
;	000000000300088148	;	"	<p><strong>Scientifically studied ingredients for healthy sleep</strong></p> <p><strong>Lemon Balm:</strong> In one study, 85% of subjects who took lemon balm extract for 15 days saw a significant improvement in healthy sleep and the remaining 15% were much improved<sup>.8</sup></p> <p><strong>Honokiol:</strong> Pre-clinical models indicate honokiol is quickly taken up into the brain, making it an ideal ingredient for those looking for a well-deserved rest.<sup>9-11</sup> Honokiol has a calming effect on the brain as well.</p> <p><strong>Chamomile:</strong> Computer models and pre-clinical studies suggest apigenin might promote healthy sleep patterns similar to those caused by naturally-occurring neurologically active compounds in the body.<sup>12,13</sup></p> <p> </p> <p><strong>References:</strong><br />1. <em>Soc Sci Med</em>. 2007;64(10):1997-2007.<br />2. <em>Mol Vis</em>. 2016;22:61-72.<br />3.<em> Int J Behav Med</em>. 2017;24(4):481-492.<br />4. <em>Prog Cardiovasc Nurs</em>. 2004;19(2):56-9.<br />5. <em>Neuropsychiatr Dis Treat</em>. 2007;3(5):553-67.<br />6. <em>Obes Rev</em>. 2009;10(Suppl 2):37-45.<br />7. <em>Curr Cardiol Rev</em>. 2010;6(1):54-61.<br />8. <em>Med J Nutrition Metab</em>. 2011;4(3):211-218.<br />9. <em>Br J Pharmacol</em>. 2012;167(3):587-98.<br />10.<em> J Pharm Pharmacol</em>. 1999;51(1):97-103.<br />11. <em>Eur J Drug Metab Pharmacokinet</em>. 2016;41(5):587-94.<br />12. <em>Fitoterapia</em>. 2000;71(Suppl. 1):S117-S123.<br />13. Data on File. Connectivity Map (CMAP) Analysis. 2018.</p>"
