;	000000000300090787	;	"	<p>Key Benefits and Actions*</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li>Provides active B vitamins in potent doses*</li> <li>May help support healthy methylation processes*</li> <li>May help support normal homocysteine conversion*</li> <li>May help support cognitive health*</li> </ul> <p><strong>HomocysteX Plus by Seeking Health supplies bioactive forms of four essential Bvitamins together with betaine (also known as trimethylglycine or TMG) to synergistically support methylation processes and normal homocysteine metabolism. </strong>The body's methylation process is vital for formation of essential cell components such as proteins, nucleic acids found in DNA and RNA, and phospholipids that form nerve cell membranes. By transferring methyl groups (three hydrogen atoms bonded to a carbon atom, known as CH3) from one molecule to another, methylation turns on genes, activates enzymes, drives detoxification reactions, influences hormone secretion, and helps maintain normal metabolism of homocysteine, a potentially harmful amino acid metabolite. Unfortunately, poor nutrition, oxidative stress and various other factors can impair methylation processes throughout the body.*</p>"
