;	000000000300086587	;	"	<p>Ionic Boron is a rich concentrated liquid dietary supplement that provides boron, a trace element, in ionic form – the form most widely recognized by the body.<sup>†</sup> Our proprietary process ensures maximum absorption, while the balanced liquid form provides safety and flexibility.<sup>†</sup> Boron may support healthy bones and joints.<sup>†</sup> Recent clinical studies indicate that boron interacts with calcium and magnesium to promote optimal bone metabolism.<sup>†</sup> Evidence also suggests boron may support normal brain function.<sup>†</sup></p> <p>Ionic Singles from Trace Minerals Research<sup>®</sup> combines high quality single mineral ingredients and over 72 ionic trace minerals in a unique new proprietary process. This unique blend gives the body the type of minerals that it readily recognizes and absorbs fast because of its liquid ionic state.<sup>†</sup></p>"
;	000000000300085553	;	"	<p>Liquid Ionic Zinc is a rich concentrated liquid dietary supplement that provides zinc in ionic form – the form most widely recognized by the body. The balanced liquid form allows for variable dosing. Also contains a full spectrum of concentrated Ionic Trace Minerals.</p> <p>Liquid Ionic Zinc is a rich concentrated liquid dietary supplement that provides zinc in ionic form – the form most widely recognized by the body**. Our proprietary process ensures maximum absorption, while the balanced liquid form provides safety and flexibility. In addition, this product contains 100% of the RDA of copper per serving. An adequate supply of zinc is essential for growth and physical development, especially as it relates to proteins, fats and carbohydrates**. 48-day supply, 50 mg/serving of Zinc Sulfate.</p>"
;	000000000300092893	;	"	<p>IonShield<sup>®</sup>  is an advanced formula with a multi-targeted approach to antioxidant and free radical support. Research shows that environmental and modern technological device exposures can promote oxidative stress and free radical production. IonShield<sup>®</sup>  is a unique blend of antioxidants, botanically-grown functional mushrooms, herbal extracts and biologically-active nutrients formulated to promote antioxidant defense against free radicals and physiological disruptions, and support healthy immune and cellular energy functions.*</p>"
;	000000000300096570	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Key Benefits and Actions*</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li class=""p1"">Gentle, well-tolerated form of iron may help support healthy iron levels when supplementation is needed*</li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Vitamin C may help support healthy iron utilization*</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">May help support healthy blood cells*</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">May help support healthy muscle function and metabolism*</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300083084	;	"	<p>Holistic red blood cell support featuring more absorbable and gentler forms of iron as well as supportive herbs and vitamins.</p> <p>Featured Ingredients:</p> <p>• Elemental Iron in each capsule is 25 mg from ferrous aspartate, ferrous succinate and ferrous fumarate ‐ these gentler forms of iron are easier on the stomach and less constipating*</p> <p>• Includes Vitamin C to promote enhanced iron absorption*</p> <p>• Traditionally used herbs for maintaining iron stores in the blood include: Yellow dock, Dandelion and Nettles; these are mineral rich herbs and they support easier bowel tolerance of the elemental iron*</p> <p>• Vitamins B12 and Methylated Folic acid (L‐5‐MTHF) offer a well‐rounded approach to supporting and maintaining healthy red blood cells*</p>"
;	000000000300000884	;	"	<p>Iron bis-glycinate is a well-studied, 100% fully-reacted, patented form of iron exclusively from Albion<sup>®</sup> Laboratories. The amino acid glycine is actually one of the two starting materials the body uses to synthesize hemoglobin. Therefore, <strong>Iron Glycinate™</strong> contributes two key factors. This form of iron has higher bioavailability, lower toxicity, less food reactivity, less food interactions and has a longer shelf life than any other common form of iron.*</p>"
