;	000000000300096895	;	"	<p>Naturally sweetened liquid contains high levels of EPA and DHA from omega-3 fatty acids to support healthy and brain development, heart health and strong skin, hair and nails in children.*</p> <p>kiddOmega-3 is a monk-fruit sweetened omega-3 liquid that’s easily added to food and drinks. Even your pickiest little ones will enjoy the taste. It boasts a high level of the omega-3 DHA, to support healthy brain function and also contains nourishing levels of the another important omega-3, EPA.* Made from wildcaught fish, it meets the strictest standards to ensure its purity.</p>"
;	000000000300094542	;	"	<p>Kidney Care is a blend of botanicals and nutraceuticals that support healthy kidney function and detoxification. The array of botanicals and nutraceuticals in this formula includes ferulic acid, Astragaloside IV, goldenrod, dandelion leaf extract, Zhu ling, He Shou Wu root extract, and Fu Ling extract.<sup>*</sup></p>"
