;	000000000300090281	;	"	<p>Genexa Kids’ Allergy Care is a real remedy, made clean - addressing symptoms associated with hay fever or other respiratory allergies*. Each chewable tablet has the same healing ingredients you need (organic homeopathic blend), but without the artificial ones you don’t (artificial dyes, common allergens, parabens). Founded by two dads on a mission to clean up the medicine aisle, Genexa only uses clean ingredients to make certified organic, gluten-free, non-GMO homeopathic medicines. It’s what little ones deserve.</p> <p>Genexa is the first clean medicine company that makes medicine with the same active ingredients people need, but without the artificial ones they don’t. It’s real medicine, made clean.</p>"
;	000000000300086553	;	"	<p><span style=""font-size: 10pt;""><strong>KIDS ASHWAGANDHA DROPS</strong> - Withania somnifera, also known as Indian Ginseng, is an adaptogenic herb with benefits for all ages. Ashwagandha can benefit the immune system for seasonal challenges. It also has calming and focusing effects for students and helps calm the mind for restful sleep. * Our careful farming, proprietary extraction technique and great taste provide the quality you expect and a flavor kids will enjoy.<br /></span></p>"
;	000000000300086197	;	"	<p>Kids’ Black Elderberry Glycerite is prepared from the ripe berries of Certified Organic <em>Sambucus nigra</em> trees. To assure optimal extraction of the herbs bioactive compounds, the berries are hand-harvested only when ripe.</p> <p>The products include easy-to-follow dosing instructions based on body weight; simply add drops to a small amount of water or juice.</p> <p>All our Glycerites are made using 100% non-palm glycerin to avoid contributing to global rainforest deforestation. Instead of palm, we use Certified Organic corn glycerin. We assure herb identity via macroscopic and organoleptic analysis, then confirm it through methods such as HPTLC fingerprinting specific to each herb.</p>"
;	000000000300103960	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Tasty gummies with calming ingredients to help kids wind down at bedtime or anytime.* Ages 3+</p> <p class=""p1"">Help little ones wind down at bedtime, naptime, or anytime with our delicious strawberry watermelon Kids Calm Gummies.* Magnesium and L-theanine work together to promote calm and relaxation and reduce everyday stress, helping kids feel more settled.* A great alternative to melatonin, our gummies can be taken at any time of the day without disrupting sleep patterns.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300086200	;	"	<p>Nap and nighttime support.* Kids Fast Asleep features Passionflower extract prepared from the flowering herb (leaf, flower and succulent stem) of Certified Organic <em>Passiflora incarnata</em> vines. It also features California Poppy extract prepared from whole Certified Organic <em>Eschscholzia californica </em>plants (root, leaf and flower) grown on our own farms in southern Oregon.</p> <p>Our Kids products include easy-to-follow instructions based on body weight; simply add drops to a small amount of water or juice.</p>"
;	000000000300086201	;	"	<p>Immune system active responder.*</p> <p>Early onset superhero.* Kids Immune Avenger features Echinacea extract produced from the root of Certified Organic <em>Echinacea purpurea</em> plants. It also includes Black Elderberry extract prepared from the fully ripened berries of Certified Organic <em>Sambucus nigra</em> trees.</p> <p>Our Kids products include easy-to-follow instructions based on body weight; simply add drops to a small amount of water or juice.</p>"
;	000000000300086202	;	"	<p>Helps prepare and restore the immune system.*</p> <p>Immune System Builder.* Kids Immune Fortifier features Astragalus extract produced from the root of Certified Organic <em>Astragalus mongholicus</em> plants. It also features Reishi extract prepared from dried whole fruiting body (not mycelium) of Certified Organic <em>Ganoderma lingzhi</em> mushrooms.</p> <p>Our Kids products include easy-to-follow instructions based on body weight; simply add drops to a small amount of water or juice.</p>"
;	000000000300086203	;	"	<p>Support for nervousness &amp; over-excitement.*</p> <p>Calming &amp; soothing support.* We prepare our Lemon Balm Glycerite from the shade-dried herb of <em>Melissa officinalis</em> plants. We grow our Lemon Balm on our own Certified Organic farms in southern Oregon.</p> <p>Our Kids products include easy-to-follow instructions based on body weight; simply add drops to a small amount of water or juice.</p>"
;	000000000300086196	;	"	<p>Our oils are for topical use only. The herb is extracted into cold-pressed, Certified Organic Olive oil. We assure herb identity via macroscopic and organoleptic analysis, then confirm it through methods such as HPTLC fingerprinting specific to each herb.</p>"
;	000000000300085260	;	"	<p>Kids Nordic Flora™ Probiotic Gummies contain just the right amount of beneficial, research-supported bacteria to help safely balance your child's intestinal flora.* Free of gelatin, soy, dairy, and gluten, these delicious travel-friendly gummies will disappear fast.</p>"
;	000000000300086199	;	"	<p>Immune system support.* We prepare Kids Echinacea from Certified Organic <em>Echinacea purpurea</em> root and Certified Organic sweet orange essential oil for kid-friendly flavor. We grow our Echinacea on our farms in southern Oregon. To assure optimal extraction of Echinacea’s bioactive compounds, we harvest the roots during the autumn.</p> <p>Our Kids products include easy-to-follow instructions based on body weight; simply add drops to a small amount of water or juice.</p>"
;	000000000300090803	;	"	<p>Delicious, travel-friendly probiotic powder for children’s digestive and immune health*</p> <p>Kids Nordic Flora Probiotic Pixies are a fun, tasty way for children to get the probiotics they need for optimal wellness.* Clinical studies show that <em>Lactobacillus rhamnosus</em> GG and <em>Bifidobacterium lactis</em> <em>BL-04</em> support a healthy immune system and may reduce the risk of upper respiratory tract infections.* These two well-researched strains also support intestinal health, digestion, and nutrient absorption.* The single-serving packets need no refrigeration and are a perfect on-the-go addition to lunch boxes or bags.</p>"
