;	000000000300087709	;	"	<p class=""p1"">BioMatrix Licorice Root Extract supports the adrenal glands when cortisol levels are low. It contains a substance known as glycyrrhizin, which has been shown to improve headaches, low sex drive, anxiety, moodiness, water retention, PMS symptoms, blood sugar control, energy levels and support hormone balance. Glycyrrhizin metabolites have been shown to block the enzyme 11B-hydroxysterokid responsible for the conversion of cortisol (active) to cortisone (inactive). The result is increased cortisol levels which can provide dramatic relief from a variety of symptoms. BioMatrix Licorice Root Extract supports proper cortisol levels and reduces these symptoms to restore your overall well-being. *</p>"
