;	000000000300084441	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Liquid Minerals are a convenient way of taking one dose of K, Zn, Mg, Cr, Mn, and Mo. A change in taste may indicate your body’s needs have changed -- you should test yourself using the BodyBio Liquid Minerals Set to determine which have changed. If you do not like one or more minerals - please stop taking the Liquid Minerals and create a new mineral drink recipe using the individual Liquid Minerals according to your test results. To ensure proper health, take only the minerals your body desires.</p>"
;	000000000300095947	;	"	<p>Liquid Zinc + Quercetin has been formulated with these two powerful nutrients to provide an easy and delicious way to add them to your daily diet. May provide the following benefits:</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li> <p class=""p1"">Healthy cardiovascular function*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Immune system support*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Antioxidant support for the cells*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Healthy digestion support*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Support growth + development*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Helps maintain respiratory health*</p> </li> </ul>"
