;	000000000300092259	;	"	<p><strong>Lithium Orotate by Seeking Health provides 5 mg of lithium (as lithium orotate) per vegetarian capsule.</strong> Lithium orotate is a natural substance that consists of lithium (an alkali metal) and orotic acid, a transport carrier for lithium that may help increase its bioavailability*. Lithium orotate can be taken in small doses due to its high absorption rate, as opposed to the popular lithium carbonate which is required at much higher doses and can have adverse effects. Lithium is known for its benefits in supporting neurological health.*</p>"
;	000000000300084222	;	"	<p>Lith-Oro™ contains lithium orotate, a complex of lithium with orotic acid. Lithium is a trace mineral that plays a role in the regulation of neurotransmitter activity, gene expression, and nerve cell health. Supplementation with lithium may support healthy mood, optimal memory, and cognitive function. Research suggests that lithium may support a healthy brain/nervous system.</p>"
