;	000000000300084195	;	"	<p>PROPRIETARY BLEND</p> <p>Saw Palmetto berry (Serenoa repens), Collinsonia whole plant (Collinsonia canadensis), Stinging Nettle root (Urtica dioica), White Sage herb (Salvia apiana)</p> <p>Other Ingredients</p> <p>Certified Organic alcohol, USP pharmaceutical grade glycerin, distilled water</p> <p>ADDITIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS</p> <p>Increase dietary zinc--pumpkin seed, plantain seed, bee pollen, and GLA (flax seed oil, EPO). Also helpful are prostate massage and hot/cold sitz baths.</p>"
;	000000000300104674	;	"	<p>Comprehensive formula including bioavailable plant extracts, vitamins, minerals and amino acids support healthy metabolism and energy levels.*</p> <p>Metabolic Multi offers bioactive vitamins and bioavailable forms of plant extracts and 5-MTHF to support metabolic health, including energy levels.* Featuring berberine to support macronutrient metabolism and GreenSelect® Green Tea Phytosome<sup>®</sup> for thermogenic support, Metabolic Multi includes 38 nutrients at optimal levels to ensure patients get exactly what doctors recommend.*</p>"
