;	000000000300001001	;	"	<p><strong>Mood Food™</strong> combines key B vitamins, including 5-MTHF as Quatrefolic<sup>®</sup> and Albion<sup>®</sup> di-magnesium malate, with critical amino acids to support overall central nervous system health, calmness, and a positive mood.*</p>"
