;	000000000300098327	;	"	<p class=""p1"">More Milk® Moringa is a moringa-based herbal blend to support breast milk supply*. This concentrated liquid extract delivers a combination of organic herbs—moringa, blessed thistle, nettle, and fennel—in a convenient vegan capsule.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">More Milk Moringa is formulated for moms who want to support their milk supply*, are pumping, want to increase their freezer stash*, or are sensitive to fenugreek.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">This herbal combination includes the popular superfood herb moringa, which is known to support breast milk supply*. More Milk Moringa is the perfect fenugreek-free blend for those with a sensitivity to the herb, fenugreek.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">We want the best for you; More Milk Moringa is vegan, contains no added soy, Non-GMO Project Verified, Kosher Certified by Kof-K, made with Organic herbs, made in the USA with imported ingredients, and is packaged in a recyclable bottle. Manufactured in an FDA and NSF-registered GMP facility.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">Motherlove is a Certified Women Owned B Corp that not only empowers new moms, but also Mother Earth, through our sustainable practices.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
