;	000000000300092921	;	"	<p>Supports nutrient absorption and the body’s defense against harmful molecules and bacteria*</p> <p>Nordic Flora Probiotic Immune Health is a blend of fifteen probiotic strains with 60 billion cultures to support respiratory wellness and a healthy immune response.* Additionally, this formula provides prebiotic FOS to promote probiotic viability and support beneficial microbes naturally present in the gut.* Taken daily, this probiotic supports the body’s natural immune mechanisms and a healthy microbiome.*</p>"
