;	000000000300087214	;	"	<p>Orgain’s All-in-One Organic Nutrition Shake is packed with 16g of organic protein, 21 vitamins and minerals, and a nourishing blend of 10 organic fruits and veggies!</p> <p>The shake that started it all – Orgain’s flagship All-in-One Organic Nutrition Shake. These shakes were designed by our founder when he recognized the need for a nutrition shake that was full of nothing but clean, organic ingredients.</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">16g Organic <span class=""s1"">Dairy-Based </span>Protein</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">21 Vitamins &amp; Minerals</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">2g Organic Fiber</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Organic Fruit &amp; Vegetable Blend</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without GMOs, Gluten &amp; Soy Ingredients</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without Corn Syrup</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1""><span class=""s1"">Made Without </span>Artificial Colors, Flavors, Sweeteners, &amp; Preservatives</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">HCPCS Code: B4150</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300087213	;	"	<p>Orgain Vegan Organic Nutrition Shakes serve up 16g of delicious, plant-based protein, 21 vitamins and minerals, and a nutritious blend of 10 organic fruits and veggies.</p> <p>The shake that started it all – Orgain’s flagship All-in-One Organic Nutrition Shake. These shakes were designed by our founder when he recognized the need for a nutrition shake that was full of nothing but clean, organic ingredients.</p> <ul> <li>16g Organic Dairy-Based Protein</li> <li>21 Vitamins &amp; Minerals</li> <li>2g Organic Fiber</li> <li>Organic Fruit &amp; Vegetable Blend</li> <li>Made Without GMOs, Gluten &amp; Soy Ingredients</li> <li>Made Without Corn Syrup</li> <li>Made Without Artificial Colors, Flavors, Sweeteners, &amp; Preservatives</li> <li>HCPCS Code: B4150</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300091831	;	"	<p>Pine bark extract is an outstanding source of oligomeric proanthocyanidins, or OPCs, which help protect your cells, tissues and organs against oxidative stress from damaging free radicals.* Organic Pine Bark Extract with OPCs is harvested from the fresh bark of young, living Pinus sylvestris trees in approved Certified Organic designated areas within the wild forests of the Finnish Lapland, north of the Arctic Circle – an area known for its ecological sustainability practices.</p> <p>Organic Pine Bark Extract with OPCs is extracted using water only and is standardized to contain 65% procyanidins, one of the primary antioxidant constituents in pine bark extract</p>"
;	000000000300087219	;	"	<p>Our Protein + Superfoods plant-based protein powder serves up 21g of organic plant protein alongside 50 organic superfoods per serving.</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">21g Organic Plant-Based Protein</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">No Added Sugar</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">5g Organic Fiber</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">50 Organic Superfoods in Each Serving</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without Any Major Allergens*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without GMOs &amp; Corn Syrup Powder</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1""><span class=""s1"">Made Without </span>Artificial Colors, Flavors, Sweeteners, &amp; Preservatives</p> </li> </ul> <p>*Made without dairy, gluten, soy, eggs, peanuts, tree nuts, fish, or shellfish ingredients.</p> <p>Not a Low Calorie food</p>"
;	000000000300087220	;	"	<p>Our best-selling protein powder has it all: organic, plant-based ingredients, 21g of protein, certified vegan and certified organic!</p> <p>Our organic plant-based protein powder serves up 21g of plant -based protein and only 150 calories in every serving. Clean, organic nutrition with a complete amino acid profile, no added sugar* and no artificial sweeteners.</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">21g Organic Plant-Based Protein</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">No Added Sugar</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">5g Organic Fiber</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without Dairy, Gluten, &amp; Soy Ingredients</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without GMOs, Corn Syrup Powder</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1""><span class=""s1"">Made Without </span>Artificial Colors, Flavors, Sweeteners, &amp; Preservatives</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300087228	;	"	<p>A plant-based organic protein bar serves up good, clean nutrition whenever and wherever you need it!</p> <p>Staying energized all day long just got easier! With 10g of plant -based protein and less than 200 calories, these organic bars serve up clean, delicious nourishment whenever and wherever you need it.</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">10g Organic Plant-Based Protein</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">3g Organic Fiber</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">5g Sugar</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without Dairy, Gluten, &amp; Soy Ingredients</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Made Without GMOs &amp; Corn Syrup</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1""><span class=""s1"">Made Without </span>Artificial Colors, Flavors, Sweeteners, &amp; Preservatives</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300096575	;	"	<p>Organic Whole husk Psyllium fiber capsules are an easy, convenient way to promote digestive and heart health, while increasing daily fiber intake. A natural prebiotic, psyllium promotes growth of beneficial microorganisms and supports gut health. It is known for its gentle laxative action and ability to soothe and support the entire gastrointestinal tract. Fiber is also known to support heart health and support healthy cholesterol levels. It’s found to help increase feelings of satiety, or fullness, helping curb hunger between meals and considered a gentle, bulk-forming supplement for healthy elimination and regularity.*</p>"
;	000000000300084978	;	"	<p>Organic, Non-GMO, vegan &amp; gluten-free</p> <p>Naturally dehydrated fruit pulp</p> <p>Source of fiber and antioxidant protection</p> <p>Contains Vitamin C, magnesium, potassium, &amp; calcium</p> <p>Great addition to smoothies and drink mixes</p>"
;	000000000300091835	;	"	<p>When combined with a healthy lifestyle, USDA Certified Organic Saw Palmetto Liquid Drops can provide powerful support for your prostate, urinary tract function, libido and cellular health.*</p> <p>Available in liquid tincture, Organic Saw Palmetto Liquid Drops offers a convenient, pleasantly sweet tasting formula without the need to take pills or capsules.</p> <p>Delivered by an exclusive producer with over 25 years of experience in high-quality herbal formulas, our Organic Saw Palmetto Liquid Drops formula uses only ripe organic saw palmetto berries that are extracted through an extensive multi-step extraction process to ensure optimal micronutrient yield.</p>"
;	000000000300001044	;	"	<p><strong>OrganiX PhytoFood</strong> is a convenient powdered formulation providing key nutrients to support a healthy lifestyle. This comprehensive formula incorporates an innovative blend of organic greens, vegetables, fruits, berries, phytonutrients, organic fiber sources, probiotics, and digestive enzymes. OrganiX PhytoFood also features a bioavailable, antioxidant-rich blend of green tea and apple extracts. In addition, TrueBroc® broccoli seed extract with standardized glucoraphanin content is present to provide long-lasting antioxidant support. This nutrient-dense formula features concentrates from “superfoods” known to provide phytonutrients and antioxidants that play important roles in maintaining our health and well-being. OrganiX PhytoFood is lactose-free and suitable for vegans.*</p>"
;	000000000300088725	;	"	<p>Pure Ge-132 Organo-Germanium, a unique organogermanium compound, bis-carboxyethyl germanium sesquioxide, sometimes just called germanium sesquioxide. Its unique molecular characteristics make it virtually unreactive in the body, and its small particle size and unique structure permit it to be cleared in the urine as the intact molecule. The body may potentially use germanium as a cellular oxygenator.*</p> <p>NutriCology<sup>®</sup> introduced pure Organo-Germanium into the United States in 1986. We recognize the importance of providing pure, thoroughly tested Ge-132, so we carefully analyze every lot using infrared spectroscopy, purity by acid group titration, absence of inorganic germanium impurities by color limit test, and solubility tests.</p>"
;	000000000300084196	;	"	<p>PROPRIETARY BLEND</p> <p>Artichoke leaf (Cynara scolymus), Dandelion root (Taraxacum officinale), Gentian root (Gentiana lutea), Angelica root (Angelica archangelica), Orange Peel (Citrus spp.), Peppermint herb (Mentha x piperita)</p> <p>Other Ingredients</p> <p>Certified Organic alcohol, distilled water</p> <p>ADDITIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS</p> <p>Eat slowly, chew thoroughly and eat simple meals. Avoid drinking large amounts of cold liquids with meals. Relax at meals; do not eat while standing up, watching TV or when you are upset.</p>"
;	000000000300086267	;	"	<p>A regular bath can leave your skin feeling dry and tight. Even though you may have added all kinds of bath oils, your skin is robbed of moisture. Original Himalayan Bath Crystals support the natural, protective film of your skin, so even if you have dry skin, your skin will feel softer and more hydrated. Rich in minerals, a soak will ease tension, hydrate and cleanse.</p>"
;	000000000300086268	;	"	<p>Coarse Granulated Culinary Salt contains 84 trace minerals in almost identical ratios to what exist in our blood. The structure of the crystals is so perfect and size of the particles so small that they can be absorbed into the cell and metabolized by the body. This salt is the healthiest and tastiest salt on the market. We recommend you use only a ceramic salt grinder or salt mill to preserve the inherent vibrational pattern of these crystals. Exposure to metal for prolonged periods may alter the frequency pattern of salt.</p>"
;	000000000300086270	;	"	<p>Original Himalayan Salt Stones contain 84 trace minerals in almost identical ratios to what exist in our blood.</p> <p>Sole made from Original Himalayan Crystal Stones is the easiest way to energize and hydrate your body Includes the 84 minerals considered essential nutrients for life and energy.<br />Flood your body with electrolytes which can improve conductivity and stimulate circulation*<br />Improve hydration into your cells*<br />Help balance acid-alkaline imbalances*<br />Helps normalize blood pressure*<br />Supports detoxification and helps cleanse the intestines*<br />Supports a properly functioning metabolism*</p>"
;	000000000300086269	;	"	<p>Fine Granulated Culinary Salt naturally brings out the flavor in your food. This non-chemically touched pink salt. contains 84 trace minerals in almost identical ratios to what exist in our blood. The structure of the crystals is so perfect and size of the particles so small that they can be absorbed into the cell and metabolized by the body. This salt is the healthiest and tastiest salt on the market.</p>"
;	000000000300082909	;	"	<p>Ortho Sleep™ is a comprehensive formula including the most powerful and clinically studied natural ingredients available, including melatonin, GABA, valerian root and lemon balm extract. It promotes normal, calm and peaceful sleep.*</p> <p>The formula promotes relaxation and helps to reduce the time it takes to fall asleep, improve sleep quality, and establishes normal sleep-wake cycles, so that you feel more refreshed and rejuvenated upon waking.*</p> <p>While many sleep formulas contain only melatonin or address only one aspect of sleep, Ortho Sleep™ addresses many factors relating to sleep quality and can help in cases of jet-lag, shift work, or difficulty falling asleep.*</p>"
;	000000000300001048	;	"	<p><strong>OSAplex<sup>™</sup> MK-7</strong> is a comprehensive, convenient, and cost-effective dietary supplement that supports healthy bones, cartilage, and ligaments. Each packet provides the following: two capsules containing a combination of microcrystalline hydroxyapatite concentrate (MCHC) from Ossopan 1100<sup>™</sup>, vitamin D3, and vitamin K2 along with one capsule of choline-stabilized orthosilicic acid (ch-OSA<sup>®‡</sup>).<sup>†</sup></p> <p>Bone is composed of a calcium-based mineral complex and an organic material known as collagen. A somewhat flexible and fibrous protein, collagen appears to be a key factor in a bone’s ability to withstand sudden impact. The quantity and health of collagen determines the bone’s “toughness,” while the mineral content determines its strength and stiffness.<sup>† </sup></p> <p>OSAplex MK-7 contains choline-stabilized orthosilicic acid, a well-absorbed form of silicon that has been clinically tested. Silicon-dependent enzymes link together single chains of amino acids to synthesize collagen fibers. The surfaces of these collagen fibers act as the binding sites for the MCHC. The more surface area available to the MCHC to bind to, the more flexible the bone.<sup>† </sup></p> <p>MCHC, a proprietary, standardized, and safe-source bone extract from New Zealand bovine, contains a crystalline calcium and phosphorus matrix in the ideal physiological ratio of 2:1, plus bioactive growth factors and type I collagen. As a source of calcium, MCHC contributes to the production and maintenance of bone structure, a function supported by vitamins D3 and K2. Amino acids, glycosaminoglycans, and a broad range of essential trace elements are also present.<sup>† </sup></p> <p>Combine ch-OSA and MCHC with significant levels of vitamins D3 and K2, and the result is a unique package that addresses quantity and quality of bone, avnd supports overall bone strength and health.<sup>†</sup></p> <p><strong>Each packet contains: 2 Microcrystalline Hydroxyapatite Concentrate with vitamins D3 and K2 capsules and 1 Choline-stabilized orthosilicic acid capsule.</strong></p>"
;	000000000300001049	;	"	<p><strong>OSAplex<sup>™</sup></strong> is a comprehensive, convenient, and cost-effective dietary supplement that supports healthy bones, cartilage, and ligaments. Each packet provides the following: two capsules containing a combination of microcrystalline hydroxyapatite concentrate (MCHC) and vitamin D3, along with one capsule of choline-stabilized orthosilicic acid (ch-OSA<sup>®</sup>).<sup>*</sup></p> <p>Bone is composed of a calcium-based mineral complex and an organic material known as collagen. A somewhat flexible and fibrous protein, collagen appears to be a key factor in a bone’s ability to withstand sudden impact. The quantity and health of collagen determines the bone’s “toughness,” while the mineral content determines its strength and stiffness.<sup>*</sup></p> <p>OSAplex contains choline-stabilized orthosilicic acid, a well-absorbed form of silicon. Silicon-dependent enzymes link together single chains of amino acids to synthesize collagen fibers. The surfaces of these collagen fibers act as the binding sites for the MCHC. The more surface area available to the MCHC to bind to, the more flexible the bone.<sup>*</sup></p> <p>MCHC, a proprietary, standardized, safe, bovine-sourced bone extract from New Zealand, contains a crystalline calcium and phosphorus matrix in the ideal physiological ratio of 2:1, plus bioactive growth factors and type I collagen. As a source of calcium, MCHC contributes to the production and maintenance of bone structure, a function supported by vitamin D3. Amino acids, glycosaminoglycans, and a broad range of essential trace elements are also present.<sup>*</sup></p> <p>Combining ch-OSA and MCHC with vitamin D3 results in a unique package that addresses the quantity and quality of bone and supports overall bone strength and health.<sup>*</sup></p> <p><strong>Each packet contains: Two microcrystalline hydroxyapatite concentrate with vitamins D3 capsules and one choline-stabilized orthosilicic acid capsule.</strong></p>"
;	000000000300001051	;	"	<p>Ossopan is a well-researched, standardized extract from one of the world’s safest premium sources of bone—free-range New Zealand cattle. Ossopan contains microcrystalline hydroxyapatite concentrate (MCHC), a complex crystalline compound composed primarily of calcium, phosphorus, bioactive growth factors, type I collagen, amino acids, glycosaminoglycans, and a broad range of essential trace elements that naturally comprise healthy bone. <strong>Ossopan 1100™</strong> provides 1100 mg of MCHC per capsule to optimally support bone strength and structure.*</p>"
;	000000000300001050	;	"	<p><strong>Ossopan MD<sup>™</sup></strong><sup> </sup>contains Ossopan, a well-researched, standardized extract from one of the world’s safest premium sources of bone. Ossopan contains microcrystalline hydroxyapatite concentrate (MCHC), a complex crystalline compound containing calcium, phosphorus, bioactive growth factors, type I collagen, amino acids, glycosaminoglycans, and a broad range of essential trace elements that naturally comprise healthy bone. Ossopan MD contains additional calcium and magnesium in the form of highly absorbable Albion<sup>®</sup> minerals. Vitamin D, in the form of cholecalciferol, supports intestinal calcium absorption and homeostasis in the body and completes the comprehensiveness of this bone-support formula.<sup>†</sup></p>"
;	000000000300000042	;	"	<p><strong>Ossopan MD™</strong> contains Ossopan, a well-researched, standardized extract from one of the world’s safest premium sources of bone. Ossopan contains microcrystalline hydroxyapatite concentrate (MCHC), a complex crystalline compound containing calcium, phosphorus, bioactive growth factors, type I collagen, amino acids, glycosaminoglycans, and a broad range of essential trace elements that naturally comprise healthy bone. Ossopan MD contains additional calcium and magnesium in the form of highly absorbable Albion<sup>®</sup> minerals. Vitamin D, in the form of cholecalciferol, supports intestinal calcium absorption and homeostasis in the body and completes the comprehensiveness of this bone-support formula.<sup>†</sup></p>"
;	000000000300104385	;	"	<p>Osteo Px contains 500 mcg of Vitamin K2 as MK7 for optimal bone health. Osteocalcin, a calcium binding protein in the blood, acts as a biochemical marker for bone formation. Osteocalcin relies on vitamins D3 and K2, specifically in the form of MK4 or MK7. These nutrients support healthy bone metabolism via their supportive relationship with osteocalcin and calcium.</p> <p>Because Vitamin K2 isn’t stored in the body like other lipid soluble vitamins, it requires daily dosing for optimal bone metabolism. K2 is available in supplement form as MK4 and MK7. MK4 is less ideal because it has a short half-life, so therefore requires multiple doses throughout the day. MK7 is the more bioavailable and active form of K2 which can be dosed once daily, making it the superior form of vitamin K2.</p>"
;	000000000300084197	;	"	<p>PROPRIETARY BLEND</p> <p>Stinging Nettle leaf (Urtica dioica), Alfalfa herb (Medicago sativa), Dandelion leaf (Taraxacum officinale), Horsetail herb (Equisetum arvense), Oat straw (Avena sativa), Black Pepper (Piper nigrum)</p> <p>Other Ingredients</p> <p>Vegetable-based capsule (cellulose, water)</p> <p>ADDITIONAL RECOMMENDATIONS</p> <p>The following foods are rich in absorbable calcium: dark green leafy vegetables, cabbage, broccoli, carrots, sesame seeds, canned Alaskan salmon and sardines. Magnesium, silica, potassium, boron, vitamin D and essential fatty acids are necessary for calcium metabolism. Saturated fats, sodium and phosphorus (carbonated drinks) are calcium antagonists.</p>"
;	000000000300083072	;	"	<p>This formula compliments nutritional and exercise programs to promote healthy hormone levels, healthy insulin response and normal healthy ovulation. *</p> <p><strong>Featured Ingredients:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Chromium and NAC (N-Acetyl-L-Cysteine) show supportive research in promoting healthy glucose tolerance levels and insulin response. *</li> <li>Cinnamon supports regular menses and a healthy metabolic response, especially in women with endocrine challenges. *</li> <li>Certain natural substances promote stimulation of sex hormone binding globulin, in turn maintaining healthy androgen levels; we’ve included: Nettles root and Green tea. *</li> <li>Saw palmetto promotes inhibited activity of 5 alpha reductase, thereby maintaining healthy testosterone levels. *</li> <li>Sarsaparilla promotes a progesterone-like effect, a potential important factor for women looking for ovarian support. *</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300089127	;	"	<p class=""p1""><strong>Ovulation Assist offers adaptogenic botanicals in support of healthy and normal ovulation by supporting the hypothalamic-pituitary-ovarian-adrenal axis.*</strong></p> <p class=""p1""><strong>Shatavari</strong> is an Ayurvedic herb traditionally used as a female health tonic; it offers antioxidant and hormone balancing support with stress management benefits and is calming for the uterus.*</p> <ul> <li class=""p1""><strong>Tribulus</strong> promotes healthy testosterone production and therefore healthy ovarian reserves; supports normal ovulation function *</li> <li class=""p1""><strong>Chaste tree berry</strong> promotes optimal hormone balance, normal ovulation and good communication between the brain and ovaries. *</li> <li class=""p1""><strong>Rhodiola rosea</strong> promotes normal and healthy ovulation as well as optimal adrenal function and supports wellbeing under stress. *</li> <li class=""p1""><strong>Holy basil leaf</strong> supports healthy and optimal blood sugar, a component of healthy ovulation; traditionally used to support overall calm and healthy stress resistance.*</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300088744	;	"	<p>Ox Bile is derived from cattle raised in USDA-inspected facilities in the United States, according to US Food Safety guidelines. Ox Bile is a suitable supplement to the liver’s production of bile.* Bile is naturally produced by the body and is used in the process of digesting fats and fat-soluble vitamins A, D, E, and K.*</p>"
;	000000000300084782	;	"	<p>Bile is a fluid excreted by hepatocytes to aid digestion. Bile performs several vital functions such as excretion of lipid soluble toxins, emulsification of dietary fats to aid in their absorption, cholesterol metabolism, excretion of immunoglobulin A and cytokines to initiate an immune response, facilitation of enterohepatic circulation including the transport of hormones and pheromones.* Ox Bile SAP is a formulation containing ox bile with high cholic acid content, that can help increase bile flow.*</p>"
;	000000000300104406	;	"	<p>This unique formula features a blend of plant extracts high in polyphenols along with the nutrient cofactor Vitamin E. The blend focuses on supporting cardiovascular oxidative pathways, healthy endothelial function, and healthy levels of pro-inflammatory cytokines, within normal range.</p> <p>Pomegranate polyphenols support healthy endothelium cell function in the arteries by maintaining the release of nitric oxide, within normal range. A water-based Olive Fruit Extract provides polyphenols that protect blood lipids from oxidative stress and supports healthy lipid metabolism. Olive fruit extract is rich in the polyphenol Hydroxytyrosol (HT), a powerful antioxidant that supports key aspects of cardiovascular and metabolic health. Complimented with a phenolic rich extract of grape seed to support healthy metabolic and cardiovascular function balancing lipid metabolism and oxidation while having a beneficial effect on endothelial function. Ox-LDL PXd features a novel plant flavonoid known as Fisetin. Fisetin is a bioactive flavonol molecule found in fruits and vegetables such as strawberry, apple, persimmon, grape, onion, and cucumber, it is a botanical antioxidant.</p> <p>Ox-LDL Px offers the clinician a high quality formula focused on supporting cardiovascular health and healthy oxidation pathways in the cardiovascular system.</p>"
;	000000000300082910	;	"	<p>Micronized Palmitoylethanolamide (PEA) has widespread activity in supporting and sustaining the endocannabinoid system (ECS).*</p> <p>The ECS is a network that communicates with other systems throughout the body, helping to regulate them.</p> <p>AOR is leading the way by bringing you a safe and therapeutic formulation with PEA’s positive effects. The PEA in AOR’s P.E.A.k Endocannabinoid Support is produced in Italy and originally extracted from environmentally sustainable Malaysian palm oil that is purified and responsibly processed for optimal bioavailability.</p>"
;	000000000300093481	;	"	<p>P-5-P by Seeking Health provides 25 mg of pyridoxal 5'-phosphate (P-5-P), known as the ""active"" or ""coenzyme"" form of vitamin B6, in an easy-to-swallow vegetarian capsule.</p> <p>Vitamin B6 is important as a coenzyme for the normal metabolism of amino acids, carbohydrates and lipids. It is also involved in healthy cognitive development, immune health and homocysteine conversion.<sup>*</sup> The P-5-P form of B6 is directly used in B6-dependent enzyme functions in the body. In fact, vitamin B6 and P-5-P are needed for more than 100 enzyme reactions - mostly related to protein metabolism. In a typical diet, B6 can be found in potatoes, poultry, fortified grains and cereals, salmon and avocados. However, many plant sources contain a less bioavailable form of B6 - pyridoxine glucoside. This form may be more difficult to absorb and utilize than the forms found in meat, fish, poultry or certain supplements. Especially for those who eat a mostly vegan or vegetarian diet, B6 supplementation can be very important.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300092909	;	"	<p>Over 25 clinical studies show PADMA BASIC<sup>®</sup>  Professional offers multiple benefits, including cardiovascular support and support for comfort while walking. Often mobility is linked to arterial health. PADMA BASIC<sup>®</sup>  Professional is clinically-shown to work with the cardiovascular system to promote arterial blood flow to extremities, helping to support comfort while walking and other benefits.*</p>"
;	000000000300103562	;	"	<p>Description: Our fast-absorbing cream features functional mushrooms, botanical extracts, and menthol (4%) at a moderate dose ideal for high-use parts of the body like the hands and for sensitive people.</p> <p>You can send your patients home with the fast-absorbing cream to cool moderate muscle and joint pain. The wintery floral and citrus aroma makes it favorable for daily use – a popular choice for patients seeking arthritis or bruise relief.</p> <p>Treats: simple backaches, arthritis, strains, sprains, and bruises</p>"
;	000000000300103561	;	"	<p>Description: Offer your patients our extra strength oil so they can indulge themselves in the comfort of their homes. The floral- citrus scent paired with the cooling sensation of camphor (3.1%) and menthol (7%) and functional mushrooms can help soothe sore muscles while still offering a relaxing experience.</p> <p class=""p1"">Treats: simple backaches, arthritis, strains, sprains, and bruises</p>"
;	000000000300103560	;	"	<p>Our most powerful formula combines camphor (11%) and menthol (16%) at the highest OTC concentration available while functional mushrooms including reishi, lion’s mane, cordyceps, and shiitake offer their anti-inflammatory properties for targeted relief. Your patients will benefit from the non-medicinal smell of aromatic botanicals combined with the cooling plant-based analgesics.</p> <p>The invigorating notes of arnica extract, ginger, honeysuckle, and sweet orange combined with the wintery undertones of camphor and menthol is excellent for people who experience muscle fatigue and stiffness.</p> <p>You can offer the 50g tube to your patients to use as part of their treatment plan, workout routine, or as needed when pain strikes.</p> <p>Treats: simple backaches, arthritis, strains, sprains, and bruises</p>"
;	000000000300103558	;	"	<p>The MYCO CLINIC Pain Relief Stick offers the same high-power formula as our ointment in a convenient stick for a no-mess application. Camphor (11%) and menthol (16%) are combined at full-strength for powerful cooling and heating action alongside functional mushrooms to offer their anti-inflammatory properties.</p> <p>The stick is a patient-favorite for hard-to-reach places like the upper back. It is also popular with gym and sports enthusiasts who want a convenient product to toss in their gym bag and use after a hard workout.</p> <p>Treats: simple backaches, arthritis, strains, sprains, and bruises</p>"
;	000000000300088743	;	"	<p>Provides high quality pancreas tissue, formulated according to strict specifications by Allergy Research Group<sup>®</sup> and Dr. Nicholas Gonzalez M.D. This product is sourced from range-fed animals raised Australia and New Zealand, where animal husbandry regulations prohibit the feeding and veterinary practices that have caused problems in other countries.* The material is lyophilized, meaning immediately frozen and subjected to a high vacuum that removes the moisture. This sophisticated technique respects the delicate nature of the material, and except for the water content, leaves in everything that naturally occurs in glandular tissue.* Our glandulars are subject to in-process and finished product testing.</p>"
;	000000000300084628	;	"	<p>Pantethine is a derivative of vitamin B5. Pantethine supports lipid metabolism by its ability to raise levels of Coenzyme A (CoA), a cofactor involved in several metabolic pathways including carbohydrate and lipid metabolism.* CoA combines with acetyl groups to form Acetyl CoA, a key participant in energy production via its role in the Krebs (citric acid) cycle within the mitochondria.*</p>"
;	000000000300084661	;	"	<p>EP PANTETHINE from Pantesin sustained release 300mg tablets work by providing a key building block for Coenzyme A, your body's most active metabolic enzyme. CoA is required to activate a wide variety of biochemical reactions critical for the whole body health. It plays a central role in converting food into cellular energy. CoA helps convert choline into acetylcholine, an important biochemical messenger for the nerve cell communication. CoA even activates enzymes in the liver that help remove toxins from the body. it also works deep within cells activating enzymes that play a key role maintaining healthy cholesterol balance &amp; lipid metabolism.* </p>"
;	000000000300094450	;	"	<p>Zahler's Pantothenic Acid is a high potency formula. Also known as Vitamin B5, it is a member of the B-complex family. Essential for many bodily functions, including growth and reproduction, it is necessary for the metabolism of fats, proteins and carbohydrates.</p> <p>More about Panothenic Acid: Because Pantothenic Acid is widely available from a variety of foods, a 'true deficiency’ is rare in humans. However, higher doses of pantothenic acid may be helpful in supporting general wellness.*</p>"
;	000000000300089660	;	"	<p>Also known as vitamin B5, the name pantothenic comes from the Greek word 'panthos' which means everywhere. The body uses pantothenic acid in the metabolism of carbohydrates and fats, and in the production of adrenal hormones, skin, hair, nerves, and red blood cells.*</p>"
