;	000000000300085263	;	"	<p>ProDHA 1000 provides nearly 1000 mg of high-intensity omega-3 DHA per serving. The most abundant long-chain fatty acid in the brain, DHA plays a vital role in maintaining the structural integrity of the central nervous system, facilitating neuronal health and cell membrane fluidity and sustaining visual health.*</p>"
;	000000000300085264	;	"	<p>ProDHA provides targeted omega-3 support for optimal neurological functioning, mood, and visual health.* The most abundant long-chain omega-3 in the brain, DHA plays a vital role in maintaining the structural integrity of the central nervous system, facilitating neuronal health and cell membrane fluidity and sustaining visual health.* Backed by original research, this DHA-dominant formula is clinically shown to benefit cognitive health and membrane function within the brain.*</p>"
