;	000000000300085265	;	"	<p>ProEPA delivers research-supported levels of concentrated EPA from fish oil to provide targeted support for cardiovascular health, joint mobility, and healthy cellular function.* This EPA-dominant formula provides over 1000 mg of high-potency omega-3 support in the highly absorbable 90+% triglyceride form in just two soft gels.</p>"
;	000000000300089306	;	"	<p>Concentrated omegas 3 and 6 for cardiovascular, neurological, eye, joint, skin, and immune health*</p> <p>ProEPA with Concentrated GLA combines high concentrations of highly-absorbable omega-3 EPA and DHA with a viable dose of beneficial omega-6 gamma linoleic-acid (GLA).* Unique in its potency, this formula features the most highly-concentrated borage seed GLA (70%) available and can help remediate GLA deficiency for individuals unable to efficiently convert fatty acids to GLA due to increased age or insufficient levels of the delta 6-desaturase enzyme.*</p>"
;	000000000300086911	;	"	<p class=""p2"">Argentyn 23 Professional Silver First Aid Gel features a homeopathic silver formula that helps minor wounds heal fast. It works to reduce topical pain, calm skin inflammation, fight minor skin infection, and promote healing of the skin. Use for the relief of cuts, scrapes, minor wounds &amp; burns, sunburn, rashes, skin irritations, sores, blisters, bug bites, skin eruptions from minor infection, itching and more.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300086532	;	"	<p><strong>Proflora 4R</strong> is a unique spore-forming (soil-based) probiotic with additional botanicals to support microbial balance and GI health.<sup>*</sup> The combination of quercetin, marshmallow root, and aloe vera extract in Proflora 4R provide additional nutritional support for healthy microbial balance, with just one capsule per day, preferably at bedtime. Spore-forming probiotics are commensal bacteria found in our gastrointestinal tract. Unlike conventional probiotics, Proflora 4R does not require refrigeration, and is designed to survive stomach acid.</p>"
;	000000000300095936	;	"	<p>ProGreens<sup>®</sup> is an all-natural gluten-free drink mix formulated with the highest quality superfoods, to provide broad-spectrum nutritional support from green grasses and natural food factors not found in isolated vitamins or mineral concentrates.<sup>*</sup> In addition to the green grasses, sea vegetables (seaweed) and algae, ProGreens<sup>®</sup> contains premium adaptogenic herbs and standardized extracts, active probiotics, fiber, and a variety of nutrient-rich superfoods.* ProGreens<sup>®</sup> is a wholesome food supplement designed to support optimal health.</p>"
;	000000000300088265	;	"	<p>Balance between inhibitory and excitatory neurotransmitters is vital to health and well-being. Inhibitory neurotransmitters such as serotonin, GABA and glycine control excitatory signals in the nervous system. That is why supporting inhibitory neurotransmitters often results in an overall calming and relaxing effect.</p> <p>Prolent includes ingredients that support the action of inhibitory neurotransmitters.* 5-HTP and vitamin B6 support serotonin synthesis.* Theanine, as Suntheanine<sup>®</sup>, supports both the release of GABA and its function.* The combination of these ingredients along with glycine allows Prolent to offer comprehensive support for inhibitory neurotransmission.* Prolent helps prevent over-excitation when catecholamine support is being used.*</p>"
;	000000000300088053	;	"	<p class=""p1"">What is ProLon<sup><span class=""s1"">®</span></sup>?</p> <p class=""p1"">ProLon<sup>®</sup> is a 5-day dietary program that nourishes your body. A 5-day cycle of ProLon Pro once a month for several months is clinically tested to have similar weight loss, percentage of body fat reduction, and similar visceral fat reduction when compared to an everyday heart healthy diet. Similar to a heart healthy diet, weight loss associated with ProLon Pro use over several months supports the ability to lose weight to help maintain healthy cholesterol levels. Additionally, ProLon Pro supports the natural process of intracellular clean-up and cellular renewal. Users attest to feeling improved energy, focus and clarity<sup>*</sup>. ProLon<sup>®</sup> mitigates the burden and risks of water-only fasting, while responding to the unmet need of having a tasty, convenient, and safe dietary program.</p> <p class=""p1""><strong>This kit contains:</strong></p> <ul> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM - Mushroom Soup Mix</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Tomato Soup Mix</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Vegetable Soup Mix</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Minestrone Soup Mix</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Minestrone Quinoa Soup Mix</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Olives with a Hint of Garlic</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM – Olives with a Touch of Sea Salt</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM - L-Bar Proprietary Nut-Based Bar</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM - L-Bar Proprietary Choco Crisp Bar</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM - Almond and Kale Crackers</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM - Algal Oil</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">FASTING MIMICKING PROGRAM - NR-1</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Hibiscus Tea</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Spearmint Tea</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Spearmint Lemon Tea</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">L-Drink Orange Flavor</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">L-Drink Tropical Berry Flavor</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300104688	;	"	<p>Reset is the only product that can nourish your body for a full day while your cells think you are not eating and therefore stay in a protective and rejuvenating state. It is a great detox, reboot, and maintenance product that balances your diet and washes the previous days of eating or drinking! The goal of reset is to provide you with premium plant-based, clean, low-carb, gluten-free nutrition that prolongs the previous overnight fast for another 24 hours, which has tremendous metabolic and cellular benefits. Reset formed around the Fasting Mimicking Nutri technology developed and tested by 14 global universities and L-Nutra to nourish you with premium quality plant-based food while inducing the cellular, metabolic, and emotional benefits of Prolonged fasting. It is a scientific breakthrough that took 2 decades, $48MM in research. and awarded 40+ patents — including the only patent in history on a nutrition program to enhance longevity and healthspan.</p>"
