;	000000000300090801	;	"	<p>Saccharomyces Boulardii by Seeking Health contains 5 billion CFU (Colony Forming Units) that may help support bowel regularity and provide relief from occasional diarrhea, while supporting a healthy digestive system, especially during times of increased stress*</p> <p>Known as a ""probiotic yeast,"" this beneficial microorganism may play a role in supporting normal intestinal absorption of D-glucose and sodium, helping to maintain normal uptake of water and electrolytes during occasional diarrhea. It may also increase stool concentrations of short-chain fatty acids that help nourish colon mucosal cells.*</p> <p>Saccharomyces boulardii may help maintain normal colonic populations of healthful Bifidobacteria probiotic strains and support the body's defenses against potential intestinal pathogens.*</p>"
