;	000000000300098333	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Sitz Bath Spray brings new moms the same support as a sitz bath in a convenient spray bottle. This perineal spray delivers soothing organic herbs in a quick spritz, so you can get the comfort you need after childbirth.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">Sitz Bath Spray is convenient and now easier to use than ever -- this 360 degree spritzer bottle allows new moms to spray in any direction. Sitz Bath Spray is perfect for frequent use. For cooling effect, spray on pad and freeze before use.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">We want the best for you; Sitz Bath Spray is vegan, Certified Organic by Oregon Tilth (which also means non-GMO!) and Certified Cruelty Free by Leaping Bunny. Does not contain petroleum or petroleum by-products, lanolin, parabens, phthalates, or synthetic fillers.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">Motherlove is a Certified Women Owned B Corp that not only empowers new moms, but also Mother Earth, through our sustainable practices.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300083074	;	"	<p>Skin Assist offers focused skin support by promoting healthy and glowing blemish‐free skin; promotes balanced hormonal effects on the sebaceous glands &amp; physiological functions of the skin.*</p> <p>Featured Ingredients:</p> <ul> <li>Critical nutrients for the skin include optimal and easily absorbed forms of Calcium, Magnesium, Vitamin D, Biotin, Selenium and Zinc, especially for clear skin</li> <li>Hyaluronic acid and Vitamin C are included for collagen and connective tissue support; these can promote skin healing.*</li> <li>Antioxidants support healthy skin healing and Vitamin E further supports the additional antioxidants in the formula: Vitamin A, Vitamin C, Selenium, Lutein, Lycopene*</li> <li>Botanical support: Burdock root supports blood purifying and is a traditionally used herb for skin support; Horsetail is rich in minerals, especially silica, an important nutrient for nails and hair; Oatstraw, an herbal nerve tonic ,promotes relaxed nerves around the hair follicles; Gotu kola supports circulation and the maintenance of blood vessels; Saw palmetto and Nettle root promote hormone balancing effects on the glands.*</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300087523	;	"	<p>Skin-lasting Botanical Hydrator moisturizer is a favorite head-to-toe body quenching spray mist. Apply skin-lasting after showering on neck, torso, arms, elbows, knees, legs and feet to hydrate and gently exfoliate the skin. This dermatologist-formulated blend is for all skin types and challenges *</p> <p>Skin-lasting is hypoallergenic, non-greasy, fragrance, dye, and paraben-free moisturizer. The skinsmoothing ingredients include lactic acid, vitamin C, hyaluronic acid and green tea to address aging skin as well. Skin-lasting Botanical Hydrator comes in a generous 6 oz. spray bottle for easy application. TIP: Spray a bit on hand and massage well into the skin on the entire body. Apply sparingly!</p> <p class=""p1""><strong>Benefits of Skin-lasting Super Hydrator:</strong></p> <ul> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Increase skin’s elasticity and instantly hydrates skin</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Doctor formulated and hypoallergenic</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">All-natural, non-greasy and non-pore clogging</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Free of parabens, phthalates, petroleum, fragrance, dyes, and retinoids</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Long lasting ingredients work for hours to help keep skin looking dewy and moist</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Cruelty-free and never tested on animals</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Hyaluronic Acid quenches the skin for a more youthful look and feel</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Can be applied on neck, hands, torso, legs, arms, and feet. Some women put it on their face, with the Ultimate Age-Proofing Complex on best.</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Lactic acid helps gently exfoliate skin to reveal smoother, younger, fresher skin cells in just days</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Vitamin C and green tea are known to help protect skin from harmful UVA/UVB rays</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Brightens the skin tone</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Makes an excellent non-greasy hand lotion that banishes cuticles. Pour some into a 2 oz. spray bottle and keep in your purse.</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Perfect for all skin types including dry, dehydrated or oily skin</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">An excellent remedy for women, men, and children</p> </li> </ul>"
