;	000000000300090278	;	"	<p>Genexa Stress is a real remedy, made clean – addressing symptoms associated with stress such as fatigue, nervousness, anxiousness, irritability, and hypersensitivity*. Each chewable tablet has the same healing ingredients you need (organic homeopathic blend), but without the artificial ones you don’t (artificial dyes, common allergens, parabens). Founded by two dads on a mission to clean up the medicine aisle, Genexa only uses clean ingredients to make certified organic, gluten-free, non-GMO homeopathic medicines. It’s what people deserve.</p> <p>Genexa is the first clean medicine company that makes medicine with the same active ingredients people need, but without the artificial ones they don’t. It’s real medicine, made clean.</p>"
;	000000000300097164	;	"	<p>GABA, L-theanine, 5-HTP, hops, inositol and low dose lithium to help support healthy parasympathetic response and mental calm*</p>"
;	000000000300102802	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Stress Maintenance combines Passion Flower and Lemon Balm with a nutrient blend including GABA and L-glutamine, in support of the soothing GABA pathway. GABA is used by the body to mitigate the effects of excitatory neurochemicals. We’ve incorporated lemon balm, an herb with growing evidence to support calm, with constituents that may assist the GABA pathway. Use during a stressful day to support a relaxed sense of being. In the evening, ingredients like magnesium and glycine help quiet the mind, relax muscles, and improve sleep quality.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300092414	;	"	<p>Indicated for alleviating occasional symptoms of stress by promoting optimal nervous system function. The herbs in this well-crafted formula also maintain stress tolerance via their support for adrenal and CNS functions. The cornerstone of this formula, Ashwagandha, is an adaptogenic herb which has been shown to support adrenal function and protect against occasional stress. African Snake root enhances parasympathetic activity.*</p>"
;	000000000300083954	;	"	<p>Enjoy a layered high protein bar with an amazingly delicious blend of peanut nugget, peanuts, and rich delicious caramel, all wrapped in a chocolate coating. NuGo STRONGER Peanut Cluster is a remarkable high-performance superfood that delivers the quality nutrition you need to achieve serious results from your workout and recovery experience.</p>"
;	000000000300082915	;	"	<p>Strontium is an important trace mineral which concentrates in the skeletal system and promotes healthy bones.*</p> <p>Strontium works by increasing osteoblast production while decreasing osteoclast production, which promotes bone health. Since strontium is similar in molecular structure to calcium, it is thought to activate the calcium receptors in the bone. AOR’s Strontium Support II is an excellent addition to calcium supplementation for those who wish to support healthy bones.*</p> <p>AOR’s Strontium Support II provides an effective dose of this bone health powerhouse in a convenient one to two capsule-a-day formula.*</p>"
;	000000000300085756	;	"	<p>SunFiber<sup>®</sup> is true regulating, all-natural prebiotic fiber supplement that delivers six grams of proven, clear, grit free, 100% soluble fiber.</p>"
;	000000000300085242	;	"	<p>Cordyceps (Cordyceps sinensis), was traditionally reputed as a precious longevity-supporting herb, but now considered a mushroom, is widely recognized for it's energy and cardio support.*</p> <p>Super Cordyceps uses a concentrated hot water extract of the mycelium cultivated with the most-researched Cs-4 strain.</p> <p>Mushroom Wisdom, with over 25 years of mushroom expertise, is committed to offering you the finest and most effective supplements, manufacturing them in a certified cGMP facility.</p>"
;	000000000300086228	;	"	<p>Provides complex, deep support of the immune system over both the short and long term.<sup>*</sup> Super Echinacea is a proprietary blend of the extracts of Echinacea root, Echinacea seed, and Echinacea leaf and flower. We harvest the leaf and flower of Certified Organic <em>Echinacea purpurea</em> plants from our own farms in the summer. We harvest the seed and root each fall. The root, seed and leaf and flower are extracted separately according to their unique biochemical profiles and then blended to ensure a broad-spectrum formula.</p>"
;	000000000300088145	;	"	<p>Super K provides THREE kinds of vitamin K: vitamin K1 and two forms of K2, menaquinone-4 (MK-4) and menaquinone-7 (MK-7). Taking Super K everyday is a good way to make sure you’re getting enough of this essential nutrient for bone and vascular heath*.</p> <p>Vitamin K helps maintain bone density by facilitating the incorporation of calcium into your bones.<sup>1</sup> It also supports normal function of a protein called matrix Gla-protein (MGP).<sup>2</sup> MGP helps regulate how calcium interacts with your arterial walls.<sup>3</sup> So in addition to facilitating calcium incorporation into bone, vitamin K helps promote a healthy calcium balance in your arteries.</p> <p> </p> <p><strong>References:</strong><br />1. Linus Pauling Institute. Vitamin K. Accessed 05/14/2019.<br />2. <em>Adv Nutr</em>. 2012;3(2):158-65.<br />3. <em>Clin J Am Soc Nephrol</em>. 2008;3(5):1504-10.<br />4.<em> J Nutr</em>. 2004;134(11):3100-5.<br />5.<em> Am J Clin Nutr</em>. 2009;89(6):1799-807.<br />6. <em>Circulation</em>. 2017;135(21):2081-2083.<br />7. <em>Thromb Haemost</em>. 2015;113(5):1135-44.<br />8. <em>Nutr Metab Cardiovasc Dis</em>. 2009;19(7):504-10.<br />9. <em>J Nutr Metab</em>. 2017;2017:6254836.<br />10. <em>Adv Nutr</em>. 2012;3(2):182-195.<br />11.<em> Blood</em>. 2007;109(8):3279-83.<br />12. <em>Nutr J</em>. 2012;11(1):93-7.</p>"
;	000000000300085244	;	"	<p>Lion's Mane (Hericium erinaceus ) mushroom was used traditionally for digestive health, while modern science has further elucidated on healthy brain function.*<br /><br />Super Lion's Mane is a synergistic blend of concentrated hot water extract with whole fruiting body.<br /><br />Mushroom Wisdom, with over 25 years of mushroom expertise, is committed to offering you the finest and most effective supplements, manufacturing them in a certified cGMP facility.</p>"
;	000000000300088147	;	"	<p>Super Omega-3 EPA/DHA delivers an optimal dose of EPA and DHA omega-3 fatty acids. Inspired by the heart-healthy Mediterranean diet, Super Omega-3 also contains potent olive polyphenols and sesame lignans for additional health benefits.</p> <p>Omega-3 fatty acids support healthy heart and blood vessel function, promote blood flow, help maintain already-healthy blood pressure, and help inhibit inflammatory factors to support whole body health.<sup>4-6</sup></p> <p>These essential fats also help maintain already-healthy LDL and HDL cholesterol and triglyceride levels.<sup>7,8</sup> Omega-3 supplementation has been shown to encourage healthy cognitive function, support mood health, and promote longevity.<sup>9-13</sup></p> <p>Enteric coated for sensitive stomachs.</p> <p> </p> <p><strong>References:</strong><br />1. <em>Prog Cardiovasc Dis.</em> 2015;58(1):50-60.<br />2. <em>N Engl J Med</em>. 2018;378(25):e34.<br />3. <em>Nutrients</em>. 2015;7(11):9139-9153.<br />4. <em>Atherosclerosis</em>. 2014;232(1):10-6.<br />5. <em>Am J Hypertens</em>. 2014;27(7):885-96.<br />6. <em>J Am Soc Hypertens</em>. 2017;11(1):10-19.<br />7. <em>Food Funct</em>. 2018;9(7):3576-3596.<br />8. <em>Cardiovasc Diabetol</em>. 2018;17(1):98.<br />9. <em>Nutrients</em>. 2014;6(10):4058-73.<br />10. <em>Nutrients</em>. 2018;10(8)<br />11. <em>Nutr Res</em>. 2018;50:1-9.<br />12.<em> Atherosclerosis</em>. 2016;252:175-81.<br />13. <em>Asia Pac J Clin Nutr</em>. 2017;26(5):939-956.</p>"
;	000000000300085245	;	"	<p>Reishi(Ganoderma lucidum), traditionally known as the ""mushroom of immortality"", is considered a superior tonic for supporting overall health of body and mind.*</p> <p>Super Resihi is made from the mushroom fruiting body grown on logs and extracted using both hot water and alcohol.</p> <p>Mushroom Wisdom, with over 25 years of mushroom expertise, is committed to offering you the finest and effective supplements, manufacturing them in a certified cGMP facility.</p>"
;	000000000300093965	;	"	<p>CoQ10 is essential for cellular energy production. Super Ubiquinol CoQ10 with Enhanced Mitochondrial Support<sup>™</sup> is formulated with a highly bioavailable form of coenzyme Q10 called ubiquinol and augmented with the adaptogen PrimaVie<sup>®</sup> shilajit, which has been shown in preclinical models to promote mitochondrial energy production. The result: even more cellular energy for your heart, mind and wherever else it's needed!*</p>"
;	000000000300098631	;	"	<p>From the #1 Pharmacist Recommended Beet Brand**, SuperBeets Beet Root Capsules features clinically-researched grape seed extract plus premium beet root grown in the USA. The clinically-researched grape seed extract has been shown to promote normal blood nearly 2x more effectively than a healthy lifestyle aloneƚ. Each serving supports:</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li> <p class=""p1"">Healthy Blood Pressure</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Circulation</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Nitric Oxide Production</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Oxidative Stress Reduction</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Heart Health</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Heart Healthy Energy</p> </li> </ul> <p> </p> <p>**According to IQVIA ProVoice Survey 2022<br />ƚ In a 16-week, double-blind, placebo-controlled study involving 119 healthy men and women, SuperBeets Beet Root Capsules’ polyphenol compound, taken as part of a healthy lifestyle was clinically shown nearly 2-times as effective at promoting normal blood pressure already in the normal range as a healthy lifestyle alone.</p>"
