;	000000000300087204	;	"	<p>SuperBeets Heart Chews combines clinically-researched grape seed extract plus non-GMO beetroot to support blood pressure health, blood flow, and energy the way nature intended - without caffeine or stimulants.* Each serving provides 150mg of clinically-researched grape seed extract derived exclusively from the renowned French Loire Valley region. In a 16-week placebo-controlled study of healthy men &amp; women, the grape seed extract in SuperBeets Chews was clinically shown to be nearly 2 times as effective at promoting normal blood pressure already in the normal range as a healthy lifestyle alone. SuperBeets Chews are naturally flavored and contain no artificial sweeteners or colors.</p>"
;	000000000300091207	;	"	<p>SuperBeets Memory &amp; Focus is the ONLY food-based, daily chew formula of its kind containing clinically studied, fermented Resveratrol to promote brain blood flow and support overall cognitive health, combined with a patented Coffee Fruit Extract, clinically shown to support memory, mental alertness, and help reduce perceptions of mental fatigue. Decaffeinated, non-GMO, and vegan, SuperBeets Memory &amp; Focus chews are available in a natural pomegranate flavor that makes supporting brain health both great-tasting and convenient.*</p>"
