;	000000000300093089	;	"	<p>Tart Cherry Gummies features the most bioactive, full-spectrum, whole fruit tart cherry extract on the market to support healthy uric acid levels, immune health, healthy blood sugar levels, and metabolic energy.* NordicCherry<sup>® </sup>is more concentrated than other leading tart cherry extracts in proanthocyanins, anthocyanins, and phenolic acids. Each serving also contains Vitamin C and chromium to further support metabolic health. These sugar free gummies are naturally flavored, gluten free, vegan friendly, and non-GMO.</p>"
;	000000000300088151	;	"	<p>Anthocyanins are potent antioxidant compounds with a wide range of health-promoting properties, especially for your muscles, providing faster relief from the minor discomfort and stiffness that can follow exercise.<sup>1-6</sup> And tart cherries have a very high anthocyanin content.</p> <p>Anthocyanins support exercise performance by promoting healthy blood flow and vascular function, supporting metabolic pathways, and inhibiting peripheral muscle fatigue. <sup>7-8. </sup>In a randomized controlled trial, consuming tart cherry juice twice daily over seven days provided substantial relief in muscle discomfort after a strenuous long-distance running event compared with placebo.<sup>11</sup></p> <p> </p> <p><strong>References:</strong><br />1. <em>The Journal of Nutrition</em>. 2009;139(10):1896-1900.<br />2. <em>British Journal of Sports Medicine</em>. 2006;40(8):679-683.<br />3. <em>Scandinavian journal of medicine &amp; science in sports</em>. 2010;20(6):843-852.<br />4. <em>Compr Rev Food Sci Food Saf</em>. 2013;12(5):483-508.<br />5. <em>Crit Rev Food Sci Nutr</em>. 2017;57(8):1729-1741.<br />6. <em>Food Nutr Res</em>. 2017;61(1):1361779.<br />7. <em>Nutrients</em>. 2017;9(8)<br />8. <em>Int J Sport Nutr Exerc Metab</em>. 2018:1-27.<br />9. <em>Eur J Sport Sci</em>. 2019;19(1):95-102.<br />10. <em>Nutrients</em>. 2016;8(7)<br />11. <em>J Int Soc Sports Nutr</em>. 2010;7:17.<br />12. <em>Br J Sports Med</em>. 2006;40(8):679-83.<br />13. <em>Scand J Med Sci Sports</em>. 2010;20(6):843-52</p>"
;	000000000300089664	;	"	<p>Taurine is a semi-essential amino acid that plays a specialized role as an ion and pH buffer in the body and is also an antioxidant.* Free form amino acid, high purity, well tolerated. Taurine supports the cardiovascular system, mitochondrial function, as well as cellular health and communication.*</p>"
;	000000000300085600	;	"	<ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">Supports healthy tissue and muscle development*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Provides amino acids, the building blocks of protein</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Powder form for maximum absorption</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Potency and quality guaranteed</p> </li> </ul> <p class=""p1"">Taurine is an essential amino acid that supports healthy tissue and muscle development and helps the body better absorb nutrients. It also holds antioxidant properties and is good for overall wellness.* Each teaspoon provides 4 g of Taurine, and its powder form promotes maximum absorption.</p>"
;	000000000300103833	;	"	<p class=""p1""><strong>Tauromag-SR </strong>is ideal for men and women who are eager to maintain brain health, cognitive function, and positive mood as they age.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">Tauromag, a lipophilic (“fat-loving”) form of magnesium known as magnesium N-acetyltaurinate. This innovative form of magnesium and N-acetyltaurine (a derivative of the amino acid taurine) helps overcome the barrier that hinders the absorption of common forms of magnesium in the brain. In fact, it’s so innovative, it’s patented.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">Pre-clinical research demonstrates Tauromag is better able to cross the blood-brain barrier and enter brain cells than common forms of magnesium. Tauromag is also structurally similar to key biochemical messengers in the brain (neurotransmitters), which may play a role in its potential to help modulate neuron activity.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">With our proprietary sustained-release technology, each tablet releases this brain-friendly magnesium compound in a slow, steady manner for absorption over 5 to 7 hours. In this way, it’s readily available for uptake by the brain where it can exert its neuroprotective and mood benefits.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">The brain benefits of magnesium are well known. Magnesium helps regulate nerve impulses and supports communication between neurons. It also helps activate neurotransmitters involved in promoting mood regulation, stress management, and overall brain function. Moreover, magnesium plays a vital role in maintaining synaptic plasticity (the ability of neurons to create new connections and adapt existing ones), which is essential for learning and memory formation.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">If brain health and mental wellbeing are top health priorities as you age, consider adding the innovative power of Tauromag-SR to your supplement routine.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">Tauromag is a trademark of AIDP, Inc.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
