;	000000000300100281	;	"	<p>Feminine Resilience Elixir - This gentle yet powerful adaptogenic tonic supports a healthy female reproductive and endocrine system, no matter the time of the month. It is designed to help maintain hormonal harmony, balanced moods, sustained energy, and restful sleep. *</p> <p>This gentle yet powerful adaptogenic tonic supports a healthy female reproductive and endocrine system, no matter the time of the month. It is designed to help maintain hormonal harmony, balanced moods, sustained energy and restful sleep.*</p> <p class=""p1""><strong>Adaptogenic Botanicals</strong> – Adaptogens are botanicals that support the body’s response to daily stressors while boosting health and vitality. These botanicals are shown to address female health concerns exacerbated by tension, including fatigue, menstrual irregularity, and low libido.†</p> <p class=""p1""><strong>Monthly Regularity + Resilience</strong> – An exclusive blend of 16 herbs crafted by master herbalist Dan Moriarty. These botanicals help maintain menstrual regularity and low levels of menstrual discomfort. Chaste Tree berry is included for its reputed thermoregulatory effects, while Shatavari is known to produce natural phytoestrogens.†</p> <p class=""p1""><strong>Unsurpassed Bioavailability</strong> – This highly absorbable liposomal adaptogenic tonic offers fast uptake and equal or greater potency than standard dry herbs or tinctures, for results you can feel.†</p>"
