;	000000000300091206	;	"	<p>Provides tissue from the thymus gland of high quality, range-fed sheep raised in New Zealand and Australia. Traditionally used to support thymus gland health and normal, healthy immune function.*</p> <p>The tissue is rinsed, de-fatted, and lyophilized meaning it is immediately frozen then subjected to a high vacuum to remove moisture. This sophisticated and sensitive technique respects the delicate nature of the material.* In addition, our glandulars are subject to strict formulation standads, and in-process and finished product testing to ensure a high-quality nutritional supplement.</p>"
;	000000000300085639	;	"	<p>Herb and mineral blend to maintain a healthy thyroid. Contains lower iodine dosage than Thyroid Px.*</p>"
;	000000000300096645	;	"	<ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li>Support and maintenance of the manufacture of thyroid hormone from Zinc, Vitamin E, Iodine and Tyrosine*</li> <li>Promotes the conversion of thyroid hormone with Zinc, Copper and Selenium*</li> <li>Botanical support from Ashwagandha and Rhodiola*</li> <li>Combined with exercise, ThyroFem supports increased sensitivity of the thyroid tissue to thyroid hormone*</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300088739	;	"	<p>Provides high quality thyroid tissue, formulated according to strict specifications by Allergy Research Group<sup>®</sup> and Dr. Nicholas Gonzalez M.D. This product is sourced from range-fed animals raised Australia and New Zealand, where animal husbandry regulations prohibit the feeding and veterinary practices that have caused problems in other countries.* The material is lyophilized, meaning immediately frozen and subjected to a high vacuum that removes the moisture. This sophisticated technique respects the delicate nature of the material, and except for the water content, leaves in everything that naturally occurs in glandular tissue.* Our glandulars are subject to in-process and finished product testing.</p>"
;	000000000300092125	;	"	<p>The health of the thyroid gland impacts how you feel on a daily basis. Because it helps regulate metabolism, every major system in the body is affected by altered levels of thyroid hormones. Gaia Herbs’ unique formula supports normal thyroid hormone production—helping you maintain optimal weight, neuromuscular tone, and cardiovascular health.*</p>"
;	000000000300090277	;	"	<p>Thyroid Nutrition is formulated to support the thyroid with key nutritional factors, including iodine (Iodoral<sup>®</sup>), selenium, zinc, tyrosine, and vitamins A and B12.* Extracts of ashwagandha (<em>Withania somnifera</em>) and <em>Coleus forskohlii</em> are included for their positive impacts on thyroid function, directly and indirectly.* Ashwagandha can promote a balanced approach to stress, and the active compound forskolin from <em>Coleus forskohlii</em> plays a role in thyroid hormone release and activation.*</p>"
;	000000000300085640	;	"	<p>Features herbs and nutrients to support thyroid function. This formula is the most potent support we offer for healthy thyroid function. Provides the thyroid with the required nutrition and substrates. Supplies the building blocks for T3/T4 hormone synthesis. Promotes the activation of thyroid hormone.*</p>"
;	000000000300089665	;	"	<p>Trimethylglycine (TMG) assists homocysteine to be metabolized into methionine, resulting in the production of DMG (dimethylglycine).* The two major functions of TMG in humans are as an osmolyte to protect cells under stress and as a methyl-group donor.*</p>"
;	000000000300103839	;	"	<p>Tonalin<sup>®</sup> CLA is a great way to reduce fat and increase lean muscle mass safely and effectively.*</p> <p>Unlike many supplements for weight management, Tonalin<sup>®</sup> CLA does not contain any stimulants.* Tonalin<sup>®</sup> CLA is not only safe, its other and equally important health benefits make it a sound supplement choice for overall better health.*</p>"
;	000000000300093480	;	"	<p>Trace Minerals Complex by Seeking Health provides 10 essential trace elements in forms that are well-tolerated and easily absorbed, plus silica from horsetail.</p> <p>Trace minerals, or ""microminerals,"" are important nutrients that the body needs in small amounts to maintain proper function.* Typically taken up from the soil by plants, trace minerals may be lacking in the modern diet due to decreasing nutrient content in the soils used in commercial farming.* Iron is excluded, as routine iron supplementation is not required by most adult men and women.*</p>"
;	000000000300104776	;	"	<p class=""p2"">● May help support mineral utilization and balance*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p2"">● May help support numerous enzymatic reactions*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p2"">● May help support healthy growth and development*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p3"">● Iron-free and copper-free*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300088262	;	"	<p>A unique, chewable, raspberry-flavored formula providing support for the inhibitory neurotransmitter system—both serotonergic and GABAergic neurotransmission.* May be used when calm or relaxation is needed in the short term as well as for rebalancing the inhibitory system over the long term.* Balance between inhibitory and excitatory neurotransmitters is vital to health and well-being. Inhibitory neurotransmitters such as serotonin and GABA control excitatory signals in the nervous system. That’s why supporting inhibitory neurotransmitters often results in an overall calming and relaxing effect.</p>"
;	000000000300093088	;	"	<p>Three zinc chelates supplying 30 mg of elemental zinc per capsule plus copper to help maintain proper zinc-copper balance and digestive enzymes for enhanced absorption*</p>"
