;	000000000300092919	;	"	<p>Tricycline<sup>®</sup> is a microbial balancing formula that can enhance and complement the use of probiotics (friendly bacteria) and other nutrients that support gastrointestinal (GI) tract health.* Black walnut, goldenseal and sweet wormwood are herbs that have been used traditionally as microbial balancers.* Combining their essential components with citrus seed extract gives the formula increased potential to support balanced intestinal microbiology.*</p>"
;	000000000300084784	;	"	<p>Fish oil rich in omega-3 fatty acids eicosapentaenoic acid (EPA) and docosahexaenoic acid (DHA) support cardiovascular health by improving lipid profile.* Other health benefits of omega-3 fatty acids may include maintenance of healthy inflammatory response support central nervous system health.* Trident SAP 66:33 is a fish oil of exceptional purity, standardized to highest concentrations, and tailored carefully to impart these health benefits.* </p>"
;	000000000300094421	;	"	<p>SCIENCE-BASED OMEGA-3 OILS OF EXCEPTIONAL PURITY FOR OPTIMAL HEALTH*</p> <p>Trident SAP 66:33 Lemon Flavour is a fish oil of exceptional purity, standardized to the highest concentration. Each softgel provides 990 mg of EPA and DHA in a 2:1 ratio. Omega-3 EPA and DHA support cardiovascular health by promoting healthy triglyceride levels, support joint tissue health by supporting a healthy inflammatory response, and support optimal cognitive health and brain function.</p> <p>Trident SAP 66:33 Lemon Flavour contains vitamin E as an antioxidant and is hermetically sealed to be secure against entry of oxygen, ensuring maximum purity, freshness, and stability of the oil through to expiration. Third-party test results guarantee Trident SAP 66:33 Lemon Flavour is free of heavy metals, PCBs, pesticides, volatile organics, and other impurities.*</p>"
;	000000000300096855	;	"	<p>Features three forms of chelated magnesium to support bone health, proper nerve function, adrenal hormonal balance and nutrient absorption.*</p> <p>Magnesium is an essential mineral and must be taken in through the diet. However, with over processed foods and depleted soil, it is difficult to get the optimal daily intake. Magnesium supplementation is a way to support such intake</p>"
;	000000000300093086	;	"	<p class=""p1"">100 mg per capsule elemental magnesium, including malate and citrate forms, for optimal absorption and tissue availability</p>"
;	000000000300084747	;	"	<p>One of the oldest and most renowned herbal formulas from the Vedic tradition, Triphala is a gentle blend of three certified organic, wildcrafted fruits to support the entire GI tract. Nutrient-dense Amla, also known as Amalaki (Phyllanthus emblica), is classified as a “rasayana"" or ""restorative"" in Ayurveda. Bibhitaki (Terminalia bellerica) brings a gentle laxative action to the classic Triphala formula. Haritaki (Terminalia chebula), known to support bowel and gut health, supports all three doshas in Ayurveda.* Vegan, Gluten Free, USDA Certified Organic, Non GMO Project Verified</p>"
;	000000000300085759	;	"	<p>TruBifidoPRO<sup>®</sup> contains 50 billion CFU of five Bifidobacteria probiotics that support regularity and immunity by fortifying your colon with beneficial bacteria.*</p>"
;	000000000300086245	;	"	<p>TruEase + Curcumin is a patented, synergistic formulation, which delivers unmatched therapeutic benefits of Curcumin, Cannabidiol (CBD), Beta-caryophyllene, &amp; Vitamin D3 powered by the VESIsorb<sup>®</sup> delivery system for maximum absorption and bioavailability. Improved absorption directly translates into better support to the body’s natural recovery as well as joint, brain and immune health.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300086246	;	"	<p>TruEase<sup>®</sup> is the best source for the most advanced multi-spectrum, efficacious, and phytocannabinoid rich hemp oil encapsulated in VESIsorb<sup>®</sup>’s patented naturally self-assembling colloidal delivery system to optimize absorption. Hemp oil supports normal pain associated with aging and promotes cognitive function and healthy sleep. TruEase<sup>®</sup> utilizes a proprietary extraction process that eliminates solvents and impurities to produce non-detectible THC content.*</p>"
