;	000000000300086230	;	"	<p>Promotes healthy liver and digestive function.<sup>*</sup><br /> Used in Ayurveda for skin, digestive and liver support<sup>*</sup></p> <p>We prepare Turmeric from the fully mature rhizome of Certified Organic <em>Curcuma longa</em> plants. We directly import whole Turmeric fingers or sliced rhizome from its native regions. We mill whole or sliced rhizomes at the last moment before extraction to retain the herb’s characteristic taste and aroma. The herb has a long history in Ayurveda and Traditional Chinese Herbalism.</p>"
;	000000000300093004	;	"	<p>Joint Health Support and a Healthy Inflammatory Response Associated with Physical Activity*</p> <p>Natural Orange Citrus flavored soft chews featuring clinically Studied TurmiPure Gold<sup>®</sup>  Turmeric Extract shown to deliver 24x greater absorption than standard turmeric extracts without requiring the addition of black pepper extract. Each soft chew provides 300mg of TurmiPure Gold<sup>®</sup>  turmeric extract to support a healthy inflammatory response associated physical activity and joint health.* HumanN Turmeric Chews are naturally flavored, gluten free and non- GMO.</p>"
;	000000000300084762	;	"	<p>Whole herb Turmeric is combined with curcumin and Trikatu, which contains piperine, for maximum absorption. Turmeric is valued for its ability to support the body’s healthy inflammatory response. Turmeric is clinically proven to support joint health, and also strengthens pancreatic and liver function. It has been used for thousands of years as a traditional herbal remedy.</p> <p>Vegan, Gluten-Free, USDA Certified Organic, Non-GMO Project Verified</p>"
;	000000000300092933	;	"	<p>To support staying healthy, you need a science-based dose of vitamins and minerals every day. Life Extension’s best in class Two-Per-Day multivitamin provides a full spectrum of essential vitamins, minerals and other nutrients that meet or exceed the Recommended Dietary Allowance (RDA) for nearly every ingredient where an RDA exists.</p>"
;	000000000300092601	;	"	<p>Highest-intensity, NSF Certified for Sport  omega-3 fish oil for musculoskeletal and cardiovascular support, focus, and endurance*</p> <p>Ultimate Omega 2X Sport delivers a mega serving of 1000 mg omega-3 EPA+DHA per soft gel to meet the essential-nutrient needs of athletes. Within muscle cells, omega-3 fatty acids support the efficiency and strength of muscle contraction and help tissues recover from physical stress.* This powerful formula also supports athletes' cardiovascular system health and may support optimal range of motion and neuromuscular function.*</p>"
;	000000000300092602	;	"	<p class=""p1"">EPA-dominant fish oil concentrate with vitamin D3 that is NSF Certified for Sport<sup>®</sup></p> <p class=""p1"">Ultimate Omega-D3 Sport adds 25 mcg (1000 IU) vitamin D3 to our high potency EPA-rich fish oil—two key nutrients for athletes. This 2:1 EPA to DHA omega-3 blend provides additional immune support, helping cells appropriately respond to stress while promoting cardiovascular health, joint mobility, and focus.* Additionally, mechanistic studies suggest vitamin D may play a significant role in preserving the adequate production of certain peptides commonly used to support aspects of the innate immune response within the lungs.*</p>"
;	000000000300091083	;	"	<p>There is no one binder that can eliminate all toxins. Many binders ‘miss’ key toxins and allow for their recirculation. Ours binds to and removes a wide array of toxins in the GI for a safer, more thorough detox.*</p>"
;	000000000300083881	;	"	<p>Ultra Binder® Sensitive Formula is a universal binder blend that captures toxins, optimizes gut health, and supports a balanced inflammatory response.* This gentle, effective blend is especially designed for sulfur-sensitive individuals and those with delicate digestion. The formulation of bentonite clay, activated charcoal, zeolite, and chitosan is enhanced with soothing acacia gum and aloe vera acting as an extra organ of detoxification to ensure the safe and complete elimination of toxic compounds from the body.*</p> <p>A 4 g serving (1 teaspoon) of Ultra Binder® Sensitive Formula delivers 2 g of a proprietary binder blend. Each bottle contains 30 4 g servings.</p>"
;	000000000300083882	;	"	<p>Ultra Binder® is a universal binder blend that captures toxins, optimizes gut health, and supports a balanced inflammatory response in a convenient, one-dose packet.* This comprehensive formula adheres to common toxins including heavy metals, pesticides, herbicides, endocrine disrupters, drug residues, food additives, as well as mold and bacterial toxins.* The combination of bentonite clay, activated charcoal, zeolite, chitosan, and Quicksilver Scientific’s proprietary mercury-binding complex, IMD Intestinal Cleanse, is enhanced with soothing acacia gum and aloe vera.</p> <p>Each box of Ultra Binder® stick packs contains 20 servings with each stick pack delivering 4 grams of a proprietary binder blend.</p>"
;	000000000300092927	;	"	<p>It’s essential for men to maintain prostate health as they age. Ultra Prostate Formula delivers a dozen complementary ingredients that support prostate cell health and healthy urination patterns and help maintain hormone balance.</p>"
;	000000000300088691	;	"	<p>Ultra Vitamin is the ultimate multi-vitamin blend designed to support whole-body health. Our formula combines the Quicksilver Scientific Methyl B Complex with vitamins A, C, D3, E, K1 and K2. The carotenoids lutein, zeaxanthin, and lycopene round out our formula, offering their own array of unique health benefits. OPTIMIZE METHYLATION WITH BIOAVAILABLE B VITAMINS.</p>"
;	000000000300086256	;	"	<p class=""p1"">UNIQUE E<sup>®</sup> Tocotrienols — Each beef softgel contains Tocopherol-FREE High-Delta and Gamma Delta-Gold® Tocotrienols derived from the Annatto Bean and contains the highest concentrates at 125 mg per softgel. Unlike products derived from palm or rice bran oil our product contains no alpha-tocopherol—which has been shown to inhibit assimilation of tocotrienols in the body. Taking them separately achieves maximum benefits. Our health professionals recommend taking with the evening meal.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> <p class=""p1"">Tocotrienols help in the maintenance of cholesterol levels that are already within the normal range.* Research indicates that they may also contribute to improving vascular and cardiometabolic integrity, help support a healthy cardiovascular system, and help maintain normal blood glucose levels.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300086253	;	"	<p class=""p1"">UNIQUE E<sup>®</sup> Mixed Tocopherols - are encapsulated in Kosher beef softgels and consist of the natural form of vitamin E as obtained through the diet and as used by the body. The concentrated formula provides the synergistic benefits of the complete vitamin E tocopherol complex (d-alpha, d-beta, d-gamma, and d-delta tocopherols) and delivers the highest biological activity by providing the optimum proportions of the complex in the body - and is completely void of fillers or additives that can turn rancid.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300086257	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Natural Moisturizing Cream – Unique, novel formulation combines excellent skin moisturizing with wellness benefits. UNIQUE E<sup>®</sup> Natural Moisturizing Cream – Coconut Scented formula using ALL-NATURAL ingredients including Mixed Tocopherols, Tocotrienols and Vitamins A &amp; D. Provides lasting moisturizing effects, keeps the skin soft, supple, and smooth feeling all day. Guaranteed NO harsh chemicals, sulfates, parabens, dyes, phthalates, or petrochemicals (no petrolatum, mineral oil, or paraffin).<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
