;	000000000300086241	;	"	<p>Traditional support for healthy kidney and bladder function.<sup>*</sup> Urinary System Support features Goldenrod extract prepared from the certified organic flowering tops of <em>Solidago canadensis</em> plants grown on our farms in southern Oregon. It also features certified organic Corn Silk (Z<em>ea mays</em>) and certified organic or responsibly wildcrafted Uva-Ursi (<em>Arctostaphylos uva-ursi</em>) extracts.</p>"
