;	000000000300000963	;	"	<p><strong>UritraX™</strong> features D-mannose, a simple sugar that occurs naturally in cranberries and pineapple. Research suggests that D-mannose interferes with adhesion of <em>E coli</em> to the bladder wall, thereby supporting a healthy urinary tract.*</p>"
