;	000000000300086853	;	"	<p>D-Mannose is a simple sugar that supports urinary tract health.*</p> <p>U-Tract<sup>®</sup> Is a unique product designed to support urinary tract health.<sup>*</sup>  The active ingredient, D-Mannose, is a simple sugar that is found in many fruits such as cranberries, pineapples and other plant sources.  Small amounts of U-Tract<sup>®</sup> are metabolized by the body, with the remainder being excreted via the urine.  As U-Tract<sup>®</sup> is flushed, it maintains a healthy environment in the urinary tract, supporting the urinary tract mucosal surface and helping to bind and flush from the system.<sup>*</sup></p>"
