;	000000000300086590	;	"	<p>VeinoBlend contains select herbs and nutrients supporting improved venous tone and function, promoting healthy circulation in the lower extremities. *</p> <p><strong>Vitamin C</strong> promotes collagen manufacture thereby supporting vein structure and integrity. *</p> <p><strong>Grape seed extract</strong> and <strong>Bioflavonoids</strong> are rich in antioxidants promoting strength and integrity for veins, capillaries, and the entire vascular system. *</p> <p><strong>Bromelain</strong> enzyme maintains healthy veins. *</p> <p>Circulation supportive herbs: <strong>Gotu Kola, Horse Chestnut, Butcher’s Broom</strong>. *</p>"
;	000000000300096644	;	"	<ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li>Vitamin C (ascorbic acid) as a specialized suppository tablet so it is not caustic to the vaginal environment</li> <li>6 Night suggested usage promotes maintenance of the healthy and normal vaginal pH, may be repeated if needed; full instructions are on packaging</li> <li>Vaginal odor is normal. However, it should not be unpleasant. V-Fresh naturally supports the preferred normal acidic environment of the vagina which naturally resolves undesired vaginal odor.</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300086244	;	"	<p>Supports healthy function of the immune system.* VI-BE-GONE features Lomatium extract prepared from the fresh root of <em>Lomatium dissectum</em> plants, responsibly wildcrafted exclusively for us in its rocky, Oregon habitat. It also features St. John’s Wort responsibly wildcrafted in Oregon’s Siskiyou and Cascade mountains and extracted fresh each summer near the solstice.</p>"
;	000000000300097154	;	"	<p>Vinpocetine is a supplement derived from the alkaloid vincamine from the periwinkle plant that helps support memory &amp; cognition &amp; helps you maintain concentration.</p>"
;	000000000300005292	;	"	<p><strong>Viragraphis™</strong> features three herbs that have been used traditionally for immune support and stimulation. Contemporary research on these herbs—andrographis, licorice root, and indigowoad<em>—confirms the wisdom of their historical use. XYMOGEN's Viragraphis formula may be especially helpful in supporting cytokine balance and respiratory function.*</em></p>"
;	000000000300101115	;	"	<p>By combining lactose-free milk protein isolate with collagen peptides, Vital Performance™ Protein Powder delivers 25g of protein designed to complement your fitness routine. This anytime protein powder supports improved recovery, stimulates muscle protein synthesis and promotes healthy bones, joints and tendons.**</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li> <p class=""p2""><strong>Improved Recovery**</strong>: Contains all 9 essential amino acids, 25g of protein (including 10g of collagen) &amp; 5g of sugar<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> </li> <li> <p class=""p2""><strong>Anytime Protein</strong>: This protein powder is ideal for both post-workout recovery and anytime nutrition.**<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> </li> <li> <p class=""p2""><strong>Dietary Compliant</strong>: Using lactose-free milk protein isolate allows consumers, including those who are lactose-intolerant, to benefit from a high-quality, complete protein.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> </li> <li> <p class=""p2""><strong>NSF Certified For Sport®</strong>: Ensures – through third party testing – that users are consuming a safe supplement with contents that match its label<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300005293	;	"	<p><strong>VitalVasc<sup><span style=""font-size: 7.63889px;"">® </span></sup></strong>combines 3 safe, standardized, food-derived extracts that have been shown to support antioxidant activity, nitric oxide synthesis, or both. These mechanisms contribute to arterial health and the maintenance of blood pressure that is already within a healthy range.*</p>"
;	000000000300104690	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Support immune defenses throughout the year to help you through unexpected health challenges. Elderberry and Vitamin C join forces in this fast-acting immune-support tonic powered by our liposomal delivery technology.*<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300088683	;	"	<p>Vitamin C (L-ascorbic acid) is a powerful water-soluble nutrient with pleiotropic functions; it fortifies the body against oxidative stress, regulates immunity, and serves as a cofactor in the biosynthesis of connective tissue, among many other roles. Unlike many other mammals, the human body cannot manufacture vitamin C endogenously, necessitating its inclusion in the diet. Intestinal absorption of oral vitamin C is limited, falling to less than 50 percent at doses greater than 1 gram; historically, this has made it exceedingly difficult to achieve therapeutic levels of vitamin C in the body. Our revolutionary Liposomal Vitamin C formula, which offers highly bioavailable L-ascorbic acid in our advanced liposomal delivery system, is poised to change this paradigm. Our Liposomal Vitamin C bypasses the absorption constraints posed by the intestine and readily diffuses across membranes, rapidly delivering this vital nutrient to your patients’ cells.</p>"
;	000000000300093964	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Vitamin C and Bio-Quercetin Phytosome is a high-potency vitamin C supplement with an ultraabsorbable form of quercetin, encased in a plant-derived phytosome delivery system. Vitamin C supports immune health, collagen production, a healthy cardiovascular system and more. Quercetin is a flavonoid that complements vitamin C’s health benefits.*</p>"
;	000000000300088159	;	"	<p><span style=""font-size: 10pt;"">Getting enough vitamin C is important for overall health but the human body can't make it, so you have to get it through diet or supplements.1 Some studies show that vitamin C supplementation supports certain aspects of cardiovascular health.<sup>2</sup></span></p> <p><span style=""font-size: 10pt;"">There's a long tradition of using quercetin to relieve the effects of seasonal immune challenges. In a randomized clinical trial, quercetin supplementation encouraged a healthy immune response in physically fit older adults.<sup>4</sup></span></p> <p><span style=""font-size: 10pt;"">Another randomized controlled trial found similar results in trained athletes.<sup>5</sup> And in doubleblind clinical trials, quercetin promoted a healthy inflammatory response, reduced oxidative stress and helped maintain overall health.<sup>6,7</sup></span></p>"
;	000000000300085601	;	"	<p>Vitamin C Gummies in tangy orange flavor provide 250 mg of vitamin C per gummy, which support healthy immune system function.*</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">Supports healthy immune system function*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">250 mg of vitamin C per serving</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Gummies with a tangy orange flavor</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Potency and quality guaranteed</p> </li> </ul> <p>For those who have trouble swallowing supplements or who prefer a delicious way to get their vitamin C, one tangy, orange-flavored serving of Vitamin C Gummies provides 250 mg of vitamin C, which supports a healthy immune system.* Plus they're free of artificial flavors, sweeteners, and dyes. Arm your body with the antioxidant power it needs to stay healthy with Carlson<br />Vitamin C Gummies.*</p>"
;	000000000300085261	;	"	<p>Vitamin C Gummies give kids (and adults) a delicious way to get the vitamin C they need.* Since the body doesn't store vitamin C, it's important to get a healthy daily amount. These delicious gummies help the body absorb iron, build strong bones, and stay well.* It’s an ideal supplement for ages 4+.</p>"
;	000000000300088430	;	"	<p>Enhances the appearance of skin tone and texture while deeply nourishing and quenching dry skin. Formulated with Vitamin C to brighten and help fade the appearance of hyperpigmentation, Vitamin E to help protect the skin from future damage, and Hyaluronic Acid to deeply penetrate the skin to restore hydration and suppleness.</p> <p class=""p1"">How this product will help you:</p> <ul> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Helps improve texture and tone for an all over brighter and smoother complexion</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Deeply hydrates and restores moisture levels</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Helps protect the skin from harmful free radicals</p> </li> <li class=""p1""> <p class=""p1"">Restores skin vibrancy and reduces the appearance of hyperpigmentation, fine lines, and wrinkles</p> </li> </ul>"
;	000000000300095939	;	"	<p>Vitamin C-PAK® provides you with three essential immune-supporting nutrients – vitamin C, vitamin D and zinc – in an effervescent powder</p> <p>Year round, you’re faced with a wide variety of environmental stressors that can compromise your overall health – and wintertime seems to provide some of the greatest challenges.</p> <p>Your immune system is your first line of defense against everyday threats. To strengthen and protect it, healthy lifestyle choices, such as eating unprocessed whole foods, implementing daily exercise, getting optimal sleep and taking special care of your digestive tract, are key. However, even with all this, you may find yourself needing an extra helping hand.</p> <p><strong>Vitamin C-PAK<sup>®</sup></strong> provides you with three essential immune-supporting nutrients – vitamin C, vitamin D and zinc – in an effervescent powder that:</p> <ul> <li> <p class=""p1"">Delivers all-day immune support in a convenient packet.*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Easily dissolves in water for a refreshing, fizzy drink with fast-acting absorption.*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Contains a gentler, unique form of vitamin C to help enhance bioavailability.*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Utilizes vitamin D3 (cholecalciferol) that your body naturally makes from sunlight.</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Provides the benefits of zinc without the metallic taste.</p> </li> <li>Comes lightly sweetened with organic stevia and offers a delightful orange flavor with zero grams of total sugars.</li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Is produced without gluten.</p> </li> </ul> <p>Plus, with the proprietary lipid-soluble vitamin C formulated in Vitamin C-PAK, you receive one of the most advanced bioavailable forms of the vitamin yet developed, without the occasional digestive distress.*</p>"
;	000000000300095940	;	"	<p>Vitamin C-PAK® with Quercetin provides you with three essential immune-supporting nutrients – vitamin C, vitamin D and zinc – plus a beneficial flavonol – quercetin – in an effervescent powder</p> <p>Year round, you’re faced with a wide variety of environmental stressors that can compromise your overall health – and wintertime seems to provide some of the greatest challenges.</p> <p>Your immune system is your first line of defense against everyday threats. To strengthen and protect it, healthy lifestyle choices, such as eating unprocessed whole foods, implementing daily exercise, getting optimal sleep and taking special care of your digestive tract, are key. However, even with all this, you may find yourself needing an extra helping hand.</p> <p>Vitamin C-PAK® with Quercetin provides you with three essential immune-supporting nutrients – vitamin C, vitamin D and zinc – plus a beneficial flavonol – quercetin – in an effervescent powder that:</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li> <p class=""p1"">Delivers all-day immune support in a convenient packet.*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Easily dissolves in water for a refreshing, fizzy drink with fast-acting absorption.*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Contains a gentler, unique form of vitamin C to help enhance bioavailability.*</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Utilizes vitamin D3 (cholecalciferol) that your body naturally makes from sunlight.</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Provides the benefits of zinc without the metallic taste.</p> </li> <li>Includes Quercetin Phytosome Complex, which works synergistically with vitamin C and zinc, and offers up to 20 times the bioavailability of regular quercetin.*</li> <li>Comes lightly sweetened with organic stevia and offers a delightful orange flavor with zero grams of total sugars.</li> <li>Is produced without gluten or preservatives.</li> </ul> <p>Plus, with the proprietary lipid-soluble vitamin C formulated in Vitamin C-PAK with Quercetin, you receive one of the most advanced bioavailable forms of the vitamin yet developed, without the occasional digestive distress.*</p> <p> </p>"
;	000000000300090797	;	"	<ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li>May help support bone health and healthy bone metabolism as part of a healthy diet rich in calcium*</li> <li>May help support immune health*</li> <li>May help support healthy growth and development*</li> <li>May help support circulatory health*</li> </ul> <p><strong>Vitamin D3 + K2 Drops by Seeking Health provides 12.5 mcg (500 IU) of D3 (as</strong><strong> cholecalciferol) and 50 mcg of K2 (as menaquinone-4) in each drop</strong>. Vitamin D is essential for the functioning of many important systems in the body, and recent research has suggested that we may need more vitamin D than previously thought for optimal immune function and long-term health. Vitamin K is an important fat-soluble vitamin essential for circulatory health and normal bone mineralization.</p>"
;	000000000300102829	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Vitamin D-3 is a fat-soluble vitamin that has long been studied as an essential nutrient for bone health. It is also a critical nutrient for immune system function. Deficiency in vitamin D is associated with increased autoimmunity as well as increased susceptibility to infection. Vitamin D may also have an effect on mental health, as deficiency has also been associated with low mood and impaired cognitive performance. Although vitamin D can be synthesized in the skin upon exposure to sunlight, many environmental factors result in a significant portion of the population having sub-optimal vitamin D levels.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></p>"
;	000000000300094667	;	"	<p>Vitamin D3 5000 Gummies provide a proactive dose of the natural, most easily absorbed and utilized form of vitamin D (cholecalciferol).* Just one delicious, passion-fruit flavored gummy surpasses the daily value of vitamin D to help correct insufficient levels, and provide research-backed support for immune health, strong bones, and a positive mood.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300093005	;	"	<p>Vitamin D3 Chews provides 5,000 IU's of D3, or cholecalciferol per serving to support immune respiratory, and mood health.* It is also essential for the absorption of calcium, phosphorus, and minerals needed for bone health. With a natural mixed berry flavor, Vitamin D3 Chews tastes great and enjoyable to use consistently.</p>"
;	000000000300092408	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Daily dose of vitamin D3 for bone, mood, and immune health in delicious Wild Berry gummies*</p> <p class=""p1"">Vitamin D3 Gummies are a delicious way to promote the body’s absorption of calcium and phosphorus, support immune system function, and help regulate mood and sleep rhythms.* A number of biological and environmental risk factors can make it difficult for people to obtain adequate levels of this important vitamin, even when they get enough sun exposure. With 25 mcg (1000 IU) of vitamin D per serving and a great Wild Berry flavor, these gummies make it easy to get enough daily vitamin D3.</p>"
;	000000000300085277	;	"	<p>Vitamin D3 Gummies KIDS are a safe, effective, and delicious way to give kids the vitamin D3 they need each day. Each gummy contains 400 IU natural vitamin D3 (cholecalciferol), the form of vitamin D our bodies make naturally from sunlight. In Wild Watermelon Splash flavor, these gummies are sure to be a favorite.</p>"
;	000000000300085262	;	"	<p>Vitamin D3+K2 Gummies provide a convenient way to get a healthy dose of these important nutrients that work together to help build and maintain healthy bones.* Vitamin D3 helps the body absorb calcium from the gut and reabsorb calcium from the kidneys, while vitamin K2 supports the formation of healthy bones, redirecting calcium away from the arteries.* In combination, vitamins D3 and K2 help the body use calcium effectively, maintain healthy bone density, and support cardiovascular health.*</p>"
;	000000000300097518	;	"	<p>Vitamin D3 + K2 gummies are a delicious pairing of two essential nutrients that each function more effectively in the presence of the other. When combined, these two highly bioavailable ingredients help support strong and healthy bones, heart health, and immunity.*</p>"
;	000000000300088736	;	"	<p>Vitamin E as d-alpha-tocopheryl acid succinate, as a dry powder in a hard-shell vegetarian capsule. Provides vitamin E, and succinate, which plays a role in the Krebs cycle, our major metabolic pathway for generating energy.* Vitamin E plays a role in lipid metabolism, and is a fatsoluble antioxidant with liver-protective activity.* Succinate plays a role in the Krebs cycle, our major metabolic pathway for generating energy.* Vitamin E also supports normal, healthy cardiovascular, liver, and cellular membrane function, and may interact beneficially with the other fat-soluble vitamins.*</p>"
;	000000000300092124	;	"	<p>Healthy hormone levels are necessary for a woman’s physical and emotional well being. Chaste Tree berry has long been used to support hormone production and balance.* Gaia Herbs uses certified organic Chaste Tree berry to provide a full spectrum herbal extract for women’s health.</p>"
;	000000000300106214	;	"	<p>A multi-species probiotic blend formulated for intravaginal use, and from the brand you trust for female care needs. Formulated by Dr. Tori Hudson with the probiotic species relevant to overall vaginal balance and vibrance. Each capsule contains only 2 billion microorganisms, making them safe to insert daily, or as advised.</p> <p>Not Designed for Oral Consumption. Consult your physician before using if you are currently pregnant. </p>"
;	000000000300099962	;	"	<p>Waistline Control™ contains a patented blend of Sphaeranthus indicus flower and Garcinia mangostana (mangosteen) fruit rind extracts. In clinical studies, people who took this combo lost 5% or more of their total weight—along with significant reductions in waist and hip circumferences!</p>"
;	000000000300088155	;	"	<p>The data supporting the value of water-soluble pumpkin seed extract is particularly strong in studies performed in women.<sup>7,8</sup> Studies of aging men also demonstrated positive results.<sup>6,9,10</sup> The pumpkin seed has a long history of use in helping to maintain healthy bladder function.</p> <p>Japanese scientists have patented a method to obtain the water-soluble constituents of the pumpkin seed, which are absorbed far more efficiently into the bloodstream. These watersoluble pumpkin seed extracts appear to be the active constituents that help with the urinary discomforts endured by so many maturing women and men.</p> <p> </p> <p><strong>References:</strong><br />1. <em>European urology.</em> 2003;44(6):637-649.<br />2. <em>The Journal of urology</em>. 1986;136(5):1021-1025.<br />3. <em>Journal of traditional and complementary medicine</em>. 2014;4(1):72-74.<br />4. <em>Nutrition Research and Practice</em>. 2009;3(4):323-327.<br />5. <em>British journal of urology</em>. 1990;66(6):639-641.<br />6. <em>J Med Food</em>. 2019;22(6):551-559.<br />7. <em>J Tradit Complement Med</em>. 2019;9(2):138-142.<br />8. <em>Planta Med</em>. 2019<br />9. <em>Arch Ital Urol Androl</em>. 2016;88(2):136-43.<br />10. <em>Urol Int</em>. 2015;94(3):286-95.</p>"
