;	000000000300080248	;	"	<p><strong>Xcellent A 3000</strong> provides an excellent source of supplemental vitamin A. Vitamin A is a fat-soluble vitamin necessary for growth, bone development, vision, hormone receptor function, cellular health, immune function, and the integrity of epithelial and mucosal surfaces.*</p>"
;	000000000300081092	;	"	<p><strong>Xcellent A 7500</strong> provides an excellent source of supplemental vitamin A. Vitamin A is a fat-soluble vitamin necessary for growth, bone development, vision, hormone receptor function, cellular health, immune function, and the integrity of epithelial and mucosal surfaces.*</p>"
;	000000000300005326	;	"	<p><strong>Xcellent C™</strong> is a high-potency vitamin C formula with the addition of 7.5 mg of BioPerine<sup>®</sup> per capsule. BioPerine, a proprietary black pepper extract, is present to promote absorption and bioavailability of vitamin C. Vitamin C provides valuable antioxidant protection and is necessary for the production of collagen, an integral component of blood vessels, tendons, ligaments, and bone. This essential water-soluble vitamin is required for the synthesis of neurotransmitters and carnitine as well. Xcellent C contains buffering minerals to help prevent potential stomach upset.*</p>"
;	000000000300005329	;	"	<p> <strong>Xcellent E™</strong> features EVNol SupraBio™ full-spectrum palm tocopherol/tocotrienol complex. Tocotrienols provide unique health benefits, and EVNol SupraBio’s enhanced absorption technology has shown a 250% increase in tocotrienol absorption rates in<br />humans. Xcellent E enables superior absorption and provides more comprehensive vitamin E benefits than tocopherol-only products.*</p> <p> </p>"
;	000000000300005330	;	"	<p><strong>XenoProtX<sup>™</sup></strong> is a comprehensive formula designed to support phase I and phase II liver detoxification of environmental pollutants, endocrine disruptors, estrogen metabolites, xenoestrogens, and other toxins. XenoProtX also supports antioxidant activity throughout the detoxification process. Micronutrients, phytonutrients, and activated cofactors provide additional support for energy production, cellular protection, and liver function during crucial metabolic biotransformation processes.*</p>"
;	000000000300005341	;	"	<p><strong>XymoBolX<sup>™</sup></strong> features a patented blend of amino acids formulated to promote muscle protein synthesis. Whether your goal is to provide building blocks for muscle strength and function or boost muscle recovery after exercise, XymoBolX provides a researched combination and ratio of amino acids to support your muscle health.* <br /><br /></p> <p>1. Protected by US patent 9,364,463</p>"
;	000000000300005340	;	"	<p><strong>XymoBolX™</strong> features a patented blend of amino acids1 formulated to promote muscle protein synthesis. Whether your goal is to provide building blocks for muscle strength and function or boost muscle recovery after exercise, XymoBolX provides a researched combination and ratio of amino acids to support your muscle health.*</p>"
;	000000000300005342	;	"	<p><strong>XymoDine™ </strong>is a superior iodine formulation created to enhance thyroid support and offer long-term, consistent results. XymoDine contains the ideal balance of potassium iodide and molecular iodine (I<sub>2</sub>).*</p>"
;	000000000300000052	;	"	<p><strong>XymoZyme<sup>®</sup></strong> is a cost-effective, non-prescription, broad-spectrum, digestive enzyme formula suitable for vegans and designed to support the digestion of fat, protein, carbohydrate, fiber, and lactose. This comprehensive formula contains lipase, proteases, alpha-galactosidase, hemicellulase, papain, lactase, and other key digestive enzymes. XymoZyme works in a wide pH range—unlike porcine pancreatin, which works in a narrow pH range.*</p>"
;	000000000300005343	;	"	<p><strong>XymoZyme<sup>®</sup></strong> is a cost-effective, non-prescription, broad-spectrum, digestive enzyme formula suitable for vegans and designed to support the digestion of fat, protein, carbohydrate, fiber, and lactose. This comprehensive formula contains lipase, proteases, alpha-galactosidase, hemicellulase, papain, lactase, and other key digestive enzymes. XymoZyme works in a wide pH range—unlike porcine pancreatin, which works in a narrow pH range.*</p>"
;	000000000300101587	;	"	<p><strong>XymoZyme<sup>®</sup> HCL</strong> combines key ingredients to aid each phase of digestion. This formula is designed for individuals who can benefit from comprehensive digestive support or who experience unpleasant after-meal symptoms associated with digestion.*</p>"
;	000000000300090141	;	"	<p>A unique homeopathic profile for symptoms associated with vaginal yeast infections.</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li>Unique homeopathic combination specific for symptoms associated with vaginal yeast infections: Borax, Sepia, Berberis aquifolium and Kreosotum.</li> <li>Features an all-natural herbal and cocoa butter base, free of parabens and PEG.</li> <li>Foil wrapped suppositories are easy to use, sterile and soothing.</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300096642	;	"	<ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li>Unique homeopathic combination specific for symptoms associated with vaginal yeast infections: Borax, Sepia, Berberis aquifolium and Kreosotum.</li> <li>Features an all-natural herbal and cocoa butter base, free of parabens and PEG.</li> <li>Foil wrapped suppositories are easy to use, sterile and soothing.</li> </ul>"
;	000000000300094454	;	"	<p>Each of our Zen products start with a classic combination of gamma-aminobutyric acid (GABA) and Suntheanine® L-theanine. Zen Adapt is enhanced with Sensoril<sup>®</sup>, a pure water extract of ashwagandha, an Ayurvedic herb well known for its ability to help the body function under stress.* GABA and L-theanine can help balance the parasympathetic nervous system.* Sensoril<sup>®</sup> helps to alleviate the physical, emotional, and mental effects of stress and tension by interacting with the HPA axis.* Together this combination helps support a healthy response to stress, healthy moods, and a feeling of calm, focused relaxation during the day or night.*</p>"
;	000000000300094455	;	"	<p>Each of our Zen products start with a classic combination of gamma-aminobutyric acid (GABA) and Suntheanine® L-theanine. Zen Sleep is enhanced with pyridoxal-5-phosphate (P5P), the coenzyme form of vitamin B6, and L-5-hydroxytryptophan (5-HTP), the precursor to serotonin and melatonin. This combination helps promote a relaxed state and provides the necessary factors for the body to produce melatonin, supporting normal, healthy sleep.*</p>"
;	000000000300086336	;	"	<p>Zero Sugar Curcumin Gummies offer 200 mg of highly bioavailable Longvida<sup>®</sup> Optimized Curcumin per serving, providing natural support for nervous system, cardiovascular, joint, and immune health.<sup>*</sup> These delicious mango-flavored gummies help maintain a healthy response to inflammation by neutralizing free radicals, addressing metabolic stress, and promoting antioxidant pathways throughout the body.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300096401	;	"	<p>Delicious, zero-sugar gummy chews with research-backed borage oil and biotin for healthy hair and skin.*</p> <p>Combining highly concentrated omega-6 GLA with biotin (vitamin B7), these hair and skin gummies support health at the cellular level, with no excess sugar.*</p>"
;	000000000300091092	;	"	<p>Delicious kids gummy multivitamin with zero grams of sugar for ages 4+</p> <p>Zero Sugar Kids Multi Gummies are packed with essential vitamins and minerals to help make the challenge of good nutrition a little easier—and tastier—for kids and parents. These gummies provide 18 nutrients, including zinc, and vitamins A, C, D and E, to support growth and development during the early years and beyond.*</p>"
;	000000000300086337	;	"	<p>Zero Sugar Melatonin Gummies help remediate the effects of melatonin irregularity and insufficiency to promote healthy sleep patterns and immune functioning without compromising daytime alertness.<sup>*</sup> The average melatonin supplement contains 5 mg, which is far higher than most people need and often leads to morning drowsiness. Featuring smaller, 1.5 mg servings, Melatonin Gummies allow people to adjust their dose according to individual sensitivities and needs. Sweetened by xylitol, these delicious raspberry-flavored gummies contain zero grams of sugar and provide an optimal starting dose of melatonin to help facilitate longer, more restful sleep without morning drowsiness.<sup>*</sup></p>"
;	000000000300098991	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Foundational nutrients for healthy pregnancy and infant development in tasty gummy chews.*</p> <p class=""p1"">Zero Sugar Prenatal DHA Gummy Chews deliver DHA-dominant omega-3 fish oil plus highly absorbable vitamin D3 to support a healthy pregnancy.*</p>"
;	000000000300091094	;	"	<p>Daily dose of vitamin D3 for bone, mood, and immune health in delicious Wild Berry gummies with zero added sugar*</p> <p>Zero Sugar Vitamin D3 Gummies are a delicious way to promote the body’s absorption of calcium and phosphorus, support immune system function, and help regulate mood and sleep rhythms.* A number of biological and environmental risk factors can make it difficult for people to obtain adequate levels of this important vitamin, even when they get enough sun exposure. With 25 mcg (1000 IU) of vitamin D per serving and a great Wild Berry flavor, these gummies make it easy to get enough daily vitamin D3.</p>"
;	000000000300103482	;	"	<p>High sodium (ancient sea salt) electrolyte drink mix containing coconut water, 500mg potassium, 80mg magnesium, 100 mg concentrace. Sodium is essential for nerve and muscle function and is involved in the regulation of fluids in the body. Sodium also plays a role in the body’s control of blood pressure and volume.</p>"
;	000000000300085556	;	"	<p class=""p1"">Zinc + Vitamin C Chewable, is a great-tasting dietary supplement to help you maintain healthy levels of zinc and vitamin C in your body.<sup>†</sup></p> <p class=""p1"">Zinc is a necessary trace element that helps support a healthy immune system, participates in over 100 enzyme reactions, and supports healthy growth and development.† Vitamin C is an essential vitamin that helps boost the immune system and has strong antioxidant properties.†</p> <p class=""p1"">We’ve married these two important nutrients together to create our <strong>Zinc + Vitamin C Chewable</strong>, a great-tasting dietary supplement to help you maintain healthy levels of zinc and vitamin C in your body.†</p>"
;	000000000300089662	;	"	<p>This form of zinc is well-tolerated and well-absorbed.* Zinc is a trace mineral that is involved in more than 300 enzyme reactions in the body and is an essential metal cofactor for one kind of superoxide dismutase (SOD), a major class of antioxidant enzymes.* Zinc is an important nutrient for a normal, health immune response, tissue formation, cognitive function, and a balanced mood.*</p>"
;	000000000300005344	;	"	<p><strong>Zinc Glycinate</strong> is a fully reacted, proprietary TRAACS<sup>®</sup> amino acid chelate formulated for enhanced absorption. As an essential mineral, zinc serves catalytic, structural, and regulatory functions in the body. Zinc ultimately supports immune and neurological function, growth, taste acuity, nutrient metabolism, and reproductive health.*</p>"
;	000000000300090413	;	"	<p>When zinc deficiency was discovered in the 1960s, researchers found how essential this trace mineral is for health! Zinc may support the following:</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li> <p class=""p1"">Immunity†</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Digestion†</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Male Reproduction†</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Human Development†</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Skin†</p> </li> <li> <p class=""p1"">Eye Health†</p> </li> </ul> <p>Chew 2 gummies daily alone or at mealtime. Store in a cool, dry place, away from direct sunlight. Gummies may stick together in warmer climates, but this does not affect the potency, quality, or efficacy of the product.</p>"
;	000000000300090798	;	"	<p>Key Benefits and Actions*</p> <ul style=""list-style-type: disc;""> <li>Supportive cofactors may help support optimal zinc metabolism*</li> <li>May help support a healthy immune system*</li> <li>May help support healthy eyes and skin*</li> <li>May help support normal growth and development*</li> </ul> <p><strong>Optimal Zinc Lozenge by Seeking Health provides 15 mg of TRAACS<sup>®</sup> zinc bisglycinate</strong><strong> chelate in an easy-to-use chewable format.</strong> Zinc may help support normal cell growth and a healthy immune system. It is an essential mineral that activates more than 70 enzymes within the human body, including those that assist with protein synthesis.*</p> <p>Optimal Zinc Lozenge uses TRAACS<sup>®</sup> Zinc Bisglycinate Chelate, a gentle, well-tolerated form of zinc. Each tablet can be easily broken into smaller pieces for greater dosage control. These tablets use only xylitol and natural flavors - no artificial sweeteners or colors.*</p>"
;	000000000300088158	;	"	<p>Zinc promotes a healthy immune response and supports many other healthy bodily functions. Our Zinc Lozenges provide quality zinc in a pleasant, citrus-orange-flavored lozenge.</p> <p>Zinc is necessary for the activity of over 300 enzymes, which promote biochemical reactions in your body. It's also essential for the formation of superoxide dismutase, an important free radical scavenger. Zinc also promotes taste sensitivity and protein synthesis.<sup>1-5</sup></p> <p>Zinc promotes a healthy immune response, and may contribute to age-related decline in immune function in aging adults.<sup>6-8</sup> That’s why maintaining healthy levels of zinc plays a critical role in supporting healthy immune function at any age.</p> <p> </p> <p><strong>References:</strong><br />1. LPI. Zinc. Accessed 05/20/19.<br />2. <em>Endocrine</em>. 2014;45(2):178-89.<br />3. <em>The Journal of Clinical Investigation</em>. 2013;123(10):4136-4139.<br />4. <em>PLOS ONE</em>. 2014;9(1):e83944.<br />5. <em>Consult Pharm</em>. 2016;31(5):267-70.<br />6. <em>Pathobiol Aging Age Relat Dis</em>. 2015;5:25592.<br />7. <em>J Trace Elem Med Biol</em>. 2015;29:24-30.<br />8. <em>Autoimmun Rev</em>. 2015;14(4):277-85.</p>"
;	000000000300088277	;	"	<p>Zahler Zinc+Elderberry Lozenges is a bioactive Zinc supplement which provides 25 mg of Zinc along with Elderberry in a great-tasting elderberry-flavored chewable lozenge. Zinc is a trace mineral essential for many bodily functions and processes including proper growth and immune function. It is also an antioxidant, meaning it helps protect healthy cells from the potentially damaging effects of free radicals. Elderberry is long-known for its immune-boosting and antioxidant properties.</p>"
;	000000000300088734	;	"	<p>This form of zinc is well-tolerated and well-absorbed.* Zinc is a trace mineral that is involved in more than 300 enzyme reactions in the body and is an essential metal cofactor for one kind of superoxide dismutase (SOD), a major class of antioxidant enzymes.* Zinc is an important nutrient for a normal, health immune response, tissue formation, cognitive function, and a balanced mood.*</p>"
;	000000000300085706	;	"	<p class=""p1""><strong>Zinc</strong> plays a critical role in immune function, healthy cell growth, and a healthy inflammatory response, so you want to make sure a zinc deficiency isn’t affecting your health.*</p> <p class=""p1""><strong>Selenium</strong> is another mineral that may be just as important as zinc for healthy cells and overall health support.* However, when it comes to supplements, not all selenium supplements are the same.</p>"
;	000000000300086719	;	"	<p><span style=""font-size: 10pt;"">Zinc plays a critical role in immune function, healthy cell growth, and a healthy inflammatory response, so you want to make sure a zinc deficiency isn’t affecting your health.<sup>*</sup> Selenium is another mineral that may be just as important as zinc for healthy cells and overall health support.<sup>*</sup> However, when it comes to supplements, not all selenium supplements are the same. Because supplementing with any type of zinc can reduce your copper, an important micronutrient, we’ve added a very small amount of copper to our Zinc Plus Selenium.</span></p>"
;	000000000300084785	;	"	<p>Zinc SAP contains a highly absorbable form of zinc, called zinc picolinate.* Zinc is a mineral that is essential in both innate and adaptive immune function.* Zinc is also important to maintain connective tissue formation, intestinal health, and healthy skin.* In addition, metabolism of carbohydrates, fat, and proteins to form red blood cells relies on zinc for proper function.* Long-term supplementation of high doses of zinc can result in copper deficiency, which is why a small dose of copper is included in Zinc SAP to prevent potential deficiency.*</p>"

